4	Eth Zurich Excellence Scholarship Opportunity Programme Esop	Eropa	Luar Negeri (Swiss)	S2	Beasiswa - ETH Zurich - Excellence Scholarship & Opportunity Programme (ESOP) untuk jenjang S2 dengan tipe Fully Funded di Switzerland	30 November 2026	Fully Funded	Matematika, Ilmu Alam Terapan, Teknik Sipil, Ilmu Material dan Teknik, Keuangan, Ekonomi, Perpajakan, Akuntansi, Keuangan Kuantitatif, Statistika, Makroekonomi	Beasiswa mencakup biaya hidup dan studi sebesar CHF 12.000 per semester serta pembebasan biaya kuliah selama durasi program Master (3–4 semester).	Persyaratan meliputi kemampuan bahasa Inggris minimal IELTS 7 atau TOEFL iBT 100, serta dokumen seperti CV, ijazah dan transkrip, paspor, sertifikat bahasa, dan proposal awal tesis, tanpa batasan usia maupun IPK.	Schoters	https://www.schoters.com/id/beasiswa/eth-zurich-excellence-scholarship-opportunity-programme-esop-5	https://ethz.ch/students/en/studies/financial/scholarships/excellencescholarship.html	[-0.025283813,0.013504028,0.04714966,-0.00071811676,-0.015686035,-0.011054993,-0.011024475,0.051757812,-0.011070251,-0.032196045,0.018203735,-0.049346924,-0.026504517,0.017288208,0.011009216,0.05621338,-0.005847931,-0.020462036,-0.040374756,0.036743164,-0.0054893494,-0.018539429,-0.028640747,0.03338623,0.060180664,-0.04876709,0.022354126,0.0095825195,-0.010810852,0.0045166016,0.04486084,-0.010726929,0.009857178,-0.0072746277,-0.026473999,0.035003662,-0.008781433,-0.0004553795,-0.0018186569,-0.024719238,-0.013572693,-0.017349243,0.0044555664,-0.014549255,0.03894043,-0.002248764,-0.0077438354,0.00021076202,0.005214691,0.041656494,0.029846191,-0.025665283,0.035583496,0.020645142,-0.010658264,0.009063721,0.012168884,0.0063476562,-0.05392456,-0.0011644363,0.05987549,0.02268982,0.008087158,0.040496826,-0.015174866,-0.03149414,-0.050079346,-0.0143585205,-0.011955261,0.02583313,0.018539429,0.02557373,0.06573486,-0.012069702,0.0015830994,0.037384033,0.0010433197,-0.0036201477,0.0010986328,0.024246216,-0.043182373,-0.02027