5	Southern Taiwan University Of Science And Technology The Stust Scholarship For International Students	Asia	Luar Negeri (Taiwan)	S3	Beasiswa - Southern Taiwan University of Science and Technology - The STUST Scholarship for International Students untuk jenjang S3 dengan tipe Fully Funded di Taiwan	30 November 2026	Fully Funded	Teknik Elektro, Teknik Elektronika, Teknik Mekatronika, Mekatronika, Manajemen Bisnis	Beasiswa mencakup pembebasan biaya kuliah penuh, fasilitas asrama, serta tunjangan bulanan sebesar 10.000 TWD, dengan ketentuan tunjangan dapat dihentikan sementara jika penerima berada di luar negeri lebih dari 16 hari.	Persyaratan meliputi kemampuan bahasa Inggris minimal IELTS 5 atau TOEFL iBT 63, serta kemampuan bahasa Mandarin (HSK Level 4), dan dokumen seperti ijazah, transkrip, surat rekomendasi, rencana studi, autobiografi, serta sertifikat bahasa.	Schoters	https://www.schoters.com/id/beasiswa/southern-taiwan-university-of-science-and-technology-the-stust-scholarship-for-international-students-6	https://oia.stust.edu.tw/en/node/scholarships	[-0.054504395,0.0039253235,0.013679504,-0.015106201,0.008033752,-0.014465332,-0.006210327,0.055847168,-0.01977539,-0.026245117,-0.0016021729,0.00048828125,-0.060058594,-0.0014839172,0.027160645,0.02420044,-0.017868042,-0.031234741,-0.033172607,0.030593872,0.011680603,0.003358841,0.0015096664,-0.02557373,0.049346924,-0.041656494,0.009742737,-0.04473877,-0.0423584,-0.0056266785,0.005886078,-0.02848816,-0.030303955,-0.0023651123,-0.038848877,0.064453125,0.013191223,-0.0051574707,-0.009254456,-0.042633057,0.011276245,-0.035125732,-0.014572144,-0.019439697,0.020339966,0.025177002,-0.005908966,0.038391113,-0.0109939575,0.039367676,-0.004360199,-0.029693604,0.0234375,0.046905518,0.006614685,0.02848816,0.019485474,-0.010643005,0.0012283325,-0.026062012,0.05126953,0.014312744,0.021057129,0.008239746,0.015464783,-0.007598877,-0.0015897751,0.030822754,-0.020309448,0.01210022,0.010421753,0.024749756,0.04937744,-0.0151901245,0