10	Chang Gung University Cgu Scholarships For International Doctoral Students	Asia	Luar Negeri (Taiwan)	S3	Beasiswa - Chang Gung University - CGU Scholarships for International Doctoral Students  untuk jenjang S3 dengan tipe Partially Funded, Fully Funded di Taiwan	25 September 2026	Fully Funded	Ilmu Biomedis, Pencitraan Medis, Pencitraan Biomedis dan Ilmu Radiologi, Rehabilitasi, Keperawatan, Fisioterapi, Teknik Material, Teknik Biomedis, Teknik Elektro, Teknik Elektronika, Ilmu Komputer dan Teknik Informatika, Teknik Mesin, Manajemen	Beasiswa mencakup tunjangan bulanan sekitar NTD 30.000, tambahan hingga NTD 12.000 untuk mahasiswa berprestasi, serta pembebasan biaya kuliah untuk program PhD mulai tahun ketiga, dengan biaya kredit sekitar NTD 3.813 per semester. Tersedia tambahan beasiswa NTD 2.000–12.000 atau NTD 7.000 per bulan berdasarkan skor GRE atau lulusan universitas top QS 500.	Persyaratan meliputi kemampuan bahasa Inggris minimal IELTS 6 atau TOEFL iBT 69, kemampuan bahasa Mandarin (HSK Level 4), serta skor GRE minimal 160, dan dokumen seperti formulir pendaftaran, paspor, ijazah, transkrip, surat rekomendasi, serta bukti rekening dan dokumen tambahan sesuai program.	Schoters	https://www.schoters.com/id/beasiswa/chang-gung-university-cgu-scholarships-for-international-doctoral-students-12	https://www.cgu.edu.tw/recruit_intl/Contents?nodeId=17604	[-0.06161499,0.019744873,0.037719727,0.022415161,-0.022750854,-0.042419434,-0.017288208,0.04724121,-0.06185913,-0.046875,-0.021438599,-0.0022029877,-0.027359009,0.017562866,0.013031006,0.023773193,-0.01222229,-0.038513184,0.0056991577,0.061462402,0.0037555695,0.010803223,0.027572632,-0.011520386,0.011878967,-0.05606079,0.012893677,-0.02684021,-0.031188965,-0.012313843,0.023498535,-0.0033664703,-0.0034885406,-0.015853882,-0.05368042,0.058013916,-0.022201538,0.041931152,-0.0052986145,-0.048614502,-0.0039634705,-0.033843994,-0.016571045,-0.009849548,0.033996582,-0.014091492,0.00021767616,-0.0085372925,-0.020004272,0.