11	Chang Gung University Cgu Scholarships For International Master S Students	Asia	Luar Negeri (Taiwan)	S2	Beasiswa - Chang Gung University - CGU Scholarships for International Master's Students untuk jenjang S2 dengan tipe Fully Funded di Taiwan	25 September 2026	Fully Funded	Ilmu Biomedis, Pencitraan Medis, Pencitraan Biomedis dan Ilmu Radiologi, Rehabilitasi, Keperawatan, Fisioterapi, Teknik Material, Teknik Biomedis, Teknik Elektro, Teknik Elektronika, Ilmu Komputer dan Teknik Informatika, Teknik Mesin, Kedokteran Seluler dan Molekuler, Ilmu Kedokteran Gigi, Farmasi, Pendidikan Anak Usia Dini, Terapi Okupasi, Bisnis, Kecerdasan Buatan, Teknik Nano-Energi	Beasiswa mencakup pembebasan biaya kuliah, asrama gratis, serta tunjangan bulanan sekitar NT$6.000 dengan tambahan hingga NT$12.000, termasuk peluang beasiswa tambahan berdasarkan skor GRE (NTD 2.000–12.000).	Persyaratan meliputi kemampuan bahasa Inggris minimal IELTS 5 atau TOEFL iBT 61, kemampuan bahasa Mandarin (HSK Level 4), serta skor GRE minimal 160, dan dokumen seperti formulir pendaftaran, ijazah, transkrip, paspor, serta surat rekomendasi.	Schoters	https://www.schoters.com/id/beasiswa/chang-gung-university-cgu-scholarships-for-international-master-s-students-13	https://www.cgu.edu.tw/recruit_intl/Contents?nodeId=17605	[-0.05911255,0.029464722,0.04559326,0.019485474,-0.036010742,-0.034423828,-0.018295288,0.046051025,-0.03955078,-0.032836914,-0.010925293,-0.008003235,-0.033477783,0.030548096,0.006580353,0.02204895,-0.0107421875,-0.041748047,-0.012031555,0.056549072,0.0008249283,0.010955811,0.011978149,-0.014724731,0.017150879,-0.06286621,0.009994507,-0.029052734,-0.041931152,-0.014877319,0.02607727,-0.006427765,0.0018348694,-0.015914917,-0.047546387,0.049804688,-0.015350342,0.035949707,-0.02166748,-0.06011963,-0.00086021423,-0.0340271,-0.018692017,0.002521515,0.028701782,-0.00015747547,-0.0084991455,-0.0072135925,-0.019882202,0.020187378,-0.022705078,-0.013198853,0.005104065,0.042175293,0.009231567,0.0479