19	Saf Engineering Scholarship Female Applicants	Eropa & Amerika	Luar Negeri (Inggris, Amerika Serikat)	S1	Beasiswa - SAF Engineering Scholarship - Female Applicants untuk jenjang S1 dengan tipe Fully Funded di United Kingdom, United States	31 Agustus 2026	Fully Funded	Teknik	Beasiswa mencakup gaji bulanan selama masa studi, pembiayaan penuh biaya kuliah dan biaya akademik, tunjangan kebutuhan hidup (buku, pakaian, komputer), tiket pesawat pulang-pergi, serta pendanaan untuk program pertukaran musim panas, dengan durasi hingga 4 tahun termasuk program Master jika berlaku.	Persyaratan meliputi hasil akademik seperti A-Level, International Baccalaureate, atau Diploma Politeknik dengan prestasi, serta dokumen seperti catatan kegiatan ekstrakurikuler dan kepemimpinan, tanpa syarat usia maupun kemampuan bahasa Inggris.	Schoters	https://www.schoters.com/id/beasiswa/saf-engineering-scholarship-female-applicants-25	https://www.rsaf.gov.sg/careers/scholarships-and-sponsorships/saf-engineering-scholarship/	[0.006286621,0.010154724,0.04849243,0.024627686,-0.031829834,0.0022716522,-0.018829346,0.02923584,0.00024092197,0.010154724,0.009811401,-0.057800293,-0.024642944,0.0096588135,0.02468872,0.038513184,0.0012645721,-0.015556335,-0.032348633,-0.005092621,0.021514893,0.02053833,0.017623901,-0.011489868,0.032440186,-0.05014038,0.013961792,-0.034210205,-0.04324341,-0.009666443,0.0413208,-0.021453857,-0.012413025,0.021316528,0.0071754456,0.05883789,0.017440796,-0.028305054,-0.01285553,-0.049621582,-0.00522995,-0.045532227,-0.017181396,-0.004875183,0.03491211,0.044830322,0.012313843,-0.0008330345,-0.0016794205,0.04638672,-0.019607544,-0.018585205,0.052490234,0.02519226,0.014640808,0.0690918,0.023834229,-0.011947632,0.014152527,-0.0047416687,0.03652954,0.022949219,-0.016433716,0.0063209534,0.020446777,-0.02519226,-0.04397583,0.048828125,-0.020767212,0.008407593,0.025772095,0.011817932,0.039855957,-0.0041236877,-0.015670776,0.007949829,0.020355225,0.060455322,-0.0043029785,-0.015319824