25	Daad Helmut Schmidt Programme Universit T Duisburg Essen Master Of Development And Governance	Eropa	Luar Negeri (Jerman)	S2	Beasiswa - DAAD Helmut-Schmidt-Programme - Universität Duisburg Essen, Master of Development and Governance untuk jenjang S2 dengan tipe Fully Funded di Germany	31 Juli 2026	Fully Funded	Pemerintahan, Hubungan Internasional, Administrasi Publik, Kebijakan Publik	Beasiswa mencakup tunjangan bulanan sekitar €934 untuk program Master di Jerman, asuransi kesehatan, biaya perjalanan, dana studi dan penelitian, subsidi tempat tinggal serta tunjangan keluarga jika berlaku, serta kursus bahasa Jerman hingga 6 bulan sebelum studi.	Persyaratan meliputi kemampuan bahasa Inggris minimal IELTS 6 atau TOEFL iBT 80 (atau setara), serta dokumen seperti formulir pendaftaran DAAD, surat motivasi, CV format kronologis, dan dokumen akademik sesuai ketentuan program.	Schoters	https://www.schoters.com/id/beasiswa/daad-helmut-schmidt-programme-universit-t-duisburg-essen-master-of-development-and-governance-31	https://www.daad.de/en/studying-in-germany/scholarships/daad-funding-programmes/helmut-schmidt-programme/	[-0.015037537,0.020507812,0.06488037,0.007293701,-0.005355835,-0.016540527,-0.016937256,0.049224854,-0.01399231,-0.012084961,0.00068616867,-0.08300781,-0.010559082,-0.047668457,0.026321411,0.030090332,-0.028335571,-0.0017719269,-0.009773254,0.059020996,0.04421997,0.0042381287,-0.02255249,0.015594482,0.0552063,-0.062072754,0.03390503,-0.02230835,0.014663696,-0.04458618,-0.013061523,-0.024291992,0.0289917,0.033203125,-0.008415222,0.05126953,0.009094238,-0.0015468597,-0.023712158,-0.0085372925,-0.044067383,-0.04916382,-0.019195557,0.031921387,0.017410278,0.0023651123,-0.0035057068,0.02053833,0.027542114,0.035949707,0.0022201538,-0.025131226,0.045288086,0.027938843,-0.0034618378,0.018035889,0.041259766,-0.03137207,0.021713257,-0.013046265,0.051208496,0.017120361,0.000854969,0.027664185,-0.019515991,-0.036224365,-0.029327393,0.014793396,-0.016830444,-0.0148162