45	Tamkang University Entrance Scholarship For Students From Indonesia	Asia	Luar Negeri (Taiwan)	S1	Beasiswa - Tamkang University - Entrance Scholarship for Students from Indonesia  untuk jenjang S1 dengan tipe Fully Funded di Taiwan	4 Juni 2026	Fully Funded	All Majors	Beasiswa mencakup pembiayaan penuh biaya kuliah dan biaya administrasi (tuition dan miscellaneous fees), dengan kemungkinan perpanjangan setiap tahun berdasarkan prestasi akademik dan perilaku mahasiswa.	Persyaratan meliputi kemampuan bahasa Inggris minimal IELTS 4 atau TOEFL iBT 57 (atau setara), serta kelulusan akademik dengan nilai rata-rata minimal 70 untuk S1 atau 80 untuk S2, disertai perilaku baik tanpa catatan pelanggaran dan dokumen seperti paspor, transkrip, serta ijazah yang telah diverifikasi.	Schoters	https://www.schoters.com/id/beasiswa/tamkang-university-entrance-scholarship-for-students-from-indonesia-53	https://www.oieie.tku.edu.tw/oieie/?page_id=20970	[-0.050354004,-0.01525116,0.037750244,0.034423828,-0.0069084167,-0.008934021,-0.0012454987,0.052886963,-0.026031494,-0.02357483,0.0005764961,-0.013366699,-0.0016355515,0.002462387,0.0061416626,0.0035152435,0.0013780594,-0.00919342,-0.0395813,0.04043579,0.003742218,0.0047454834,0.0109939575,-0.0058670044,0.03137207,-0.041931152,0.0036067963,-0.025344849,-0.03414917,-0.017318726,0.040161133,-0.017501831,-0.013137817,-0.0017280579,-0.0546875,0.06970215,0.012535095,-0.0042304993,-0.0003798008,-0.09161377,-0.0075531006,-0.0013380051,-0.0078086853,-0.012428284,0.0027809143,0.014053345,-0.018066406,0.009880066,-0.023468018,0.022735596,-0.017730713,-0.020996094,0.032196045,0.051727295,-0.0049209595,0.06713867,0.02671814,0.005382538,0.010757446,-0.033294678,0.01939392,0.019500732,-0.0006494522,-0.010002136,-0.0050697327,-0.036499023,-0.009780884,0.00019717216,-0.014480591,0.012161255,0.027420044,0.015640259,0.010940552,-0.036743164,0.0051956177,0.034729004,-0.0036754608,0.03717041,0.009208679,0.00737381,-0.015975952,0.0022945404,-0.011039734,-0.