30	Peking University Beijing Government Scholarship For International Students Undergraduate Program Without Written Examin	Asia	Luar Negeri (China)	S1	Beasiswa - Peking University - Beijing Government Scholarship for International Students  - Undergraduate Program Without Written Examination (Chinese Taught) untuk jenjang S1 dengan tipe Fully Funded di China	10 Juli 2026	Fully Funded	Matematika, Fisika, Astronomi, Kimia, Ilmu Lingkungan, Perencanaan Kota, Geology, Geophysics, Psikologi, Ilmu Biologi, Ilmu Komputer, Electronic Information Engineering, Teknik, Ekonomi, Engineering Mechanics, Energy Engineering, Teknik Lingkungan, Teknik Dirgantara, Teknik Biomedis, Materials Science and Engineering, Teknik Robotika, Administrasi Bisnis, Hukum, Administrasi Publik, Jurnalistik, Studi Komunikasi, International Politics, Sosiologi, Sistem Informasi, Manajemen Informasi, Information Management and Information System, Chinese Language, Sejarah, History & Archeology, Filsafat, Humanities	Beasiswa mencakup pembebasan biaya kuliah penuh, asrama, asuransi kesehatan, serta tunjangan biaya hidup bulanan (Type A). Tersedia juga skema lain yang memberikan pembebasan biaya kuliah dan fasilitas terbatas sesuai tipe beasiswa (Type B dan C).	Persyaratan meliputi usia 18–25 tahun, kemampuan bahasa Mandarin minimal HSK Level 6, serta nilai tes standar seperti SAT minimal 1400 atau ACT 30 (atau setara), serta dokumen identitas, paspor, dan bukti kewarganegaraan.	Schoters	https://www.schoters.com/id/beasiswa/peking-university-beijing-government-scholarship-for-international-students-undergraduate-program-without-written-examination-chinese-taught-36	https://isd.pku.edu.cn/en/detail.php?id=816	[-0.03967285,-0.0073280334,0.051940918,0.015792847,-0.0053749084,-0.008613586,-0.04147339,0.055725098,-0.01537323,-0.025924683,-0.019424438,-0.019104004,-0.029403687,0.014579773,0.0014104843,0.023834229,-0.009841919,-0.011260986,-0.025970459,0.046722412,0.02053833,-0.0047836304,-0.0030727386,-0.0123