31	Feng Chia University Fcu International Student Scholarship	Asia	Luar Negeri (Taiwan)	S1, S2, S3	Beasiswa - Feng Chia University - FCU International Student Scholarship untuk jenjang S1, S2, S3 dengan tipe Partially Funded di Taiwan	8 Juli 2026	Partially Funded	Administrasi Bisnis, International Business, Foreign Language, Literature, Teknik Mesin, Teknik Komputer, Teknik Dirgantara, Acoustical Engineering, Green Energy Management, Applied Mathematics, Biophotonics, Logistic Management, Ilmu Material dan Teknik, Industrial and System Engineering, Teknik Kimia, Environmental Science and Engineering, Teknik Elektro, Information Engineering, Ilmu Komputer, Aeronautical Engineering, Civil Infrastructure Engineering	Beasiswa berupa bantuan biaya pendidikan sebesar NT$20.000 hingga NT$120.000 untuk tahun akademik pertama, yang diberikan setelah proses registrasi dan pemilihan mata kuliah, dan dicairkan dalam dua semester.	Persyaratan meliputi kemampuan bahasa Inggris minimal IELTS 5 atau TOEFL iBT 61 (atau setara), serta dokumen seperti foto, formulir pendaftaran, paspor atau identitas, ijazah dan transkrip akademik yang telah diterjemahkan jika diperlukan, tanpa batasan usia maupun IPK.	Schoters	https://www.schoters.com/id/beasiswa/feng-chia-university-fcu-international-student-scholarship-37	https://oia.fcu.edu.tw/en/overseas-students/scholarship/	[-0.06829834,-0.014480591,0.050842285,0.03881836,0.025772095,-0.015960693,-0.024642944,0.04159546,-0.014793396,-0.012779236,-0.015701294,0.0076141357,-0.056762695,0.012145996,0.002412796,0.045410156,0.0030269623,-0.035614014,-0.03540039,0.0101623535,-0.0101623535,-0.015838623,-0.0007138252,-0.0039520264,0.022598267,-0.056884766,0.023132324,-0.034362793,-0.035064697,-0.024108887,0.0335083,-0.018920898,-0.007633209,0.0052337646,-0.06951904,0.095581055,-0.013008118,0.012031555,-0.01638794,-0.053100586,-0.028564453,-0.008605957,-0.017410278,-0.024887085,0.0066490173,0.0070114136,-0.01687622,0.050445557,-0.006122589,0.011802673,-