34	Queensland University Of Technology Qut Excellence Scholarship Academic	Australia/Oseania	Luar Negeri (Australia)	S1	Beasiswa - Queensland University of Technology - QUT Excellence Scholarship (Academic) untuk jenjang S1 dengan tipe Partially Funded di Australia	30 Juni 2026	Partially Funded	Arsitektur, Bisnis, Komunikasi, Creative Industries, Desain, Teknik, English Language and Literature, Ilmu Kesehatan, Teknologi Informasi, Hukum dan Keadilan, Hukum, Matematika, Ilmu Data, Sains, Pendidikan	Beasiswa tersedia dalam beberapa skema, yaitu $30.000 untuk semua jurusan atau khusus Fakultas Sains dan Teknik, serta $10.000 untuk semua jurusan. Dana diberikan sebagai tunjangan studi hingga $5.000 per semester dengan durasi hingga 3 tahun atau $2.500 per semester selama 4 semester, tergantung skema yang diterima.	Persyaratan meliputi kemampuan bahasa Inggris minimal IELTS 7 atau TOEFL iBT 79 (atau setara), serta kualifikasi akademik seperti International Baccalaureate (IB), tanpa batasan usia maupun IPK.	Schoters	https://www.schoters.com/id/beasiswa/queensland-university-of-technology-qut-excellence-scholarship-academic-40	https://www.qut.edu.au/study/fees-and-scholarships/scholarships/excellence-scholarship-academic	[-0.03314209,0.021621704,0.04977417,0.02180481,-0.01158905,-0.0021648407,-0.040802002,0.01184845,-0.026626587,-0.022262573,0.014419556,-0.03503418,-0.03970337,0.0070343018,0.030212402,0.02407837,0.0068626404,-0.007835388,-0.0055732727,0.050323486,0.011528015,-0.03463745,-0.017471313,0.009437561,0.026321411,-0.004398346,-0.0071525574,-0.025039673,-0.009666443,-0.0036411285,0.03717041,-0.025100708,0.028259277,-0.010467529,-0.03152466,0.04107666,-0.00274086,-0.018371582,0.002067566,-0.05633545,-0.0034694672,-0.049560547,0.021896362,0.0041122437,0.015235901,0.03677368,-0.01247406,0.030090332,-0.0309906,0.03527832,-0.016281128,-0.010574341,0.02998352,0.02671814,-0.013877869,0.027389526,-0.0008864403,0.0029296875,0.028137207,-0.04727173,0.042785645,0.04296875,0.