39	Universiti Teknologi Petronas Utp Graduate Assistantship Scheme Ga	Asia	Luar Negeri (Malaysia)	S2	Beasiswa - Universiti Teknologi Petronas - UTP Graduate Assistantship Scheme (GA)​ untuk jenjang S2 dengan tipe Partially Funded di Malaysia	30 Juni 2026	Partially Funded	Kimia, Teknik Elektro, Teknik Mesin, Teknik Robotika, Teknik Komputer, Teknik Kimia, Ilmu Material dan Teknik, Teknik Lingkungan, Ilmu Komputer, Sistem Informasi, Teknologi Informasi, Manajemen Bisnis	Beasiswa mencakup biaya kuliah (hanya Research Progression Fee), pembiayaan kegiatan penelitian, serta tunjangan hidup bulanan sekitar RM1,300–RM1,800 untuk mahasiswa riset penuh waktu, dengan tambahan tugas akademik dan kewajiban penelitian.	Persyaratan meliputi status mahasiswa riset penuh waktu, kemampuan bahasa Inggris minimal IELTS 6 atau TOEFL (atau setara), serta nilai akademik minimal GPA 3.0/4.0, dan dokumen seperti paspor, transkrip akademik, sertifikat bahasa Inggris, serta dokumen pendukung lainnya.	Schoters	https://www.schoters.com/id/beasiswa/universiti-teknologi-petronas-utp-graduate-assistantship-scheme-ga-45	https://www.utp.edu.my/Pages/Admission/Postgraduate/Local-Applicants/FAQ.aspx	[-0.08898926,0.037750244,0.04458618,0.010467529,-0.004623413,-0.03866577,-0.024993896,0.03024292,-0.0033855438,0.0011405945,-0.012924194,-0.013244629,-0.025436401,-0.024917603,-0.00349617,0.004722595,-0.004825592,-0.017807007,-0.041137695,0.017623901,-0.024551392,-0.018966675,0.0005245209,-0.017456055,0.011154175,-0.05328369,0.0062408447,-0.009384155,-0.034210205,0.021972656,0.027770996,-0.030700684,-0.020050049,-0.01626587,0.04135132,0.067871094,0.013954163,-0.013122559,-0.02053833,-0.032073975,-0.0079574585,-0.010047913,0.004558563,0.0093688965,0.00674057,-0.0014591217,-0.011604309,0.03515625,0.023117065,-0.008605957,-0.013893127,-0.029037476,0.035949707,0.04458618,7.647276e-05,-0.019378662,0.009414673,-0.03668213,0.017349243,-0.012367249,0.032989502,0.021133423,0.03201294,0.013847351,-0.008384705,-0.01