49	Daad Epos Sustainable Development Management Hs Rhein Waal	Eropa	Luar Negeri (Jerman)	S2	Beasiswa - DAAD EPOS - Sustainable Development Management - HS Rhein-Waal untuk jenjang S2 dengan tipe Fully Funded di Germany	1 Juni 2026	Fully Funded	Sustainable Development	Beasiswa memberikan tunjangan bulanan sekitar 992 euro, mencakup asuransi kesehatan, kecelakaan, dan tanggung jawab pribadi, serta bantuan biaya perjalanan. Tidak ada biaya kuliah karena universitas di North Rhine-Westphalia tidak memungut tuition fee.	Persyaratan meliputi kemampuan bahasa Inggris minimal IELTS 7 atau TOEFL iBT 94 (atau setara), kemampuan bahasa Jerman minimal DSH 1, serta nilai akademik minimal GPA 2.5/4.0, disertai dokumen seperti CV, surat motivasi, surat rekomendasi, dan formulir aplikasi.	Schoters	https://www.schoters.com/id/beasiswa/daad-epos-sustainable-development-management-hs-rhein-waal-57	https://www.hochschule-rhein-waal.de/en/faculties/society-and-economics/degree-programmes/sustainable-development-management-ma/epos	[-0.014381409,0.016082764,0.058624268,0.011100769,0.0012664795,-0.008430481,-0.023376465,0.041107178,0.0047569275,-0.003118515,0.0013933182,-0.06933594,-0.02973938,-0.018035889,0.02355957,0.039855957,-0.0072898865,0.009681702,-0.040618896,0.061065674,0.034362793,0.004306793,-0.023284912,0.0007362366,0.055023193,-0.072753906,0.017807007,-0.026809692,0.010803223,-0.029571533,-0.0005259514,-0.023742676,0.033203125,0.015853882,-0.023788452,0.034454346,0.0016298294,-0.0068359375,-0.017303467,-0.020309448,-0.03640747,-0.047576904,-0.016357422,-0.0052223206,-0.006996155,0.03930664,-0.014587402,0.038330078,0.03086853,0.021438599,0.013626099,-0.0051460266,0.05014038,0.01234436,0.00019776821,0.0015335083,0.051239014,0.0007100105,-0.010688782,-0.015342712,0.091918945,0.04623413,-0.002910614,0.010803223,-0.03353882,-0.014968872,-0.0024662018,0.00472641,-0.05114746,0.0023784637,0.022201538,0.0075912476,0.04888916,-0.047302246,-0.035186768,-0.005466461,-0.013717651,0.0295410