51	Hong Kong Baptist University Admission Scholarship Scheme For Overseas Applicants	Asia	Luar Negeri (Hong Kong)	S1	Beasiswa - Hong Kong Baptist University - Admission Scholarship Scheme for Overseas Applicants untuk jenjang S1 dengan tipe Partially Funded di Hong Kong	31 Mei 2026	Partially Funded	Matematika, Statistika, Kimia, Ilmu Alam Terapan, Bioteknologi, Studi Pertanian, Ilmu Biomedis, Farmasi, Hukum dan Studi Hukum, Bahasa dan Sastra, Studi Komunikasi, Studi Budaya dan Agama, Filsafat, Seni Rupa, Musik, Seni Visual, Akuntansi, Ilmu Komputer, Sistem Informasi, Administrasi Bisnis, Studi Lingkungan Umum, Hubungan Internasional	Beasiswa tersedia dalam beberapa tingkat bantuan yaitu Full Scholarship (HK$210,000), Tuition-waiver Scholarship (HK$160,000), dan Half Scholarship (HK$105,000), yang dapat diperbarui selama masa studi normal dengan syarat prestasi akademik yang baik.	Persyaratan meliputi kemampuan bahasa Inggris minimal IELTS 6 atau TOEFL iBT 79 (atau setara), serta nilai akademik seperti SAT 1190, ACT 23, IB, atau A-Level, disertai dokumen seperti ijazah SMA, transkrip, dan sertifikat bahasa Inggris.	Schoters	https://www.schoters.com/id/beasiswa/hong-kong-baptist-university-admission-scholarship-scheme-for-overseas-applicants-59	https://admissions.hkbu.edu.hk/content/ao/en.html?Error_Source=https://admissions.hkbu.edu.hk/content/ao/en/en/scholarships.html	[-0.0680542,-0.013320923,0.053588867,0.05734253,-0.0138549805,-0.05267334,-0.031677246,0.06048584,-0.036895752,0.0034275055,-0.00844574,0.0069122314,-0.044128418,0.0028381348,0.008735657,0.030944824,-0.011726379,0.0003592968,-0.0035820007,0.04437256,0.0021820068,-0.04284668,0.028564453,0.021911621,0.033111572,-0.06329346,0.020492554,-0.037384033,-0.009284973,-0.0062332153,0.040985107,-0.026351929,0.0015964508,0.028823853,-0.01802063,0.07489014,0.013267517,-0.007320404,-0.024871826,-0.07873535,0.005126953,-0.020858765,-0.02458191,-0.00705719,-0.009895325,0.062164307,-0.023208618,-0.008720398,-0.0347900