68	Nagoya University Of Commerce Business Nucb Nucb Tuition Reduction Scholarship	Asia	Luar Negeri (Jepang)	S1	Beasiswa - Nagoya University of Commerce & Business (NUCB) - NUCB Tuition Reduction Scholarship untuk jenjang S1 dengan tipe Partially Funded di Japan	22 Januari 2026	Partially Funded	Administrasi Bisnis	Beasiswa memberikan bantuan sebesar 900,000 JPY, 600,000 JPY, atau 300,000 JPY per tahun sesuai tipe beasiswa, dengan pembayaran setelah mahasiswa resmi masuk dan dapat diperpanjang hingga 4 tahun berdasarkan kinerja akademik.	Persyaratan meliputi dokumen paspor, surat rekomendasi, rencana keuangan, serta bukti kemampuan bahasa Inggris minimal IELTS 6 atau TOEFL iBT 75 (atau setara), tanpa batasan usia atau IPK.	Schoters	https://www.schoters.com/id/beasiswa/nagoya-university-of-commerce-business-nucb-nucb-tuition-reduction-scholarship-78	https://www.nucba.ac.jp/en/scholarship/scholar.html	[-0.06451416,0.012466431,0.051452637,0.042297363,-0.0014152527,-0.036499023,-0.041168213,0.07336426,0.023742676,-0.01940918,0.008491516,-0.00077295303,-0.017944336,-0.025238037,0.0039978027,0.030807495,-0.002670288,-0.008132935,0.019042969,0.027236938,0.025604248,0.0087890625,-0.0048446655,-0.012542725,0.06524658,-0.044647217,0.002243042,-0.01689148,0.018310547,-0.043029785,0.03918457,-0.018508911,-0.004272461,0.030517578,-0.06439209,0.01889038,0.02204895,-0.019561768,0.00724411,-0.031082153,-0.039794922,-0.022766113,0.026809692,-0.010238647,0.017578125,0.07446289,-0.019165039,0.012771606,0.0075416565,0.027130127,-0.019638062,-0.019760132,0.030395508,0.010734558,-0.03665161,0.027954102,0.0473938,0.028671265,0.011886597,-0.032318115,0.032806396,-0.017196655,0.010253906,0.018585205,0.010032654,-0.012771606,0.0053749084,0.006362915,-0.03765869,-0.0030460358,0.0030918121,0.02746582,0.038879395,-0.03842163,0.02017212,0.046722412,0.0016841888,0.02609253,0.030426025,0.016540527,-0.02330017,0.020965576,-0.031219482,0.003282547,0.02468872,-0.007896423,-0.05770874,0.01436615,-0.0695