72	Wuhan University Academic Non Degree Students Freshman Scholarship	Asia	Luar Negeri (China)	S1	Beasiswa - Wuhan University - Academic/ Non-degree Students Freshman Scholarship untuk jenjang S1 dengan tipe Partially Funded di China	15 Mei 2026	Partially Funded	Administrasi Bisnis, Transportation and Logistics Management, Manajemen Sumber Daya Manusia, Pemasaran, Akuntansi, Manajemen Keuangan, Keuangan, International Economics and Trade, Software Engineering, Bachelor of Medicine and Bachelor of Surgery, Geographic Information Systems, Ilmu Lingkungan	Beasiswa memberikan dana satu kali sebesar 4,000 RMB untuk mahasiswa S1, 6,000 RMB untuk S2, dan 8,000 RMB untuk S3, yang diberikan setelah mahasiswa resmi terdaftar pada semester pertama.	Persyaratan meliputi usia 18–25 tahun, dokumen paspor, ijazah dan transkrip akademik, bukti kemampuan bahasa, serta pernyataan pribadi atau rencana studi sesuai jenjang pendidikan, tanpa batasan IPK.	Schoters	https://www.schoters.com/id/beasiswa/wuhan-university-academic-non-degree-students-freshman-scholarship-84	https://admission.whu.edu.cn/info/1271/1671.htm	[-0.07043457,0.010673523,0.05126953,0.04864502,-0.005268097,-0.045837402,-0.013626099,0.058685303,-0.018600464,-0.0035877228,-0.010498047,-0.0011081696,-0.051513672,0.009651184,-0.009918213,0.026763916,-0.006389618,-0.0030212402,-0.025863647,0.037139893,0.012664795,0.023834229,0.0008177757,-0.0021076202,0.032226562,-0.060821533,0.005065918,-0.04473877,-0.012641907,-0.006576538,0.027816772,-0.0049552917,-0.0044784546,0.02619934,-0.042938232,0.05731201,-0.0137786865,-0.0034999847,0.009223938,-0.04309082,0.007881165,-0.033721924,-0.006401062,-0.02267456,0.020111084,0.031433105,-0.030059814,0.0033721924,-0.0027103424,0.022415161,-0.005092621,-0.0013055801,0.06665039,0.009803772,0.02017212,0.04736328,0.070495605,-0.00090646744,0.0014266968,-0.03302002,0.06555176,-0.0069236755,-0.0010643005,0.024139404,-0.0052604675,-0.03466797,-0.01386261,0.0009899139,-0.00052547455,0.0012283325,0