75	Inha University Scholarship System For Freshman Students Sgcs Students	Asia	Luar Negeri (Korea Selatan)	S1	Beasiswa - Inha University - Scholarship System for Freshman Students (SGCS Students) untuk jenjang S1 dengan tipe Partially Funded, Fully Funded di South Korea	13 Mei 2026	Fully Funded	Bisnis, Teknik, Korean Language	Beasiswa Korea memberikan skema pembiayaan penuh atau parsial berdasarkan kombinasi skor TOEFL/IELTS dan TOPIK, termasuk full tuition waiver, tunjangan bulanan 300,000 KRW, dan fasilitas asrama untuk performa tertinggi.	Persyaratan meliputi TOPIK minimal level 3, IELTS atau TOEFL dengan skor tinggi (bervariasi sesuai tingkat beasiswa), serta dokumen akademik lengkap seperti ijazah, transkrip, sertifikat bahasa, dan dokumen pendukung lainnya tanpa batasan usia atau IPK.	Schoters	https://www.schoters.com/id/beasiswa/inha-university-scholarship-system-for-freshman-students-sgcs-students-90	https://internationalcenter.inha.ac.kr/internationalcenter/9987/subview.do	[-0.041290283,0.013290405,0.03744507,0.040283203,0.0023021698,-0.045959473,-0.028549194,0.026306152,-0.0034484863,-0.019332886,0.011558533,-0.017303467,-0.02848816,-0.025726318,0.017654419,-0.01852417,0.00062036514,-0.011459351,-0.017456055,0.059906006,0.009933472,0.004558563,-0.00039219856,0.03164673,0.05178833,-0.062561035,0.017532349,-0.03189087,-0.027618408,0.0011138916,0.050567627,-0.008422852,-0.011726379,-0.047088623,-0.0368042,0.052459717,0.0076293945,-0.005630493,-0.009880066,-0.06072998,-0.0055236816,-0.00043988228,-0.0128479,-0.009590149,0.0061149597,0.087402344,-0.002576828,0.00957489,-0.015716553,0.038116455,-0.018508911,0.011985779,0.049804688,0.027557373,0.0017766953,0.058441162,0.029220581,0.015029907,-0.0063476562,-0.022537231,0.05609131,0.017608643,0.012619019,0.012466431,-0.017303467,-0.020019531,-0.02406311,0.024093628,-0.036102295,0.010238647,0.008522034,0.03161621,0.020339966,-0.03765869,-0.041625977,0.03314209,-0.027893066,0.042907715,0.038238525,0.04324341,-0.01051