79	Chulalongkorn University Ise Scholarship For Foreign Students	Asia	Luar Negeri (Thailand)	S1	Beasiswa - Chulalongkorn University - ISE Scholarship for Foreign Students untuk jenjang S1 dengan tipe Fully Funded, Partially Funded di Thailand	1 Mei 2026	Fully Funded	Teknik Nano-Energi, Teknik Dirgantara, Information Engineering, Communication Engineering, Automotive Engineering, Mechanical Design and Manufacturing and Automation, Teknik Robotika, Kecerdasan Buatan	Beasiswa mencakup biaya kuliah penuh atau sebagian, biaya program, tiket pesawat pulang-pergi, tunjangan bulanan, akomodasi, dan asuransi kesehatan.	Persyaratan meliputi usia maksimal 25 tahun, kemampuan bahasa Inggris minimal IELTS 6 atau TOEFL iBT 80 (atau setara), serta dokumen seperti transkrip akademik, sertifikat kesehatan, hasil tes standar (ACT/SAT/IB), dan dokumen tambahan sesuai jalur aplikasi (tes atau portofolio).	Schoters	https://www.schoters.com/id/beasiswa/chulalongkorn-university-ise-scholarship-for-foreign-students-97	nan	[-0.04434204,0.015670776,0.048797607,0.01638794,0.036315918,-0.03048706,-0.009063721,0.018554688,-0.052825928,0.0135269165,-0.02078247,-0.03149414,-0.04321289,0.010375977,0.014404297,0.022537231,0.0016145706,-0.003993988,-0.030822754,0.02456665,0.035949707,0.004558563,-0.011474609,-0.010444641,0.060333252,-0.030349731,0.010787964,-0.016723633,-0.009010315,-0.014770508,0.029632568,-0.013801575,-0.021118164,-0.01574707,-0.025222778,0.04711914,-0.0013198853,0.015464783,-0.00919342,-0.048461914,-0.018676758,-0.006668091,0.00390625,0.0034599304,-0.01939392,0.032470703,0.004310608,0.028900146,0.016647339,0.026321411,-0.012794495,-0.030212402,0.057006836,0.056793213,0.026367188,0.040496826,0.05203247,0.006629944,-0.018417358,-0.038909912,0.06744385,0.010765076,0.00060272217,0.008003235,0.009414673,-0.008285522,-0.024398804,0.011489868,-0.022079468,0.015602112,0.017944336,-0.010658264,0.018920898,-0.039123535,0.017074585,0.03189087,0.009414673,0.012329102,0.016220093,0.020874023,