84	Southern University Of Science And Technology Sustech International Undergraduate Scholarship	Asia	Luar Negeri (China)	S1	Beasiswa - Southern University of Science and Technology (SUSTECH) - International Undergraduate Scholarship untuk jenjang S1 dengan tipe Fully Funded di China	30 April 2026	Fully Funded	Matematika, Statistika, Fisika, Kimia, Ilmu Alam Terapan, Ilmu Biologi, Bioteknologi, Teknik Elektro, Teknik Mesin, Teknik Robotika, Teknik Dirgantara, Teknik Umum, Ilmu Material dan Teknik, Teknik Lingkungan, Keuangan, Ilmu Komputer, Teknologi Informasi, Manajemen Sumber Daya Alam, Studi Lingkungan Umum	Beasiswa President Scholarship memberikan pendanaan sebesar 68,400 RMB per tahun yang mencakup biaya kuliah, asrama, asuransi, dan biaya hidup selama 4 tahun, dengan syarat prestasi akademik tetap baik. Terdapat juga beasiswa lain sebesar 30,000 RMB per tahun untuk pembebasan biaya kuliah.	Persyaratan meliputi nilai rata-rata minimal 85%, usia minimal 18 tahun, kemampuan bahasa Inggris minimal IELTS 6 atau TOEFL iBT 75 (atau setara), serta dokumen akademik lengkap, paspor, dan surat rekomendasi tanpa batasan IPK.	Schoters	https://www.schoters.com/id/beasiswa/southern-university-of-science-and-technology-sustech-international-undergraduate-scholarship-102	https://infoadmin.sustech.edu.cn/tabcontent?xxlmm=8,9	[-0.040893555,-0.010955811,0.030517578,0.01133728,0.013916016,-0.025650024,0.0073280334,0.053527832,-0.0075645447,-0.006126404,0.0012292862,0.009651184,-0.06488037,0.0181427,0.028137207,0.025253296,-0.035308838,-0.015083313,-0.029785156,0.006778717,0.0031814575,-0.0025901794,0.0129852295,-0.033050537,0.051086426,-0.061309814,0.012825012,-0.04385376,-0.043060303,0.013580322,0.0013875961,-0.023040771,-0.025131226,-0.017654419,-0.008636475,0.0625,-0.0026550293,0.010871887,0.010246277,-0.05529785,0.01184845,-0.022262573,-0.023147583,0.0017213821,0.02659607,0.020629883,0.0031929016,0.0068626404,-0.03086853,0.053710938,-0.00048661232,-0.022079468,0.05392456,0.057