85	Australia Awards Scholarship	Australia/Oseania	Luar Negeri (Australia)	S2	Beasiswa - Australia Awards Scholarship untuk jenjang S2 dengan tipe Fully Funded di Australia	30 April 2026	Fully Funded	Studi Pertanian, Kelautan / Kehutanan, Akuakultur, Kesehatan Masyarakat, Teknik Komputer, Teknik Sipil, Teknik Pertambangan dan Perminyakan, Hukum dan Studi Hukum, Studi Komunikasi, Studi Budaya dan Agama, Ekonomi, Administrasi Bisnis, Manajemen Bisnis, Pemasaran, Manajemen Sumber Daya Manusia, Manajemen Organisasi, Manajemen Rantai Pasok dan Logistik, Industrial Management, Information, Perubahan Iklim, Studi Lingkungan Umum, Pendidikan Bahasa, Pendidikan Umum, Pemerintahan, Hubungan Internasional, Kebijakan Publik, Ilmu Politik	Beasiswa Australia Awards mencakup biaya kuliah penuh, tunjangan hidup, tiket pesawat, asuransi kesehatan, biaya awal kedatangan, pelatihan pra-keberangkatan, serta berbagai tunjangan akademik dan profesional selama studi.	Persyaratan meliputi usia tanpa batas, IPK minimal 2.9/4.0, kemampuan bahasa Inggris minimal IELTS 6 atau TOEFL iBT 80 (atau setara), serta dokumen seperti CV, ijazah, transkrip akademik, sertifikat bahasa, dan bukti kewarganegaraan.	Schoters	https://www.schoters.com/id/beasiswa/australia-awards-scholarship-103	https://www.dfat.gov.au/people-to-people/australia-awards/australia-awards-scholarships	[-0.044036865,0.023147583,0.056365967,0.018798828,0.016403198,0.00844574,-0.032806396,0.030944824,-0.00037956238,-0.010292053,0.020812988,-0.06530762,-0.039276123,-0.0074157715,0.0063056946,0.027908325,0.0037841797,-0.013908386,-0.026016235,0.057250977,-0.010093689,-0.0026397705,-0.031311035,-0.0067100525,0.029846191,-0.055755615,0.0066604614,-0.00605011,-0.012290955,-0.025100708,0.022125244,-0.029464722,-0.0047416687,0.0056648254,-0.04269409,0.037719727,0.008880615,-0.048675537,-0.0039901733,-0.057861328,-0.02079773,-0.041748047,0.024642944,-0.010154724,0.027572632,0.03793335,-0.010093689,-0.0013341904,-0.00039815903,0.041168213,-0.