99	The Chinese University Of Hong Kong Shenzhen Scholarship	Asia	Luar Negeri (China)	S1	Beasiswa - The Chinese University Of Hong Kong, Shenzhen Scholarship untuk jenjang S1 dengan tipe Fully Funded, Partially Funded di China	17 April 2026	Fully Funded	Ekonomi, Akuntansi, Akuntansi Profesional, Keuangan, Global Business Administration, Marketing Communication, Pemasaran, Matematika, Mathematics and Applied Mathematics, Fisika, Kimia, Ilmu Material dan Teknik, New Energy Science and Engineering, Teknik Elektro, Teknik Komputer, English Studies, Bahasa Inggris, Studi Penerjemahan, Psikologi, Psikologi, Ilmu Psikologi, Teknik Biomedis, Bioinformatics, Pharmaceutical Science, Ilmu Biologi, Biologi, Ilmu Data, Data science, Statistika, Statistic and Data Science, Ilmu Komputer, "Computer Science, Teknik, and Artificial Intelligence", Computer Science and Engineering, Musik, Music Studies	Beasiswa mencakup beberapa tingkat bantuan:\n- Honor Scholarship: full tuition + living allowance\n- Full Tuition Scholarship: biaya kuliah penuh\n- Half / Quarter Tuition Scholarship: potongan 50% atau 25% biaya kuliah\nBeasiswa berlaku hingga 4 tahun selama GPA minimal 3.0 dipertahankan.	Persyaratan meliputi IELTS minimal 7.0 atau TOEFL iBT 80, tanpa batas usia atau IPK, serta seleksi berbasis akademik, kemampuan bahasa Inggris, dan wawancara. Standardized test (SAT/IB/ACT/A-Level) bersifat opsional. Dokumen mencakup transkrip, sertifikat akademik, prestasi, dan dokumen pendukung lainnya.	Schoters	https://www.schoters.com/id/beasiswa/the-chinese-university-of-hong-kong-shenzhen-scholarship-119	https://admissions.cuhk.edu.cn/en/page/50	[-0.055786133,-0.0032424927,0.045410156,0.059814453,0.009109497,-0.018493652,-0.013038635,0.05883789,-0.025177002,-0.02230835,-0.011459351,0.0065994263,-0.035858154,0.016815186,0.021896362,0.039855957,-0.010551453,-0.00166893,-0.010292053,0.030288696,0.009719849,-0.015571594,0.0047187805,0.007724762,0.018112183,-0.06573486,0.008033752,-0.044403076,0.00877