e medical insurance.\n• The duration of the scholarship is equivalent to duration of study, and is specified in the admission letter.	AGE Max Age: 25 GPA No GPA requirement ENGLISH TEST IELTS: min. 6 TOEFL iBT: min. 80 NATIONALITY Indonesian OTHER LANGUAGE HSK: HSK Level 5 STANDARDIZED TEST Standardized Test (Required)\nCSCA DOCUMENTS Electronic Application Form for Shandong University Scholarship (signed and scanned) other university admission documents: 1. Personal information page of the passport (regular personal passport valid beyond October 31, 2024). 2. High school diploma or pre-graduation certificate (the pre-graduation certificate must be stamped with the school seal, indicating the expected graduation date, and the graduation certificate must be obtained before September 2024). 3. Transcript of all high school courses (stamped with the school seal). 4. Letter of motivation in Chinese or English. Applicants should follow the template provided by our university (please download the template from: https://www.istudy.sdu.edu.cn/info/1267/3338.htm). Applicants for Chinese-taught programs should write in Chinese,	Schoters	https://www.schoters.com/id/beasiswa/shandong-university-scholarship-for-outstanding-international-students-151	https://www.sdu.edu.cn/	[-0.029159546,-0.018661499,0.03555298,0.06262207,0.0066070557,-0.0071754456,-0.016784668,0.024337769,-0.021820068,-0.021072388,-0.031921387,-0.019546509,-0.03744507,-0.0020103455,-0.0034446716,0.036621094,-0.023468018,-0.023223877,-0.014884949,0.036499023,0.06866455,0.0049705505,0.016998291,-0.0015516281,0.051239014,-0.07824707,0.034484863,-0.01234436,-0.0027599335,-0.015640259,0.01171875,-0.0060768127,-0.021118164,0.001080513,-0.0340271,0.068359375,0.0020313263,0.016571045,-0.03375244,-0.07556152,-0.0025424957,-0.004032135,-0.008026123,-0.018173218,-0.018875122,0.0262146,0.006465912,-0.03010559,-0.002149582,0.020843506,-0.02909851,0.007987976,0.05154419,0.032592773,0.024398804,0.035949707,0.025222778,0.018890