138	University Of Luxembourg Guillaume Dupaix International Master S Scholarship	Eropa	Luar Negeri (Luxembourg)	S2	Beasiswa - University of Luxembourg - Guillaume Dupaix International Master’s Scholarship untuk jenjang S2 dengan tipe Partially Funded di Luxembourg	31 Maret 2026	Partially Funded	Mathematics and Applied Mathematics, Matematika, Mathematical Finance, Computing, Ilmu Komputasi, Ilmu Material dan Teknik, Fisika, Teknik Lingkungan, Sistem Informasi, Ilmu Komputer, Molecular Sciences, Ilmu Biomedis, Ilmu Data, Teknik Sipil, Desain Produk, Keamanan Siber, Cybersecurity	• The stipend amounts to €10,000 per academic year for up to two years.\n• Part of the scholarship is used to fund the student’s accommodation in a university residence for the duration of the Master programme, up to a maximum of €650/month for a maximum of two years.\n• The scholarship is subject to performance evaluation and may be withheld, for example in the event of academic misconduct, poor academic performance or withdrawal from the Master’s programme.\n• Tuition fees are not included in the scholarship.\n• The scholarship cannot be cumulated with any other type of grant financed by the Luxembourg government, or a similar scholarship funded by a private sponsor.	AGE No age requirement GPA No GPA requirement ENGLISH TEST IELTS: min. 7 TOEFL iBT: min. 92 NATIONALITY Indonesian OTHER LANGUAGE Not required STANDARDIZED TEST Not required DOCUMENTS An identity photo A copy of your identity card or passport A copy of your European health insurance card (both sides); non-EU students can obtain this card by paying a fee when they arrive in Luxembourg A copy of your university degree certificate (please check the eligibility criteria to find out more about the criteria for your specific situation) A translation of the diploma if it is in a language other than English, French or German A detailed transcript of all the grades obtained for your Bachelor’s degree If you obtained your degree from a country that is not a Member State of the European Union, a copy of the recognition or accreditation of your most advanced qualification (this document is requested after you have been accepted at the University) A language certificate for all teaching languages u	Schoters	https://www.schoters.com/id/beasiswa/university-of-luxembourg-guillaume-dupaix-international-master-s-scholarship-169	https://www.uni.lu/en/mobility/outgoing-student-mobility/scholarships/	[-0.037628174,-0.013442993,0.060791016,0.03488159,-0.024383545,-0.017425537,-0.026367188,0.045074463,-0.0034599304,-0.03274536,-0.042510986,-0.027893066,-0.046325684,-0.0152282715,0.025024414,0.058563232,0.004386902,0.007247925,-0.027496338,0.053100586,0.02810669,-0.04083252,-0.0017080307,0.007537842,0.02835083,-0.06744385,0.030059814,-0.027328491,-0.0027980804,-0.0024642944,0.054260254,-0.025848389,0.014350891,0.018539429,-0.040222168,0.063964844,0.0012207031,0.011482239,-0.012138367,-0.050933838,-0.043273926,-0.007598877,-0.009887695,0.008598328,0.01701355,0.03955078,-0.00070858,0.010063171,-0.02041626,0.057617188,0.01436615,-0.010986328,0.03955078,0.03881836,-0.009971619,0.015449524,0.011680603,-0.018798828,-0.0013580322,0.0039749146,0.037231445,0.02960205,0.057617188,0.0022010803,-0.034088135,-0.019470215,-0.00011855364,0.022232056,0.005405426,0.0068511963,0.011436462,0.036743164,0.08831787,-0.02432251,-0.007965088,0.03050232,0.00762558,0.056396484,0.024993896,0.008026123,-0.045166016,-0.019485474,-0.0104522705,-0.007019043,-0.039093018,-0.01083374,-0.031234741,-0.025039673,-0.024719238,-0.021133423,-0.009361267,-0.022781372,-0.07678223,0.03466797,0.025283813,-0.011154175,-0.01309967,-0.016098022,-0.021896362,0.06427002,0.0018224716,-0.05303955,0.044921875,-0.066711426,0.0625,-0.019134521,-0.009925842,-0.004371643,0.041107178,0.0063323975,-0.12225342,0.033477783,0.02178955,0.0069236755,0.014350891,-0.08062744,0.0006799698,-0.025741577,-0.007545471,-0.020126343,0.00059843063,0.049438477,0.019500732,-0.04797363