151	National Library Board Nlb Scholarship	Asia, Eropa, Amerika, Afrika, Australia / Oceania	Luar Negeri (Korea Selatan, Hong Kong, New Zealand, Arab Saudi, Afrika Selatan, Inggris, Amerika Serikat, Australia, Taiwan, Jepang, Korea, Belanda, Jerman, Swiss, Singapura, Malaysia, Turki, Kanada, Perancis, Qatar, China, Swedia, Belgia, Austria, Norwegia, Denmark, Finlandia, Italia, Spanyol, Portugal, Brasil, Meksiko, Rusia, Hungaria, Yunani, Irlandia)	S1	Beasiswa - National Library Board (NLB) Scholarship untuk jenjang S1 dengan tipe Fully Funded di United Arab Emirates, Austria, Australia, Belgium, Brazil, Canada, Switzerland, Chile, China, Germany, Denmark, Spain, Finland, France, United Kingdom, Greece, Hong Kong, Hungary, Ireland, Italy, Japan, South Korea, Luxembourg, Mexico, Malaysia, Netherlands, Norway, New Zealand, Portugal, Qatar, Russia, Saudi Arabia, Sweden, Singapore, Turkey, Taiwan, United States, South Africa	15 April 2026	Fully Funded	Bisnis, Literature, Digital Humanities and Computational Social Sciences, Chinese Language, Sejarah, Southeast Asian Studies, Information Science and Technology	• This is a fully-funded scholarship with the following value and benefits:\n• Tuition and other compulsory fees\n• Monthly maintenance allowance\n• Other allowance e.g. pre-studies allowance\n• Return airfare (for overseas studies)\n• Opportunity for sponsorship of approved student exchange/summer school programme\n• Internship opportunities	AGE No age requirement GPA No GPA requirement ENGLISH TEST Not required NATIONALITY Indonesian OTHER LANGUAGE Not required STANDARDIZED TEST Standardized Test (Required)\nA-Level, IB DOCUMENTS You would be required to have a good academic and Co-Curricular Activities (CCAs) records, strong leadership qualities, good interpersonal skills and a passion for learning and service You must be a Singapore Citizen or Singapore Permanent Resident who intends to take up Singapore citizenship OTHERS You can choose to do your undergraduate 