174	Daad Epos International Education Management Inema Ph Ludwigsburg Helwan University	Eropa & Afrika	Luar Negeri (Jerman, Mesir)	S2	Beasiswa - DAAD EPOS - International Education Management (INEMA) - PH Ludwigsburg / Helwan University untuk jenjang S2 dengan tipe Fully Funded di Germany, Egypt	15 Maret 2026	Fully Funded	Educational Management, Ilmu Pendidikan	• Depending on academic level, monthly payments of 934 euros for graduates or 1,200 euros for doctoral candidates\n• Payments towards health, accident and personal liability insurance cover\n• Travel allowance, unless these expenses are covered by the home country or another source of funding\n• Under certain circumstances, scholarship holders may receive the following additional benefits:\n• Monthly rent subsidy\n• Monthly allowance for accompanying members of family	AGE No age requirement GPA No GPA requirement ENGLISH TEST IELTS: min. 6 TOEFL iBT: min. 80 Duolingo NATIONALITY Indonesian OTHER LANGUAGE DSH: DSH 1 STANDARDIZED TEST Not required DOCUMENTS 1. Current passport (copy, showing photo page and date of birth). 2. Curriculum vitae (signed and dated). You are obligated to use the Europass form, 3. Letter of motivation (signed and dated). Please use our motivation letter template as a guidance. You can find it here. We expect your letter of motivation to be 1000 words long. Please do not exceed this length. 4. School leaving certificate, e.g. higher education entrance qualification; high school leaving certificate/diploma, GCE A-levels; Abitur/Matura; international baccalaureate, senior school certificate; secondary school final examination. 5. Degree certificates (in English, certified translations if necessary). 6.   Transcript of records of your academic degrees, including grading-scale (in English, certified translations if necessary). 7.	Schoters	https://www.schoters.com/id/beasiswa/daad-epos-international-education-management-inema-ph-ludwigsburg-helwan-university-210	https://www.daad.de/en/infor