171	Taiwan Icdf Scholarship	Asia	Luar Negeri (Taiwan)	S2	Beasiswa - Taiwan ICDF Scholarship untuk jenjang S2 dengan tipe Fully Funded di Taiwan	15 Maret 2026	Fully Funded	Urban Studies, Industri Perhotelan dan Pariwisata, Educational Management, Studi Pertanian, Pertanian, Creative Industries, Farmasi, Health Administration, International Business and Trade, Teknik Sipil, Agricultural Economics, Teknik Industri, Teknik Elektro, Mekatronika, Automation Engineering, Akuakultur, International Health, Manajemen Sumber Daya Manusia, Sistem Informasi, Administrasi Bisnis, International Affairs, International Business, Ilmu Pertanian	• airfare (round-trip): The TaiwanICDF shall arrange your most-direct flights\n• to and from Taiwan with Economy Class tickets.\n• housing:  All students must reside in the student dormitories.\n• tuition: as required by the student’s university\n• credit fees: Credit fees vary with the number of credits registered. Credit fees will also be covered as required by the student’s university.\n• insurance: While in Taiwan, in addition to the mandatory student safety insurance set by the Ministry of Education, each student must be insured for accidental and necessary medical coverage. the TaiwanICDF will cover both\n• your medical insurance (up to a premium of NT$30,000; *life insurance not included) and accidental insurance (up to a premium of NT$2,000,000).\n• textbook costs: Purchasing textbooks as required by the instructors shall be subject to the approval of the director of the student’s institute\n• a monthly allowance\n• Master’s Program: Each student shall receive NT$18,000 per month\n• Ph.D. Program: Each student shall receive NT$20,000 per month	AGE No age requirement GPA No GPA requirement ENGLISH TEST IELTS: min. 7 TOEFL iBT: min. 80 NATIONALITY Indonesian OTHER LANGUAGE Not required STANDARDIZED TEST Not required DOCUMENTS 1. A photocopy of applicant’s passport or other document showing proof of nationality. 2. A photocopy of applican