182	Beijing Normal University Bnu New International Students Scholarship Chinese Taught	Asia	Luar Negeri (China)	S1	Beasiswa - Beijing Normal University - BNU New International Students Scholarship (Chinese Taught) untuk jenjang S1 dengan tipe Fully Funded di China	15 April 2026	Fully Funded	Chinese Language, Chinese Language and Literature, Studi Komunikasi, Filsafat, Sejarah, Pendidikan, Special Education, Educational Technology, Bahasa Inggris, Japanese, Russian Language and Literature, Hukum, Sosiologi, International Economics and Trade, Administrasi Bisnis, Theatre and Film Studies, Media / Digital Media, Seni Rupa, Desain, Musik, Dance, Physical Education, Psikologi, Computer Science and Technology, Kecerdasan Buatan, Mathematics and Applied Mathematics, Statistika, Fisika, Astronomi, Geographical Science, Kimia, Teknik Lingkungan, Environmental Science and Engineering	• 1. Tuition waiver;\n• 2. Provide living stipend during the study period;\n• 3. Provides comprehensive medical insurance;\n• 4. The scholarship duration is equal to the duration of study. (If the awardee postpones his/her graduation, he/she will not be eligible for the scholarship during the extended period of their studies. If the awardee suspends his/her study or leaves the school, his/her scholarship will be terminated.)\n• Students who have been awarded a BNU scholarship must attend an annual review in May each year, which will decide whether they can continue to receive the scholarship. If students fail the annual review the scholarship will be suspended for one year and they will be allowed to attend the annual review again next year. If they are able to pass, they can once more receive the scholarship and attend the next annual review; if they fail, the scholarship will be terminated.	AGE Min Age: 18\nMax Age: 40 GPA No GPA requirement ENGLISH TEST Not required NATIONALITY Indonesian OTHER LANGUAGE HSK: HSK Level 4 STANDARDIZED TEST Standardized Test (Required)\nCSCA DOCUMENTS 1. The original “Beijing Normal University International Undergraduate Students Application Form”. 2. The original document of notarized or the authenticated high school graduation certificate. Graduated applicants should provide the original document of a notarized or authenticated high school graduation certificate. Applicants who apply before graduation should provide the original expected graduation certificate, and bring the original or the notarized high school graduation certificate at the registration. The International Student Office will verify the material. Applicants who fail to provide the materials mentioned above will have their admission revoked. 3. The original/notarized/ authenticated transcript of each year and all courses in high school. 4. Valid China Scholastic Competency A	Schoters	https://www.schoters.com/id/beasiswa/beijing-normal-university-bnu-new-international-students-scholarship-chinese-taught-225	https://iso.bnu.edu.cn/en/Pages?cid=505&pid=205	[-0.04333496,0.008094788,0.034454346,0.021026611,0.0010261536,-0.044067383,-0.025756836,0.04675293,-0.028121948,-0.009216309,-0.019104004,0.015411377,-0.04107666,0.014205933,0.017654419,0.04244995,-0.0357666,0.00017273426,-0.005470276,0.029830933,0.049743652,0.025024414,0.016662598,-0.01625061,0.04815674,-0.062927246,0.041290283,-0.02444458,0.009628296,-0.012001038,0.048339844,-0.007785797,-0.027496338,0.03555298,-0.04348755,0.039855957,0.0044174194,-0.0077781677,0.003698349,-0.0859375,-0.0003812313,-0.030380249,-0.009895325,-0.025466919,-0.008850098,0.06616211,0.021453857,0.018112183,-0.005130768,0.054718018,-0.020812988,0.015182495,0.07556152,0.01701355,0.013442993,0.08001709,0.022140503,0.0035095215,0.0076942444,-0.03074646,0.03125,0.0112838745,-0.009887695,0.044128418,-0.015808105,-0.04385376,-0.0340271,0.015602112,0.0079956055,-0.026031494,0.013679504,0.022109985,0.04815674,-0.02130127,-0.019012451,0.068603516,0.029815674,0.04309082,0.008369446,-0.041137695,-0.049102783,0.0032348633,-0.025894165,-0.00