183	Shizuoka University Asia Bridge Program Abp Scholarship	Asia	Luar Negeri (Jepang)	S2	Beasiswa - Shizuoka University - Asia Bridge Program (ABP) Scholarship untuk jenjang S2 dengan tipe Partially Funded di Japan	13 Maret 2026	Partially Funded	Teknik Informatika, Matematika, Fisika, Kimia, Ilmu Biologi, Geoscience, Teknik Mesin, Electrical and Electronic Engineering, Material Science, Teknik Elektronika, Applied Chemistry, Biochemical Engineering, Bioresources Sciences, Applied Life Science	• For 2026 October admission, maximum 20 students will receive 40,000 JPY per month for the first 12 months. All the applicants will be considered for this additional financial aid, and the 20 students will be selected according to their performance at the entrance examinations (document screening and interview examination).	AGE No age requirement GPA No GPA requirement ENGLISH TEST IELTS TOEFL iBT TOEFL PBT TOEIC TOEFL ITP NATIONALITY Indonesian OTHER LANGUAGE Not required STANDARDIZED TEST Not required DOCUMENTS 1. Application form (- If there is a gap exceeding three months in the academic and work history, a gap explanation is required.) 2. Photo 3. Copy of passport 4. Academic Transcripts of University (undergraduate course) 5. Graduation Certificate/Expected Graduation Certificate, or Bachelor Degree Certificate 6. Certificate(s) of Proficiency of English Language 7. Summary of Graduation Thesis, or Past Research Experience 8. Research Plan Essay 9. Letter of Reference OTHERS No other specific requirements mentioned.	Schoters	https://www.schoters.com/id/beasiswa/shizuoka-university-Asia-bridge-program-abp-scholarship-227	https://www.abp.icsu.shizuoka.ac.jp/	[-0.046417236,0.01348114,0.04144287,0.059631348,-0.0012493134,-0.029449463,-0.02935791,0.033111572,0.0073890686,-0.02696228,0.0062828064,-0.017913818,-0.012908936,0.0052719116,0.003396988,0.020385742,0.028808594,0.0073776245,-0.019073486,0.033050537,-0.01033783,-0.017593384,0.0036010742,-0.010307312,0.046905518,-0.0641