199	Fudan University Shanghai Government Scholarship Class B And International Students Scholarship Bachelor Of Medicine And	Asia	Luar Negeri (China)	S1	Beasiswa - Fudan University - Shanghai Government Scholarship (Class B) and International Students’ Scholarship - Bachelor of Medicine and Bachelor of Surgery (MBBS) (English-taught) untuk jenjang S1 dengan tipe Partially Funded di China	6 Maret 2026	Partially Funded	Medicine, Bachelor of Medicine and Bachelor of Surgery	• 1. Shanghai Government Scholarship (Class B)\n• Two of the most excellent applicants who are finally admitted to the program will be awarded Shanghai Government Scholarship (Class B) and will be exempted from the tuition fee. Applicants will be awarded this scholarship based on their excellent academic performance and the admission evaluation result\n• 2. Fudan University International Students’ Scholarship\n• This scholarship is valid for excellent applicants who would like to study at Fudan University. Applicants will be awarded by the university based on their excellent academic performance and the admission evaluation results	AGE No age requirement GPA No GPA requirement ENGLISH TEST IELTS: min. 7 TOEFL iBT: min. 90 Duolingo PTE Academic NATIONALITY Indonesian OTHER LANGUAGE Not required STANDARDIZED TEST Standardized Test (Required)\nCSCA DOCUMENTS 1. Valid passport identification page (expiry date should be after March 1, 2027) 2. High school diploma 3. High school full transcript 4. CSCA score report 5. English proficiency test result (TOEFL, IELTS, Duolingo, PTE Academic) 6. Two letters of recommendation 7. Guarantee statement (for applicant under 18 years old by September 1, 2026) 8. Nationality and identity documents 9. Proof of non criminal records 10. Statement of Financial Capacity or Financial Support 11. Other supporting documents OTHERS No other specific requirements mentioned.	Schoters	https://www.schoters.com/id/beasiswa/fudan-university-shanghai-government-scholarship-class-b-an