226	Vlir Uos Scholarship Master Of Epidemiology 2 Years University Of Antwerp	Eropa	Luar Negeri (Belgia)	S2	Beasiswa - VLIR-UOS Scholarship - Master of Epidemiology (2 years) - University of Antwerp untuk jenjang S2 dengan tipe Fully Funded di Belgium	28 Februari 2026	Fully Funded	Ilmu Biologi, Nutrition, Keperawatan, Ilmu Kedokteran, Kesehatan Masyarakat	• VLIR-UOS scholarships cover tuition fees, travel, insurance and living expenses (board and lodging).	AGE Max Age: 35 GPA Min. GPA: 3 out of 4.00 ENGLISH TEST IELTS: min. 7 TOEFL iBT: min. 80 NATIONALITY Indonesian OTHER LANGUAGE Not required STANDARDIZED TEST Not required DOCUMENTS Syarat Pendaftaran Universitas Applicants should hold a university-level Bachelor’s degree. This degree should be of an academic nature, as opposed to a technical or professional degree. A degree in Medicine, (Biomedical) Sciences or Public Health gives you a good base for the Master of Epidemiology. However, if you have another academic background and feel that you would benefit from more knowledge in epidemiology, statistics and research methods to strengthen your research, you might be the right candidate as well. Students who are still completing their Bachelor’s degree are also encouraged to apply. They have to submit an official letter in English from their university confirming that they are expected to finalise their Bachelor’s studies at the end of the current academic year. They should also submit	Schoters	https://www.schoters.com/id/beasiswa/vlir-uos-scholarship-master-of-epidemiology-2-years-university-of-antwerp-280	https://www.uantwerpen.be/en/study/programmes/all-programmes/epidemiology/vliruos-scholarships/	[-0.08166504,0.007858276,0.039215088,0.009635925,-0.08972168,0.009941101,-0.008460999,0.03955078,0.004924774,0.005004883,-0.008201599,-0.061035156,-0.016067505,-0.011787415,-0.007724762,0.02166748,0.003932953,0.011787415,-0.041412354,0.044281006,0.0262146,0.0016641617,-0.0059013367,-0.011947632,0.02355957,-0.07440185