205	Eth Zurich Postdoctoral Fellowship Programme	Eropa	Luar Negeri (Swiss)	Tidak Disebutkan	Beasiswa - ETH Zurich Postdoctoral Fellowship programme untuk jenjang Non-Degree dengan tipe Partially Funded di Switzerland	2 Maret 2026	Partially Funded	Matematika, Fisika, Ilmu Kebumian, Kimia, Biologi, Applied Biosciences, Ilmu dan Teknologi Kesehatan, Teknik Elektro, Teknik Sipil, Teknik Lingkungan, Biosystems Engineering, Teknik Mesin, Arsitektur, Teknik Material, Geomatic Engineering, Social Welfare, Ilmu Komputer, Teknologi Informasi, Environmental Systems Science, Ilmu Politik, World Economy	• From 2025, the following salary rates will apply (100%, based on ETH standards)\n• The total rates must be used for budgeting. They include 15.0% social security contributions to be paid by ETH Zurich.\n• ETH Fellows are also entitled to CHF 10,000 per year for research expenses, including travel/mobility allowances and research cost contributions. The budget allocated for travel and research costs may not be used to cover salary costs, and vice versa.	AGE No age requirement GPA No GPA requirement ENGLISH TEST IELTS: min. 7 TOEFL iBT: min. 100 NATIONALITY Indonesian OTHER LANGUAGE Not required STANDARDIZED TEST Not required DOCUMENTS A description of the research project and the specific role and input of the candidate, as well as the way in which the ETH Fellow’s project relates to other research directions in the host group CV of the candidate including lists of publications and a picture, it is important that all dates at least include month and year A short CV of the host professor (2 pages max.) A brief outline of the career goals of the candidate (1 page max.) An invitation letter by the host professor, stating how the candidate is deemed to be excellent If applicable , a certification of the planned date of the defense signed by the advisor or department chair if the doctorate is not yet completed Two external reference letters for the candidate, to be e-mailed directly 