213	Erasmus Mundus Master Of Science In Public Sector Innovation And E Governance Pioneer	Eropa	Luar Negeri (Jerman, Belgia)	S2	Beasiswa - Erasmus Mundus Master of Science in Public Sector Innovation and E-Governance (PIONEER) untuk jenjang S2 dengan tipe Fully Funded di Belgium, Germany, Estonia	1 Maret 2026	Fully Funded	Administrasi Publik, E-Government and E-Governance, Information Systems and Technologies in Governance, Public Management	• The scholarship worths € 1400 per month and is paid between September 2024 and August 2026. It will contribute to the costs incurred by the beneficiary students and shall cover travel, visa, installation and subsistence costs. No payment will be done before the scholars’ arrival and we strongly emphasize the fact candidates and admitted students will have multiple\n• expenses during the preparation of their studies.\n• tuition fee waiver	AGE No age requirement GPA No GPA requirement ENGLISH TEST IELTS: min. 7 TOEFL iBT: min. 100 NATIONALITY Indonesian OTHER LANGUAGE Not required STANDARDIZED TEST Not required DOCUMENTS 1. Diploma(s) and transcript(s) of academic records:all applicants must upload PDF scans of his/her original diploma(s) and original transcript(s) of academic records. If the applicant has not graduated yet at the time of his/her application, a proof of provisional graduation issued by the university and the intermediate official transcript(s) of records should be uploaded. 2. Translation of diploma(s) and transcript(s) of records: if the documents are not in English, French, Dutch or German, these documents are to be translated by a registered translator. These documents must also be certified by the educational institution that issued them or by a national authority. 3. English Proficiency Certificate (or test registration; see ‘Language Requirements’) 4. Letter of motivation: a one-page letter motivat	Schoters	https://www.schoters.com/id/beasiswa/erasmus-mundus-master-of-science-in-public-sector-innovation-an