 'A' Levels (preferably with 11 AUs), polytechnic diploma (preferably with Merit) or equivalent qualifications (e.g. International Baccalaureate or NUS High School diploma) 3. Have applied or be applying for an undergraduate programme at a top overseas university Other requirements: 1. Preference will be given to candidates with experience and notable achievements in science- or math-related projects and activities 2. Male scholars are required to serve National Service prior to commencement of undergraduate studies 3. Applicants are encouraged to sit for the SAT tests to broaden their choices of institutions for their undergraduate educ	Schoters	https://www.schoters.com/id/beasiswa/national-science-scholarship-bs-phd-271	https://www.a-star.edu.sg/scholarships/home/scholarships/national-science-scholarship-(bs-phd)	[-0.0463562,0.025268555,0.014144897,0.052459717,-0.0037975311,-0.018844604,-0.022766113,0.033172607,-0.04107666,-0.000603199,-0.011024475,-0.007881165,-0.026382446,0.016464233,0.035125732,0.005584717,-0.005176544,0.0027160645,0.0010700226,0.023468018,0.046936035,0.0017251968,0.01374054,-0.017578125,0.003921509,-0.062805176,0.06384277,-0.023864746,0.0024681091,-0.007865906,0.020019531,-0.025466919,-0.0038433075,0.02720642,-0.027877808,0.053710938,0.014625549,-0.011222839,-0.011619568,-0.046142578,-0.0014572144,-0.022781372,-0.014144897,0.009529114,-0.011116028,0.032592773,0.003396988,-0.044189453,-0.002117157,0.029830933,0.007331848,0.003255844,0.03842163,0.03567505,0.0126953125,0.040130615,-0.008995056,0.0034694672,0.021118164,-0.020507812,0.056427002,0.027664185,-0.0031490326,0.033721924,0.010147095,-0.0149002075,-0.0040283203,0.040405273,-0.01576233,0.004142761,0.012878418,0.030670166,0.025848389,-0.030090332,-0.025299072,0.015007019,-0.012428284,0.050628662,0.024719238,-0.013420105,-0.045196533,-0.030838013,0.03314209,-0.024810791,-0.026382446,-0.04244995,-0.051849365,-0.074035645,-0.057159424,-0.016708374,-0.01878357,-0.04534912,-0.08557129,0.04129028