229	Erasmus Master Of Science In Sustainable And Innovative Natural Resource Management Sinrem	Eropa	Luar Negeri (Jerman, Swedia, Belgia)	S2	Beasiswa - Erasmus Master of Science in Sustainable and Innovative Natural Resource Management (SINReM) untuk jenjang S2 dengan tipe Fully Funded di Belgium, Germany, Sweden	28 Februari 2026	Fully Funded	Manajemen Sumber Daya Alam, Sustainability Science, Kimia, Teknik Lingkungan, Environmental Management	• The Erasmus Mundus scholarship is a full scholarship that includes the programme participation cost, a monthly allowance and travel costs up to a total of EUR 49,000 for the full 2-year programme. The programme participation cost is included in the scholarship.\n• The student receives EUR 1,000/month allowance as support for housing and general subsistence. European students do not receive this monthly allowance when staying in their home country.\n• A further travel budget of up to EUR 3,000/year (European students: EUR 1000/year) and an instalment fee of EUR 1,000 payment (only for non-European students) is also provided.	AGE No age requirement GPA No GPA requirement ENGLISH TEST IELTS: min. 7 TOEFL iBT: min. 86 TOEFL PBT NATIONALITY Indonesian OTHER LANGUAGE Not required STANDARDIZED TEST Not required DOCUMENTS Diploma Transcript of records Passport Motivation letter CV Two reference letters. OTHERS No other specific requirements mentioned.	Schoters	https://www.schoters.com/id/beasiswa/erasmus-master-of-science-in-sustainable-and-innovative-natural-resource-management-sinrem-283	https://sinrem.eu/	[-0.04727173,0.052215576,0.03152466,0.009269714,-0.040222168,-0.010124207,0.0025615692,0.03878784,-0.0060920715,-0.012702942,0.0115356445,-0.039123535,-0.036071777,0.017364502,-0.0046539307,0.043670654,-0.017562866,0.015930176,-0.011909485,0.06488037,0.0126571655,0.016479492,-0.034332275,0.019195557,0.010726929,-0.044769287,0.027862549,-0.015075684,-0.01637268,-0.029190063,0.047454834,-0.028915405,-0.012031555,0.008407593,0.0059