230	Erasmus European Master In Global Studies Emgs	Asia, Afrika, Eropa	Luar Negeri (Afrika Selatan, Inggris, Jerman, China, India, Belgia, Austria, Denmark, Polandia)	S2	Beasiswa - Erasmus European Master in Global Studies (EMGS) untuk jenjang S2 dengan tipe Fully Funded di Austria, Belgium, China, Germany, Denmark, United Kingdom, India, Poland, South Africa	28 Februari 2026	Fully Funded	Studi Global, International Political Economy, Hubungan Internasional	• Erasmus Mundus Grants:\n• cover all tuition fees and as well as a living allowance of €1,400 per month and basic medical coverage.\n• Erasmus+ Grants\n• Students who do not receive an Erasmus Mundus scholarship and study at one of the European partner universities can apply for an Erasmus+ grant for up to one year amounting to approx. €500-600 per month.\n• This grant can only be provided for the second year in the programme. The application for the grant should be addressed to the first year university.	AGE No age requirement GPA No GPA requirement ENGLISH TEST TOEFL iBT: min. 80 TOEFL PBT TOEFL CBT IELTS: min. 7 CPE CAE NATIONALITY Indonesian OTHER LANGUAGE HSK: HSK Level 1 DSH: DSH 1 STANDARDIZED TEST Not required DOCUMENTS Curriculum vitae in English (1-3 pages) (You may consider using the Europass CV as a template.) Motivation letter in English (1–2 pages). Proof of nationality (e.g. copy of passport) Proof of residence ( can be either provided in the form of a residence certificate issued by the candidate’s municipality OR a certificate from the candidate’s place of work, study, or training issued by the respective institution) High school diploma (secondary school leaving certificate, e.g. Baccalaureate, A Levels) or equivalent (AND certified translation into English, if the document is not issued in English or German) If you have an Ijazah - Sekolah Menengah Atas or Madrasah Aliyah, then we need the following documents: Your school leaving certificate Your national exam results	Schoters	https://www.scho