236	Erasmus Mundus Joint Master Degree In Planetary Geosciences Geoplanet	Eropa	Luar Negeri (Perancis, Italia, Portugal)	S2	Beasiswa - Erasmus Mundus Joint Master Degree in Planetary Geosciences - GeoPlaNet untuk jenjang S2 dengan tipe Fully Funded di Portugal, Italy, France	28 Februari 2026	Fully Funded	Physics and Astrophysics, Earth and Planetary Sciences, Geoscience	• up to 1400 € per month, and will be paid directly to the students for the first month in Master 1 (september), to the last month of Master 2 (August). 24 months in total, provided that the students remain involved in the programme.\n• The programme will cover the insurance costs for the whole duration of the programme (with a partnership with April International).\n• The scholarship holder students will pay no registration fees to the programme.	AGE No age requirement GPA No GPA requirement ENGLISH TEST IELTS: min. 5 TOEFL iBT: min. 65 NATIONALITY Indonesian OTHER LANGUAGE Not required STANDARDIZED TEST Not required DOCUMENTS Candidates should provide the following documents merged into a single PDF file in the following order: 1 - The EMJM application form (will be available in November 2025) 2 - A certified copy of a valid Passport In order to attest the nationality of the student. Applicants with multiple nationalities must provide the copy of the passport corresponding to the nationality they are applying with. Citizens from the EU (only) can use their ID as proof of nationality. 3 - A CV (if possible, using the Europass format) 4 - Copies of degrees and transcripts (certified translation in English, except for French, Italian, Portuguese Universities) The Hague Apostille or an official legalization for these documents is required for all diplomas that were issued in countries from outside of the European Higher Education 	Schoters	https://www.schoters.com/id/beasiswa/erasmus-mundus-joint-master-degree-in-planetary-geosciences-geoplanet-292	https://geoplanet-impg.eu/en/fees-scholarship	[-0.0685