240	University Of Warwick Global Excellence Undergraduate Scholarships	Eropa	Luar Negeri (Inggris)	S1	Beasiswa - University of Warwick - Global Excellence Undergraduate Scholarships untuk jenjang S1 dengan tipe Partially Funded di United Kingdom	27 Februari 2026	Partially Funded	All Majors	• For 2024 entry there will be up to 20 full-fee awards, up to 170 half-fee awards and up to 20 £2,000 awards.	AGE No age requirement GPA No GPA requirement ENGLISH TEST Not required NATIONALITY Indonesian OTHER LANGUAGE Not required STANDARDIZED TEST Standardized Test (Required)\nA Level, IB DOCUMENTS Application Questionnaire: The objective is to learn more about your extra-curricular and academic achievements beyond standard examinations and assessments, what influenced your decision to study your chosen subject at the University of Warwick, how your excellence might benefit the Warwick community and how you hope your learning and experience at Warwick will be applied in the wider world once you graduate. Answers can reference academic attainment, extracurricular successes and personal achievement but should not be a copy of the personal statement. You may write in essay or extended bullet point form but please don’t simply write a list. You should provide context and relevance to the objectives above. Responses are limited to 150 words. OTHERS No other specific requirements mentioned.	Schoters	https://www.schoters.com/id/beasiswa/university-of-warwick-global-excellence-undergraduate-scholarships-300	https://ugscholarships.warwick.ac.uk/apply/scholarship/d415d7f7-5f43-473c-a01c-e3e98fd8189d	[-0.040130615,0.010185242,0.033416748,0.02720642,-0.038330078,-0.02960205,-0.017440796,0.028579712,-0.019165039,0.024291992,-0.024353027,-0.024902344,-0.031799316,0.0031814575,0.0070495605,0.012588501,0.0010967255,0.017745972,-0.03050232,0.03930664,0.040130615,-0.01939392,-0.0055770874,-0.0047035217,0.038085938,-0.046142578,0.007259369,-0.033203125,-0.030441284,0.02267456,0.03668213,-0.01490