251	Beasiswa MOFCOM Program ISSCAD (Program Magister & Doktor)	Asia	Luar Negeri (China)	S2, S3	Panduan Beasiswa Indonesia Bangkit (BIB) S1 Panduan Mendaftar Beasiswa Malaysia International Scholarship	24 Apr 2026	Fully Funded	Semua Jurusan	• Fully Funded\n• Bebas seluruh biaya perkuliahan hingga selesai masa kuliah\n• Tunjangan biaya hidup\n• Tiket pesawat pulang pergi\n• Akomodasi selama program\n• Biaya kedatangan\n• Asuransi kesehatan	Lainnya Persyaratan pendaftaran: Pegawai Negeri Sipil (PNS) yang tugas dan fungsinya relevan dengan program studi yang ditawarkan. Dalam kondisi fisik yang baik dan berusia di bawah 45 tahun. Pelamar program Magister harus memiliki gelar sarjana atau setara serta pengalaman kerja minimal 3 tahun di sektor pemerintah atau publik. Pelamar program Doktor harus memiliki gelar magister atau setara serta pengalaman kerja minimal 5 tahun di sektor pemerintah atau publik. Pelamar diutamakan pejabat pengawas (Eselon IV) atau Pejabat Fungsional Ahli Muda. Lainnya Program yang tersedia: Magister Administrasi Publik (Pembangunan Nasional) Doktor Studi Pembangunan Nasional Lainnya Kontak Informasi\nEmail: beasiswa-ktln@setneg.go.id kstbilateral@setneg.go.id Booklet Informasi Selengkapnya	Luarkampus	https://www.instagram.com/p/DV0Isy3EYuT/	https://www.instagram.com/p/DV0Isy3EYuT/	[-0.07165527,0.017578125,0.038360596,0.017822266,-0.021820068,-0.009651184,-0.033691406,0.061340332,-0.011566162,-0.028320312,-0.0076942444,-0.049194336,-0.017730713,-0.0025348663,0.018539429,0.012619019,-0.048339844,-0.024810791,0.00072717667,0.041290283,0.036499023,0.00957489,-0.007724762,0.018463135,0.02571106,-0.035186768,-0.00333786,-0.03427124,-0.013175964,0.016845703,0.0569458,-0.012046814,-0.046173096,-0.010612488,-0.014175415,0.05368042,0.0044174194,0.0030555725,0.014160156,-0.064575195,-0.02041626,-0.04043579,-0.017669678,-0.016220093,0.034332275,0.005405426,-0.038116455,0.007873535,0.038146973,0.039093018,-0.019378662,-0.027832031,0.050689697,0.06149292,0.0286