406	Nanyang Technological University Ntu Cn Yang Scholars Programme Scholarship	Asia	Luar Negeri (Singapura)	S1	Beasiswa - Nanyang Technological University (NTU) - CN Yang Scholars Programme Scholarship untuk jenjang S1 dengan tipe Fully Funded di Singapore	20 Januari 2026	Fully Funded	Matematika, Fisika, Ilmu Biologi, Ilmu Biomedis, Teknik Elektro, Teknik Mesin, Teknik Robotika, Teknik Komputer, Teknik Sipil, Teknik Kimia, Teknik Dirgantara, Ilmu Material dan Teknik, Teknik Lingkungan, Teknik Biomedis, Psikologi, Desain Produk, Ilmu Komputer	• The scholarship covers up to the normal programme duration on the condition that the scholarship holder maintains a record of good academic performance and exemplary conduct.\n• Full coverage of subsidised tuition fees (after Tuition Grant).\n• Living allowance of S$6,500 per academic year.\n• Accommodation allowance of up to S$2,000 per academic year. (Applicable to scholarship holders who reside in NTU hostels only.)\n• Travel grant of up to S$8,000 for an overseas programme subject to terms and conditions in the Travel Grant Form (for new cohorts from AY2025).\n• Computer allowance of S$2,000 (one-off).\n• No bond is attached to the Scholarship apart from the three-year bond applicable to all Singapore PRs and international students under the MOE Tuition Grant Scheme.\n• The CN Yang Scholars Programme offers:\n• Guaranteed overseas final year research project (5 to 8 months) with overseas travel allowance.\n• Priority for overseas exchange (one-off).\n• Guaranteed overseas learning trip with subsidy.\n• Guaranteed four years of stay in NTU halls of residence (Online hall application is required).\n• Opportunities for research attachment from Year One onwards.\n• Opportunities to attend an international conference with subsidy of up to S$2,000.\n• Opportunities to meet top leading scientists and academics.\n• Opportunities for PhD study at NTU or Joint PhD with partner university (Minimum CGPA of 4.00 for application of a scholarship from NTU).	AGE No age requirement GPA No GPA requirement ENGLISH TEST IELTS: min. 6 TOEFL iBT: min. 90 NATIONALITY Indonesian OTHER LANGUAGE Not required STANDARDIZED TEST Standardized Test (Optional)\nSAT, ACT SAT: 1250\nACT: 30 DOCUMENTS application form personal essay 250 words upload a recent passport-size photo (digital image). submit a referee's appraisal online. The appraisal is to be completed by your school teacher, who must not be your family or relative. OTHERS Additional Qualification (from Academic Year 2024-25 whereby application will be considered more favorably if submitted)\nAt least 3 GCE Advanced Level (UK) subjects taken within 12 months in not more than 2 sittings, either from the same or different examination boards (Cambridge, Edexcel, OCR, AQA). However, applicants must be able to submit actual A level or A2 results before June of the year of application. The A Level subjects taken must meet the minimum subject requirements of the programmes applying for.  A-Level Mathematics	Schoters	https://www.schoters.com/id/beasiswa/nanyang-technological-university-ntu-cn-yang-scholars-programme-scholarship-452	https://www.ntu.edu.sg/admissions/undergraduate/scholarships	[-0.062805176,0.022277832,0.01789856,0.03704834,0.018356323,-0.015083313,-0.0029945374,0.05078125,-0.019119263,0.007007599,0.00022864342,0.008422852,-0.046966553,0.021347046,0.009941101,0.013320923,-0.02003479,-0.02619934,-0.011962891,0.04135132,0.051635742,0.015853882,0.019744873,-0.01838684,0.0345459,-0.06365967,0.05670166,0.0010557175,-0.017028809,0.020339966,0.033813477,-0.023971558,0.012863159,0.027511597,-0.025115967,0.05532837,0.032226562,0.016799927,-0.009483337,-0.055236816,-0.012580872,-0.009338379,-0.016174316,-5.5491924e-05,-0.00011128187,0.02330017,-0.019943237,-0.02305603,-0.041656494,0.05041504,-0.0058555603,-0.004547119,0.041503906,0.03286743,-0.0052375793,0.060333252,-0.0077705383,0.013519287,-0.0020542145,-0.035949707,0.030471802,0.024215698,0.00541687,0.0279