264	James Buchanan Fellowship	Amerika	Luar Negeri (Amerika Serikat)	S3	Persyaratan Umum James Buchanan Fellowship: Panduan Program Nutrifood Research Center Fellowship	15 Apr 2026	Riset	Semua Jurusan	• Riset\n• Tunjangan bulanan\n• Akomodasi selama program\n• Biaya perjalanan\n• Dukungan penuh aktivitas akademik berkaitan dengan riset	Lainnya Persyaratan Umum James Buchanan Fellowship: Pelamar berasal dari semua kewarganegaraan (international applicants diperbolehkan). Wajib memiliki gelar PhD (Doktor). Telah menyelesaikan program PhD dalam 6 tahun terakhir. Berstatus sebagai: Peneliti di lembaga riset bereputasi, atau Akademisi/dosen di universitas terakreditasi. Termasuk kategori early-career academic. Memiliki minat kuat pada: Political economy Riset atau pengajaran dalam ilmu sosial, ekonomi, atau kebijakan publik. Bersedia mengikuti program fellowship selama 1 tahun penuh di Amerika Serikat. Mampu berpartisipasi aktif dalam kegiatan akademik, riset, dan diskusi ilmiah. Booklet Informasi Selengkapnya	Luarkampus	https://www.mercatus.org/students/james-buchanan-fellowship#2392643287-2729856584	https://www.mercatus.org/students/james-buchanan-fellowship#2392643287-2729856584	[-0.08892822,-0.014595032,0.060577393,0.042877197,-0.0262146,-0.02017212,0.014274597,0.07598877,0.013786316,-0.027679443,0.022476196,0.0033664703,-0.007331848,-0.00051498413,-0.037597656,0.039398193,0.02166748,0.016860962,0.033843994,0.020065308,-0.008972168,0.018447876,-0.020141602,0.013214111,0.018585205,-0.06768799,-0.01838684,-0.010223389,-0.022827148,-0.017181396,0.06085205,-0.018478394,-0.011260986,0.02456665,-0.034484863,0.034088135,-0.024963379,-0.03656006,0.022842407,0.018371582,-0.04425049,-0.040405273,-0.0109939575,0.03805542,0.032836914,-0.014854431,-0.03894043,-0.0019254684,0.016464233,0.040527344,-0.02420044,-0.0014429092,0.023406982,0.017684937,0.0115356445,0.017471313,0.00712204,-0.013130188,0.060760498,-0.0073661804,0.05166626,0.021942139,-0.01448822,0.064819336,-0.030731201,-0