268	David Sainsbury Scholarships in Global Plant Health	Eropa	Luar Negeri (Inggris)	S2	Panduan Beasiswa Indonesia Bangkit (BIB) S1 Panduan Mendaftar Beasiswa Malaysia International Scholarship	31 Mei 2026	Fully Funded, Exchange	Semua Jurusan	• Fully Funded\n• Biaya kuliah penuh\n• Tunjangan hidup sebesar £20,780 (Rp405 juta) per tahun\n• Tunjangan perjalanan sebesar £4,000 (Rp78 juta) per tahun	Lainnya Persyaratan sebagai berikut: Sudah menerima tawaran tempat di UEA MSc in Global Plant Health. Warga negara/domisili negara least-developed, low-income, atau lower-middle-income menurut OECD DAC List. Indonesia termasuk dalam kategori lower-middle-income country untuk beasiswa penuh. Lainnya Proses Aplikasi: Apply ke program MSc Global Plant Health di website UEA. Tidak perlu aplikasi terpisah untuk beasiswa; jika memenuhi kriteria, otomatis akan dipertimbangkan. Seleksi berdasarkan prestasi akademik, pengalaman riset, dan potensi di bidang molecular biology, genetics, bioinformatics, statistics, dan plant health science. Booklet Informasi Selengkapnya	Luarkampus	https://www.uea.ac.uk/study/fees-and-funding/scholarships/david-sainsbury-scholarships-in-global-plant-health	https://www.uea.ac.uk/study/fees-and-funding/scholarships/david-sainsbury-scholarships-in-global-plant-health	[-0.03326416,0.008392334,0.06970215,0.049102783,-0.024246216,-0.012741089,0.0061531067,0.048828125,-0.011741638,0.0012865067,0.0069351196,-0.039886475,-0.04260254,-0.0030555725,-0.00472641,-0.02923584,-0.0019569397,-0.022338867,-0.01537323,0.027069092,0.06561279,0.024414062,0.017440796,0.017684937,0.016693115,-0.068603516,0.0181427,-0.010658264,-0.006298065,0.017471313,0.02645874,-0.01033783,-0.004863739,0.054107666,-0.033996582,0.016281128,-0.025741577,-0.004852295,0.00014722347,-0.023269653,-0.041137695,-0.022583008,-0.04837036,0.0030612946,0.013420105,0.026153564,-0.0031757355,0.006881714,-0.00032186508,0.041656494,-0.009185791,-0.018051147,0.052093506,0.026428223,-0.0014257431,0.041107178,0