272	Beasiswa S1, S2 & S3 Pemerintah Kazakhstan	Asia & Eropa	Luar Negeri (Kazakhstan)	S1, S2, S3	Special Requirements (Persyaratan Khusus):	31 Mei 2026	Fully Funded	Semua Jurusan	• Fully Funded\n• Biaya Kuliah Penuh\n• Tunjangan Bulanan S1 Sebesar 52.372 KZT hingga 84.000 KZT (Rp. 1.780.648 - Rp. 2.856.000)\n• Tunjangan Bulanan S2 Sebesar 117.098 KZT (Rp. 3.981.332)\n• Tunjangan Bulanan S3 Sebesar 262.500 KZT (Rp. 8.925.000)	Lainnya General Requirements (Persyaratan Umum): Belum pernah menempuh jenjang pendidikan yang dituju. Paspor. Menyerahkan ijazah dan transkrip pendidikan sebelumnya (dengan terjemahan resmi). Menulis esai motivasi (dalam Bahasa Kazakh, Rusia, atau Inggris). Surat rekomendasi minimal dari 1 institusi pendidikan atau tempat kerja. Sertifikat kesehatan lengkap (termasuk tes HIV/AIDS). Mengisi formulir pendaftaran. Surat undangan dari universitas di Kazakhstan (jika ada). Special Requirements (Persyaratan Khusus): IPK minimal 3.0 dari 4.0 atau setara. Sertifikat bahasa asing (misalnya IELTS/TOEFL). Dokumen ijazah disertai dalam bahasa pengantar (Kazakh, Rusia, atau Inggris). Untuk PhD/S3 harus dalam bahasa Inggris. Booklet Informasi Selengkapnya	Luarkampus	https://bolashak.gov.kz/kz/ctipendiyaly-badarlama	https://bolashak.gov.kz/kz/ctipendiyaly-badarlama	[-0.06665039,0.007419586,0.043151855,0.0234375,-0.008926392,-0.031585693,-0.038757324,0.030441284,-0.00023186207,-0.019561768,-0.018676758,-0.01512146,0.01184082,0.0031909943,0.02027893,0.04876709,-0.023468018,0.017074585,-0.020355225,-0.002046585,-0.015930176,-0.015625,-0.01965332,-0.021560669,0.007335663,-0.04232788,0.049438477,-0.012321472,0.012062073,-0.010444641,0.034179688,-0.03152466,-0.04196167,0.005432129,-0.08404541,0.046020508,0.015457153,0.015266418,0.009315491,-0.046417236,-0.004386902,-0.008323669,-0.04055786,-0.021484375,0.03164673,0.02835083,0.0016117096,0.008384705,0.007106781,0.044403076,-0.028701782,0.011520386,0.04486084,0.042510986,-0.0022125244,0.04812622,0.014389038,-0.0217437