281	Beasiswa Chevening	Eropa	Luar Negeri (Inggris)	S2	Beasiswa Chevening | Negara: Luar Negeri (Inggris) | Jenjang: S2	25 Okt 2026	Fully Funded, Mentoring	Semua Jurusan	• Fully Funded\n• Biaya kuliah penuh\n• Tunjangan hidup bulanan\n• Tiket pesawat PP dari negara asal ke Inggris\n• Biaya visa\n• Tunjangan kedatangan & kepulangan\n• Dana tambahan untuk kegiatan akademik tertentu	Lainnya Persyaratan Resmi: WNI (atau warga negara dari negara yang termasuk Chevening-eligible country). Berkomitmen kembali ke negara asal minimal 2 tahun setelah beasiswa berakhir. Memiliki gelar sarjana yang memenuhi syarat masuk program Master di UK. Memiliki pengalaman kerja minimal 2.800 jam (setara ± 2 tahun kerja penuh) setelah lulus sarjana. Mendaftar ke 3 program Master berbeda yang memenuhi syarat di universitas UK. Memiliki minimal 1 unconditional offer sebelum tenggat dokumen. Memenuhi persyaratan bahasa Inggris (IELTS/TOEFL/PTE, kecuali jika memenuhi syarat pengecualian). Booklet Informasi Selengkapnya	Luarkampus	https://www.chevening.org/scholarship/afghanistan/	https://www.chevening.org/scholarship/afghanistan/	[-0.055755615,0.007610321,0.06100464,0.0045814514,-0.03781128,0.011116028,0.030548096,0.0317688,-0.017593384,0.016921997,0.022399902,-0.0025234222,-0.04095459,0.022994995,0.03869629,0.06903076,-0.0063209534,0.02128601,-0.023910522,0.037322998,-0.033966064,0.024337769,-0.0031490326,0.016403198,0.021728516,-0.048034668,-0.016784668,-0.022140503,-0.010475159,-0.010635376,0.04333496,-0.01727295,-0.0025539398,0.017532349,-0.040893555,0.032806396,0.0077438354,-0.02670288,0.002702713,-0.032989502,-0.030822754,-0.028945923,0.0047302246,-0.009689331,0.078430176,0.013442993,-0.007896423,0.025100708,0.033477783,0.041656494,-0.00541687,-0.021575928,0.047332764,0.06530762,0.029296875,0.0052604675,0.0033874512,-0.02027893,0.0050354004,0.008224487,0.057647705,0.043395996,0.0012464523,0.049102783,0.029571533,-0.050811768,-0.029968262,0.040649414,-0.02267456,-0.003921509,0.00315094,0.0