285	International Christian University Icu Scholarship	Asia	Luar Negeri (Jepang)	S1	Beasiswa - International Christian University - ICU Scholarship untuk jenjang S1 dengan tipe Fully Funded, Partially Funded di Japan	26 Februari 2026	Fully Funded	Art and Cultural Heritage, Musik, Literature, Philosophy and Religion, Ekonomi, Bisnis, Sejarah, Hukum, Kebijakan Publik, Politics, Hubungan Internasional, Sosiologi, Antropologi, "Media, Komunikasi, and Culture", Biologi, Fisika, Kimia, Matematika, Information Science, Pendidikan Bahasa, Pendidikan, Linguistik, Pyschology, American Studies, Asian Studies, Development Studies, Studi Lingkungan, Gender and Sexualities Studies, Studi Global, Japan Studies, Peace Studies	• 1. ICU Peace Bell Scholarship\n• Matriculation Fee, On-Campus Dormitory Entrance Fee, annual Tuition and Facilities Fee,and annual On-Campus Dormitory Fees (excluding July and August) for the four years in principle within the minimum period of enrollment at ICU.\n• 2. ICU Torch Relay High Endeavor Scholarship\n• Matriculation Fee, as well as Tuition and Facilities Fee for the first term each year for the four years in principle within the minimum period of enrollment at ICU\n• 3. ICU Torch Relay High Endeavor Scholarship <Global Citizenship Quota>\n• (Only for Applicants for September Entry)\n• Matriculation Fee, as well as Tuition and Facilities Fee for the first and second term each year for the four years in principle within the minimum period of enrollment at ICU.\n• 4. University of Tomorrow Scholarship <LDCs Quota>\n• (Only for applicants for the 2nd application period of the September Entry)\n• Matriculation Fees, annual Tuition and Facilities Fees, On-Campus Dormitory Entrance Fee, and annual On-Campus Dormitory Fees (including July and August) will be exempted for four years in principle within the minimum period of enrollment at ICU. A monthly stipend of JPY110,000 will be paid.	AGE Min Age: 18 GPA No GPA requirement ENGLISH TEST IELTS: min. 7 TOE