286	Swedish Institute Scholarship For Global Professionals S2	Eropa	Luar Negeri (Swedia)	S2	Beasiswa - Swedish Institute Scholarship for Global Professionals (S2) untuk jenjang S2 dengan tipe Fully Funded di Sweden	25 Februari 2026	Fully Funded	Matematika, Statistika, Fisika, Ilmu Kebumian, Kimia, Ilmu Alam Terapan, Astronomi, Ilmu Biologi, Bioteknologi, Studi Pertanian, Ilmu Pangan, Kelautan / Kehutanan, Akuakultur, Psikologi Klinis, Ilmu Kedokteran, Ilmu Biomedis, Kesehatan Masyarakat, Farmasi, Kedokteran Hewan, Teknik Elektro, Teknik Mesin, Teknik Robotika, Teknik Komputer, Teknik Sipil, Teknik Kimia, Teknik Dirgantara, Teknik Pertambangan dan Perminyakan, Teknik Industri, Teknik Umum, Ilmu Material dan Teknik, Teknik Lingkungan, Teknik Biomedis, Biorekayasa, Psikologi, Hukum dan Studi Hukum, Bahasa dan Sastra, Antropologi, Studi Komunikasi, Studi Budaya dan Agama, Filsafat, Ilmu Humaniora, Studi Gender, Sejarah, Sosiologi, Studi Regional, Pekerjaan Sosial, Kriminologi, Mode / Fashion, Desain Visual, Desain Produk, Seni Rupa, Musik, Seni Pertunjukan, Seni Visual, Keuangan, Ekonomi, Perpajakan, Akuntansi, Ilmu Komputer, Ilmu Data, Kecerdasan Buatan, Sistem Informasi, Teknologi Informasi, Teknologi Digital, Administrasi Bisnis, Manajemen Bisnis, Pemasaran, Manajemen Sumber Daya Manusia, Manajemen Organisasi, Manajemen Rantai Pasok dan Logistik, Perubahan Iklim, Manajemen Sumber Daya Alam, Manajemen Energi, Studi Lingkungan Umum, Arsitektur, Perencanaan Kota, Desain Interior, Pendidikan Bahasa, Pendidikan Umum, Pariwisata, Kuliner, Manajemen Perhotelan, Pemerintahan, Hubungan Internasional, Administrasi Publik, Kebijakan Publik, Ilmu Politik, Olahraga, Ilmu Olahraga, Kesehatan Olahraga, Pendidikan Olahraga	• Full tuition fee coverage.\n• A monthly payment of SEK 11,000 t\n• Insurance against illness and accident ( https://www.kammarkollegiet.se/engelska/start/all-services/insurance-for-foreign-visitors ) .\n• Travel Grant. This is a one-time payment and does not apply for students already living in Sweden.\n• For scholars from Bangladesh, Bolivia; Brazil, Cambodia, Cameroon, Colombia, Ecuador, Egypt, Ethiopia, Gambia, Ghana, Guatemala, Honduras, Indonesia , Jordan, Kenya, Liberia, Malawi, Morocco, Myanmar (Burma), Nepal, Nigeria, Pakistan, Peru, Philippines, Rwanda, South Africa, Sri Lanka, Sudan, Tanzania, Tunisia, Uganda, Vietnam, Zambia or Zimbabwe – the scholarship includes a travel grant of SEK 15,000 for the entire study period.\n• Membership of the SI Network for Future Global Professionals ( https://si.se/en/how-we-work/build-relations-and-networks/si-network-for-global-professionals/ ) (NFGP) – a platform to help you grow professionally and build a network while in Sweden.\n• After your scholarship period has ended, you become a member of the SI Alumni Network ( https://si.se/en/si-alumni-network/ ). As a member, you get a unique opportunity for continued networking and professional development.	AGE No age requirement GPA No GPA requirement ENGLISH TEST Not required NATIONALITY Indonesian OTHER LANGUAGE Not required STANDARDIZED TEST Not required DOCUMENTS CV (we only accept the SI-template) Letters of reference (we only accept the SI-template) Valid and completed proof of work and leadership experience (we only accept the SI-template) Copy of your valid passport/National ID card Motivation (will be asked of you in the application portal) OTHERS Minimum test scores required depends on major.	Schoters	https://www.schoters.com/id/beasiswa/swedish-institute-scholarship-for-global-professionals-s2-303	https://si.se/en/apply/scholarships/swedish-institute-scholarships-for-global-professionals/	[-0.04876709,0.005554199,0.022964478,0.012870789,-0.018676758,-0.010368347,-0.027282715,0.02029419,-0.015930176,0.012275696,0.014335632,-0.05630493,-0.030670166,-0.012199402,0.017105103,0.07354736,-0.043884277,-0.03878784,-0.050109863,0.054382324,0.013259888,0.052093506,-0.036224365,0.016189575,0.03555298,-0.06689453,0.02571106,0.023