.\n• Membership in the SI Network for Future Global Professionals (NFGP) – a platform to help you grow professionally and build a network while in Sweden.\n• After your scholarship period has ended, you become a member of the SI Alumni Network. As a member, you get a unique opportunity for continued networking and professional development.	AGE No age requirement GPA No GPA requirement ENGLISH TEST Not required NATIONALITY Indonesian OTHER LANGUAGE Not required STANDARDIZED TEST Not required DOCUMENTS CV (we only accept the SI-template) Letters of reference (we only accept the SI-template) Valid and completed proof of work and leadership experience (we only accept the SI-template) Copy of your valid passport/National ID card Motivation (will be asked of you in the application portal) OTHERS Minimum test scores required depends on major.	Schoters	https://www.schoters.com/id/beasiswa/pioneering-women-in-stem-308	https://si.se/en/apply/scholarships/pioneeringwomeninstem/	[-0.04135132,-0.0030975342,0.020889282,0.03125,-0.011642456,-0.016159058,-0.026824951,0.018173218,-0.0042381287,0.0051994324,0.026779175,-0.04824829,-0.024154663,-0.022232056,0.01360321,0.07635498,-0.026901245,-0.025909424,-0.047027588,0.057403564,0.012687683,0.04244995,-0.045288086,0.0073509216,0.035339355,-0.055603027,0.01701355,0.019515991,-0.0009908676,-0.011802673,0.035461426,-0.011932373,-0.056793213,-0.008232117,-0.013771057,0.066467285,-0.007537842,0.029968262,0.006427765,-0.018859863,-0.04473877,-0.017440796,-0.0030174255,-0.02078247,-0.011352539,0.045074463,0.0015048981,-0.027252197,0.013977051,0.024520874,-0.02017212,-0.012123108,0.0625,0.020401001,0.015258789,0.04876709,0.026855469,0.012306213,-0.014129639,-0.012496948,0.017456055,0.029800415,0.020507812,-0.009407043,0.011802673,0.008430481,-0.024719238,0.014961243,-0.016326904,0.00041103363,0.02720642,-0.023742676,0.06652832,-0.04348755,-0.053100586,0.05041504,-0.033599854,0.031341553,0.018310547,0.0033054352,-0.048919678,-0.027450562,0.030