297	The University Of Sydney Mba Director S Scholarship	Australia/Oseania	Luar Negeri (Australia)	S2	Beasiswa - The University of Sydney - MBA Director's Scholarship untuk jenjang S2 dengan tipe Partially Funded di Australia	22 Februari 2026	Partially Funded	Administrasi Bisnis	• Four Scholarship amounts are offered based on ranking against the selection criteria:\n• I. $10,000 towards academic tuition fees for one semester, or\n• II. $20,000 in total towards academic tuition fees across two semesters. The $20,000 will be spilt evenly across the two associated semesters.\n• III. $30,000 in total towards academic tuition fees across three semesters. The $30,000 will be split evenly across the three associated semesters.\n• IV. $40,000 in total towards academic tuition fees across three semesters. The $40,000 will be split evenly across the three associated semesters.	AGE No age requirement GPA Min. Rapor: 65 out of 100 ENGLISH TEST Required NATIONALITY Indonesian OTHER LANGUAGE Not required STANDARDIZED TEST Standardized Test (Recommended)\nGMAT DOCUMENTS In order to complete your application online you will need the following documentation: Your academic qualification details, for example, completion year and grade average Your employment history/professional details A statement of motivation (maximum two pages) outlining: what you hope to achieve professionally and personally by completing the full-time MBA (Leadership and Enterprise) at the University of Sydney Business School academic achievements community involvement and extracurricular activities leadership qualities awards and recognition. If you would like to be considered for a scholarship, please provide details of this in your statement of motivation. OTHERS No other specific requirements mentioned.	Schoters	https://www.schoters.com/id/beasiswa/the-university-of-sydney-mba-director-s-scholarship-316	https://www.sydney.edu.au/scholarships/a/mba-directors-scholarship.html	[-0.05480957,0.020111084,0.04382324