303	Brunei Darussalam Government Scholarship Bdgs	Asia	Luar Negeri (Brunei)	S2	Beasiswa - Brunei Darussalam Government Scholarship (BDGS) untuk jenjang S2 dengan tipe Fully Funded di Brunei	15 Februari 2026	Fully Funded	Matematika, Kimia, Ilmu Alam Terapan, Ilmu Biologi, Studi Pertanian, Ilmu Pangan, Ilmu Kedokteran, Ilmu Biomedis, Farmasi, Teknik Elektro, Teknik Mesin, Teknik Robotika, Teknik Komputer, Teknik Sipil, Teknik Kimia, Teknik Pertambangan dan Perminyakan, Teknik Umum, Hukum dan Studi Hukum, Bahasa dan Sastra, Antropologi, Studi Komunikasi, Studi Budaya dan Agama, Mode / Fashion, Desain Produk, Keuangan, Ekonomi, Akuntansi, Ilmu Komputer, Ilmu Data, Kecerdasan Buatan, Sistem Informasi, Teknologi Digital, Administrasi Bisnis, Manajemen Bisnis, Pemasaran, Manajemen Sumber Daya Manusia, Manajemen Energi, Studi Lingkungan Umum, Arsitektur, Desain Interior, Pendidikan Bahasa, Pendidikan Umum, Hubungan Internasional	• Exemption from paying tuition fees including acceptance, examination, registration and orientation fees for the duration of the programme;\n• An economy class air-ticket to Brunei Darussalam from the scholarship recipient's country of origin/ country of domicile prior to the commencement of the course and an economy class air-ticket from Brunei Darussalam to the scholarship recipient's country of origin/country of domicile upon completion of the course;\n• A monthly personal allowance of BND$500.00;\n• A monthly meals allowance of BND$150.00;\n• An annual book allowance of BND$600.00;\n• Accommodation at the residential college of the University/ Polytechnic;\n• Baggage allowance for shipment of the scholarship recipient's personal effects to the country of origin/country of domicile upon completion of the programme, at a maximum amount of:\n• BND$250.00 to a country within the ASEAN region; or\n• BND$500.00 to a country outside the ASEAN region;\n• Comprehensive insurance for the whole duration of the Scholarship. Scholarship recipients are, however, urged to obtain additional insurance prior to travelling to Brunei Darussalam and for the whole duration of the Scholarship at their own expense.	AGE Max Age: 35 GPA No GPA requirement ENGLISH TEST IELTS: min. 6 TOEFL PBT NATIONALITY Indonesian OTHER LANGUAGE Not required STANDARDIZED TEST Not required DOCUMENTS Passport Photo Passport and/ or Birth Certificate/ National Identification Card/ Document copy English Language Proficiency Certification copy (if applicable) Academic Qualification Certificates including transcripts, other achievements certificates copy and proof of employment Research Proposal (for Programmes by Research only) OTHERS Applicants applying to Universiti Brunei Darussalam (UBD) must also complete an online application through https://apply.ubd.edu.bn/orbeon/uis-welcome/\n\nApplicants applying to Universiti Teknologi Brunei (UTB) must also complete an online application through https://apply.utb.edu.bn/	Schoters	https://www.schoters.com/id/beasiswa/brunei-darussalam-government-scholarship-bdgs-328	https://www.mfa.gov.bn/Pages/online-bdgs.aspx	[-0.037872314,0.013626099,0.031311035,0.047088623,-0.017196655,0.010543823,-0.01701355,0.039215088,0.005874634,0.024963379,-0.008644104,-0.018814087,0.009460449,-0.03543091,0.022537231,0.046722412,0.0013561249,0.0076904297,-0.029769897,0.028167725,0.033813477,0.008392334,-0.021759033,0.016906738,0.057495117,-0.042022705,0.025634766,-0.049224854,0.0013694763,-0.003829956,0.066101074,-0.02319336,0.008392334,-0.023529053,-0.008865356,0.05609131,-0.011886597,-0.0012226105,-0.0064849854,-0.05529785,-0.016479492,-0.0496521,-0.010063171,-0.024597168,-0.017028809,0.07196045,-0.016326904,0.01826477,-0.01637268,0.038330078,-0.010284424,-0.009750366,0.03439331,-0.0018978119,0.003376007,0.028839111,-0.0051651,-0.011741638,0.01272583,-0.04736328,0.04348755,0.031677246,-0.015296936,0.011909485,-0.009628296,-0.04119873,0.0007619858,0.055480957,-0.02268982,-0.017791748,0.029052734,0.051727295,0.049835205,-0.022415161