312	Toyo University Toyo Sdgs Ambassador Scholarship For International Students	Asia	Luar Negeri (Jepang)	S1	Beasiswa - Toyo University - Toyo SDGs Ambassador Scholarship for International Students untuk jenjang S1 dengan tipe Fully Funded di Japan	13 Februari 2026	Fully Funded	Development Studies	• Awarded students will:\n• 1.Receive 100% waiver of tuition and other fees (first year) and 60-100% waiver of tuition and other fees (second to fourth year)\n• 2.Stay in Toyo's international dormitory and the dormitory fees will be covered by the University\n• 3.Have an faculty advisor and student mentor for planning, organizing, and conducting SDGs-related events and activities.	AGE No age requirement GPA No GPA requirement ENGLISH TEST IELTS: min. 7 TOEFL iBT: min. 94 TOEIC NATIONALITY Indonesian OTHER LANGUAGE JLPT: N2 STANDARDIZED TEST Not required DOCUMENTS Admission documents action plans for SDGs Ambassador activities English proficiency (required for english taught and japanese taught applicants) Japanese proficiency (only required for japanese taught applicants) OTHERS SDGs Ambassadors are students at Toyo University who engage in various activities that help Toyo and the world achieve the Sustainable Development Goals (SDGs). There are thousands of ways to work as an SDGs Ambassador, including organizing learning events, coordinating volunteer activities, or hosing study group in the dormitory.  Therefore, the Ambassadors are expected to excel not only in academic performance but also social, communication, coordination, and leadership skills	Schoters	https://www.schoters.com/id/beasiswa/toyo-university-toyo-sdgs-ambassador-scholarship-for-international-students-338	https://www.toyo.ac.jp/academics/international-exchange/prospective/full_scholarship/index.html	[-0.025177002,-0.017929077,-0.010879517,0.040924072,-0.0009775162,-0.053741455,-0.026397705,0.049621582,0.0032100677,-0.062683105,-0.0124053955,-0.017471313,-0.028396606,-0.027511597,-0.0021133423,0.014625