313	International Graduate Student Scholarship Taipei Medical University Tmu	Asia	Luar Negeri (Taiwan)	S2	Beasiswa - International Graduate Student Scholarship - Taipei Medical University (TMU) untuk jenjang S2 dengan tipe Fully Funded di Taiwan	12 Februari 2026	Fully Funded	Medicine, Oral Medicine, Farmasi, Keperawatan, Kesehatan Masyarakat, Medical Science & Engineering, Humanities, Management Science, Teknik Biomedis, Nutrition	• Type A (Doctoral degree): Students will receive a monthly subsidy of NT 16,000 plus a tuition waiver.\n• b) Type B (Master’s degree): Students will receive a monthly subsidy of NT 12,000 plus a tuition waiver.\n• c) Type C: Students will receive a tuition waiver\n• The duration of awards is limited to:\n• a) Doctoral degree: maximum of 2 years.\n• b) Master’s degree: maximum of 2 years	AGE No age requirement GPA No GPA requirement ENGLISH TEST IELTS: min. 6 TOEFL iBT: min. 72 TOEFL ITP NATIONALITY Indonesian OTHER LANGUAGE Not required STANDARDIZED TEST Standardized Test (Optional)\nGRE, GMAT DOCUMENTS 1. Degree certificates 2. Transcript 3. Proof of nationality with English name, date of birth, gender and photo (e.g. passport) 4. Photograph: a close-up color shot of the head and shoulders (no hats) within the last 6 months (JPG format). This photo will be used to produce the TMU student ID card 5. English proficiency 6. Statement of purpose 7. Resume and personal statement 8. Financial statement, obtained within the last three months. If you are selfsponsored, provide your bank statement(s) in English or Chinese with the $USD amount equal or exceed $4,000 USD or $NTD amount equal or exceed $120,000 NTD. 9. Other supporting documents listed as program-specific requirements OTHERS English req.\n\nMaster’s Applicant  : CEFR B1 (Threshold) or above\n\nPh.D. Applicant : CEFR 	Schoters	https://www.schoters.com/id/beasiswa/international-graduate-student-scholarship-taipei-medical-university-tmu-339	https://oge.tmu.edu.tw/admission/costsnaid/	[