315	Erasmus Mundus Joint Master In Education Policies For Global Development Globed	Eropa	Luar Negeri (Inggris, Jerman, Spanyol)	S2	Beasiswa - Erasmus Mundus Joint Master in Education Policies for Global Development (GLOBED) untuk jenjang S2 dengan tipe Fully Funded di United Kingdom, Spain, Germany, Cyprus	12 Februari 2026	Fully Funded	Development Studies, Ilmu Pendidikan	• All scholarship holders, regardless of their residence or nationality, will receive 1.400 € per month along the two-years programme. The Erasmus+ scholarship includes subsistence, mobility and installation costs. It also covers the registration at the four universities of the consortium and a worldwide health insurance.	AGE No age requirement GPA No GPA requirement ENGLISH TEST IELTS: min. 7 TOEFL iBT: min. 90 NATIONALITY Indonesian OTHER LANGUAGE Not required STANDARDIZED TEST Not required DOCUMENTS 1. Copy of a valid passport. 2. An up-to-date Europass CV, presenting the skills and qualifications of the candidates in a clear way. 3. Official copies of diplomas and transcripts 4. TOEFL: score of at least 90 with a writing score at least 24 in the writing section. Cambridge Proficiency Examination Advanced Certificate: at least pass at grade C1 or better. IELTS (Academic): at least 7.0 with a minimum of 6.0 in each element and 6.5 in the writing section 5. A letter of motivation explaining your background and reasons for applying to the programme (maximum one page). 6. A short essay on a topic proposed by the Academic Board (maximum one page). OTHERS No other specific requirements mentioned.	Schoters	https://www.schoters.com/id/beasiswa/erasmus-mundus-joint-master-in-education-policies-for-global-development-globed-342	https://erasmus-plus.ec.europa.eu/	[-0.028564453,0.035186768,0.052947998,0.022094727,-0.039520264,0.01776123,0.009117126,0.047821045,0.020355225,-0.014404297,0.0063285828,-0.042541504,-0.014404297,-0.0026760101,0.031677246,0.051116943,-0.023620605,0.016662598,-0.021469116,0.042663