325	The Hong Kong Polytechnic University Polyuhk Scholarship For Non Local Students	Asia	Luar Negeri (Hong Kong)	S1	Beasiswa - The Hong Kong Polytechnic University (PolyuHK) - Scholarship for Non-Local Students untuk jenjang S1 dengan tipe Partially Funded, Fully Funded di Hong Kong	5 Februari 2026	Fully Funded	Ilmu Alam Terapan, Bioteknologi, Ilmu Pangan, Teknik Elektro, Teknik Mesin, Teknik Robotika, Teknik Sipil, Teknik Kimia, Teknik Dirgantara, Teknik Industri, Teknik Umum, Teknik Lingkungan, Hukum dan Studi Hukum, Bahasa dan Sastra, Studi Komunikasi, Mode / Fashion, Desain Produk, Keuangan, Akuntansi, Ilmu Komputer, Kecerdasan Buatan, Sistem Informasi, Manajemen Bisnis, Manajemen Rantai Pasok dan Logistik, Pariwisata, Manajemen Perhotelan	• Entry Scholarship:\n• Other qualification: Up to renewable full-tuition scholarship with an allowance of HK$50,000 (renewable), plus HK$30,000 exchange scholarship (one-off)\n• IB Diploma and A-Level: Up to renewable full-tuition scholarship with an allowance of HK$65,000 (renewable), HK$30,000 exchange scholarship (one-off), plus eligibility for admission to the Undergraduate Research and Innovation Scheme (URIS) scholarship of up to HK$50,000\n• Special Talents Admission and Recognition Scheme (STARS) Scholarship:\n• Tier 1: Full-tuition scholarship plus living allowance per year\n• Tier 2: Full-tuition scholarship per year\n• Tier 3: Half-tuition scholarship per year\n• PolyU embraces students with special talents in Sports, Arts and Culture, Leadership and Community Services, and STEM through Special Talents Admission and Recognition Scheme (STARS). The scheme serves as an alternative admission route for students whose exceptional achievements cannot be fully reflected in their academic results\n• Cultural Ambassador scholarship:\n• Eligible students will be awarded a renewable scholarship of up to HK$50,000 per year.\n• The award recognises students' potential who, through their diverse cultural backgrounds and perspectives, will contribute to the University's student community. Awardees will serve as cultural ambassadors and contribute actively to the University's internationalisation effort.	AGE Min Age: 18 GPA No GPA requirement ENGLISH TEST IELTS: min. 6 TOEFL iBT: min. 80 NATIONALITY Indonesian OTHER LANGUAGE Not required STANDARDIZED TEST Standardized Test (Recommended)\nA-Level, ACT, IB DOCUMENTS Highschool transcript translated in english English proficiency Ijazah, SKHUN, other official document from school translated in english Application fee Visa Other document based on program (Transcript/Portfolio) OTHERS No other specific requirements mentioned.	Schoters	https://www.schoters.com/id/beasiswa/the-hong-kong-polytechnic-university-polyuhk-scholarship-for-non-local-students-358	https://www.polyu.edu.hk/study/ug/fees-and-scholarships/scholarships	[-0.062805176,0.0071640015,-0.010810852,0.06762695,0.025390625,-0.050689697,-0.012969971,0.048187256,-0.00819397,0.00040459633,-0.011917114,0.003189087,-0.014167786,-0.010101318,0.016845703,0.01751709,-0.01927185,-0.0070877075,-0.015563965,0.026351929,0.0073890686,-0.011192322,-0.002691269,0.021774292,0.062042236,-0.05505371,0.03768921,-0.002008438,-0.009002686,0.019989014,0.058502197,-0.038269043,-0.015129089,0.00024282932,-0.020507812,0.071777344,0.00045108795,0.031707764,-0.011680603,-0.05606079,-0.010986328,-0.033447266,-0.0031089783,-0.031082153,0.024612427,0.048858643,-0.0015211105,0.00187397,-0.0030918121,0.015396118,-0.020950317,0.0013313293,0.05996704,0.011238098,0.03201294,0.04711914,0.006904602,-0.008262634,-0.014709473,-0.04107666,0.037109375,0.002298355,0.024383545,0.020736694,-0.03668213,-0.0017709732,-0.041259766,0.013763428,-0.025436401,0.024276733,0.038604736,0.037750244,0.023971558,-0.02507019,-0.023895264,0.04071045,-0.025238037,0.04446411,0.0028953552,-0.03125,-0.032440186,-0.017532349,0.0049095154,-0.022232056,0.02835083,-0.0055236816,-0.07623291,-0.040374756,-0.041137695,-0.023132324,-0.00027132034,-0.035186