327	Erasmus Materials For Energy Storage And Conversion Mesc	Amerika, Australia/Oseania, Eropa	Luar Negeri (Amerika Serikat, Australia, Perancis, Spanyol, Polandia)	S2	Beasiswa - Erasmus Materials for Energy Storage and Conversion + (MESC+) untuk jenjang S2 dengan tipe Fully Funded di Spain, France, Poland, United States, Australia	3 Februari 2026	Fully Funded	Ilmu Material dan Teknik, Energy Engineering, Electrochemistry	• The EMJM scholarship is calculated on the basis of a monthly unit cost of 1 400 EUR, for a total duration of 24 months. So the maximum amount per student is 1 400 EUR x 24 months = 33 600 EUR.\n• The scholarship is awarded for full-time enrolment, and will cover the entire duration of the Master programme (i.e. 24 months).\n• This EMJM scholarship is a contribution to the costs incurred by the beneficiary students and covers:\n• Travel costs;\n• Visa costs;\n• Installation costs;\n• Subsistence costs.	AGE No age requirement GPA No GPA requirement ENGLISH TEST IELTS: min. 7 TOEFL iBT: min. 87 TOEFL PBT TOEFL CBT NATIONALITY Indonesian OTHER LANGUAGE Not required STANDARDIZED TEST Not required DOCUMENTS A copy of your passport or ID card Proof of residence (a bill (e.g. electricity, gaz, phone, water consumption); tax payer document; bank account statement; home insurance. A certificate of English proficiency Your high school diploma Transcripts of records and diplomas (certified copy, English translation) 2 recommendation letters Curriculum Vitae (Europass, max 2 pages) Statement of Purpose (500 words) Essay on energy related topic (500 words) OTHERS No other specific requirements mentioned.	Schoters	https://www.schoters.com/id/beasiswa/erasmus-materials-for-energy-storage-and-conversion-mesc-360	https://i-mesc.eu/	[-0.03982544,0.036987305,0.029403687,0.0011520386,-0.027008057,0.0234375,-0.0030879974,0.017990112,0.036499023,-0.047607422,0.021224976,-0.047576904,-0.029815674,0.0040283203,0.022323608,0.05670166,-0.01158905,0.014549255,-0.011299133,0