329	Erasmus European Master In Lexicography Emlex	Afrika, Eropa	Luar Negeri (Afrika Selatan, Jerman, Perancis, Italia, Spanyol, Portugal, Polandia, Hungaria)	S2	Beasiswa - Erasmus European Master in Lexicography (EMLex) untuk jenjang S2 dengan tipe Fully Funded di Germany, Spain, France, Hungary, Italy, Poland, Portugal, South Africa	2 Februari 2026	Fully Funded	Studi Komunikasi, Linguistik, Library and Information Studies, Lexicography	• Scholarship holders receive a scholarship totalling 1400 euros/month for the entire duration of the study programme (maximum 24 months), which is used to cover travel expenses, visa and residence permit applications, and the installation and living costs.\n• The scholarship also includes participation costs for the EMJM-EMLex, cover all additional costs which occur during your studies. They particularly include tuition fees, health insurance, library costs, administrative costs, cultural events.	AGE No age requirement GPA No GPA requirement ENGLISH TEST IELTS: min. 5 TOEFL iBT: min. 42 NATIONALITY Indonesian OTHER LANGUAGE DSH: DSH 2 STANDARDIZED TEST Not required DOCUMENTS (1) application form (2) motivation letter (2 pages max., in English or German). The letter should include the following aspects: (a) Explain the reasons why you wish to study the EMLex Master Programme, express your expectations and your own contribution. In addition, you should state what you plan to do with the EMLex master degree. (b) Report on your experiences with scientific or practical lexicography that you have already made and why you have an interest in lexicography. (c) Explain your choice of the preferred home university (while your preferences* will be taken into account as far as possible, the final decision will be made so as to best fit your study needs). (d) Answer the following question: Which lexicographic project would you like to realize in your home country if you had the chance to do	Schoters	https://www.schoters.com/id/beasiswa/erasmus-e