330	Asian Development Bank Japan Scholarship Program Adb Jsp Kyoto University Graduate School Of Agriculture	Asia	Luar Negeri (Jepang)	S2	Beasiswa - Asian Development Bank-Japan Scholarship Program (ADB-JSP) - Kyoto University - Graduate School of Agriculture untuk jenjang S2 dengan tipe Fully Funded di Japan	2 Februari 2026	Fully Funded	Ilmu Pertanian	• The ADB–JSP provides:\n• full tuition fees\n• a monthly subsistence and housing allowance\n• an allowance for books and instructional materials\n• medical insurance\n• travel expenses\n• For scholars engaged in research, a special grant may be available for thesis preparation.	AGE Min Age: 22\nMax Age: 35 GPA No GPA requirement ENGLISH TEST IELTS: min. 6 TOEFL iBT: min. 72 TOEFL PBT NATIONALITY Indonesian OTHER LANGUAGE JLPT: N1 STANDARDIZED TEST Not required DOCUMENTS https://www.kais.kyoto-u.ac.jp/english/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2023/12/1.-HP%E6%8E%B2%E8%BC%89-Graduate-School-of-Agriculture-2024.pdf OTHERS 1. Applicant requests for information and application forms from the chosen partner institution.\n2. Applicant completes required documents[1] for application including ADB-JSP information sheet\n3. Applicant sends documents to institution[2]\n4. Institution evaluates and decides on admission and applicant\n5. Institution sends shortlist of candidates to ADB[3]\n6. ADB reviews submission from institutions\n7. ADB recommends awardees based on its selection criteria to the Japanese executive director for approval\n8. ADB selects scholars and informs institution\n9. Institution informs all scholars	Schoters	https://www.schoters.com/id/beasiswa/Asian-development-bank-japan-scholarship-program-adb-jsp-kyoto-university-graduate-school-of-agriculture-363	https://www.adb.org/work-with-us/careers/japan-scholarship-program	[-0.060455322,-0.001578331,0.06109619,0.03427124,0.013366699,-0.025741577,-0.007827759,0.031143188,0.01651001,-0.008369446,0.00079345703,-0.04812622,-0.015525818,-0.0004386902,-0.010559082,-0.0203094