339	Icp Connect Scholarship Vliruos Master Of Science In Food Technology 2 Years Ku Leuven Ghent University Joint Degree	Eropa	Luar Negeri (Belgia)	S2	Beasiswa - ICP Connect Scholarship (VLIRUOS) - Master of Science in Food Technology ( 2 years) - KU Leuven & Ghent University (Joint Degree) untuk jenjang S2 dengan tipe Fully Funded di Belgium	1 Februari 2026	Fully Funded	Food Engineering, Food Safety and Health Risk Assessment, Teknik Kimia, Kimia, Ilmu Biologi	• VLIR-UOS scholarships cover tuition fees, travel, insurance and living expenses (board and lodging).	AGE Max Age: 35 GPA Min. GPA: 3 out of 4.00 ENGLISH TEST IELTS: min. 7 TOEFL iBT: min. 79 NATIONALITY Indonesian OTHER LANGUAGE Not required STANDARDIZED TEST Not required DOCUMENTS Syarat Pendaftaran di KU Leuven dan Ghent University (Joint Program) International applicants must have obtained an academic Bachelor of Science degree (in countries in the South typically a 4-year programme) in a discipline related to the content of the programme from a recognized University, College or Institute. Candidates are expected to have basic science training (demonstrable in the transcripts) in each of the following fields: i. mathematics and statistics, ii. physics and engineering, iii. chemistry and biochemistry, iv. biology and microbiology. They must have obtained their degree with an end result of at least second class upper or equivalent. Each application is evaluated by the Educational Committee for admission. Berdasarkan seleksi KU Leuven: Core Documents: 1. Motivation Letter. (“Personal 	Schoters	https://www.schoters.com/id/beasiswa/icp-connect-scholarship-vliruos-master-of-science-in-food-technology-2-years-ku-leuven-ghent-university-joint-degree-372	https://www.vliruos.be/get-funded/study-scholarships	[-0.09698486,-0.0079422,0.016738892,0.014701843,-0.017608643,-0.0020599365,-0.007133484,0.03778076,-0.007080078,0.0050354004,0.011054993,-0.049713135,-0.03564453,0.030258179,-0.009613037,0.023391724,-2.4616718e