341	Icp Connect Scholarship Vliruos Master Of Water Resources Engineering Wre 2 Years Ku Leuven Vrije Universiteit Brussel V	Eropa	Luar Negeri (Belgia)	S2	Beasiswa - ICP Connect Scholarship (VLIRUOS) - Master of Water Resources Engineering (WRE) ( 2 years ) - KU Leuven & Vrije Universiteit Brussel (VUB) Joint Degree untuk jenjang S2 dengan tipe Fully Funded di Belgium	1 Februari 2026	Fully Funded	Civil and Environmental Engineering, Energy Engineering, Ilmu Biologi, Kimia, Geography, Ilmu Lingkungan	• VLIR-UOS scholarships cover tuition fees, travel, insurance and living expenses (board and lodging).	AGE Max Age: 35 GPA Min. GPA: 3 out of 4.00 ENGLISH TEST IELTS: min. 7 TOEFL iBT: min. 79 NATIONALITY Indonesian OTHER LANGUAGE Not required STANDARDIZED TEST Not required DOCUMENTS General requirements Applicants have obtained an above-average Bachelor degree in the domain of Bioscience Engineering, Environmental Engineering, Civil Engineering, Geology, Biology, Geography, Chemistry, Environmental Sciences or a related discipline. A strong background in mathematics and natural sciences is expected. erdasarkan seleksi KU Leuven: Core Documents: 1. Motivation Letter.  Master of Water Resources Engineering: “How do the skills and knowledge that you will acquire through the programme help you achieve your future career plans?” (maximum 500 words) 2. ICP Connect Scholarship Document. 3. Transcript Academic Record (Bachelor). 4. Certificate of Graduation (official). 5. CV. 6. English Proficiency Certificate. 7. Identify Page Passport. 8. Two Letters of Recommendation. Additional documents I	Schoters	https://www.schoters.com/id/beasiswa/icp-connect-scholarship-vliruos-master-of-water-resources-engineering-wre-2-years-ku-leuven-vrije-universiteit-brussel-vub-joint-degree-374	https://www.vliruos.be/get-funded/study-scholarships	[-0.0736084,0.016357422,0.042633057,0.023788452,-0.033416748,-0.01108551,0.003238678,0.020996094,-0.008171082,0.016052246,-0.007347107,-0.04675293,-0.04