342	Vlir Uos Scholarship Master Of Transportation Sciences Road Safety 2 Years Hasselt University	Eropa	Luar Negeri (Belgia)	S2	Beasiswa - VLIR-UOS Scholarship - Master of Transportation Sciences - Road Safety ( 2 years) - Hasselt University untuk jenjang S2 dengan tipe Fully Funded di Belgium	1 Februari 2026	Fully Funded	Transportation and Logistics Management, Teknik Lingkungan, Energy Engineering, Urban and Regional Development, Social Welfare	• VLIR-UOS scholarships cover tuition fees, travel, insurance and living expenses (board and lodging).	AGE Max Age: 35 GPA Min. GPA: 3 out of 4.00 ENGLISH TEST IELTS: min. 7 TOEFL iBT: min. 79 NATIONALITY Indonesian OTHER LANGUAGE Not required STANDARDIZED TEST Not required DOCUMENTS Conditions of Admission The Admission Board will consider all applications individually. The standard requirements set by Hasselt University are applicable to all applicants of the Master of Transportation Sciences. DIPLOMA REQUIREMENTS All applicants should hold at least a university degree or a diploma of higher education equivalent to a (academic) bachelor’s degree. A Bachelor of Technology or HND degree is not sufficient for admission to our MSc programme. If you have a professional bachelor’s degree, you will have to do a link programme of max. 45 ECTS. The link programme is available for Dutch-speaking students only. Note that a letter of motivation is compulsory in the application file. Apart from previously obtained degrees and grades and the level of English proficiency, the motivation for choosing	Schoters	https://www.schoters.com/id/beasiswa/vlir-uos-scholarship-master-of-transportation-sciences-road-safety-2-years-hasselt-university-375	https://www.vliruos.be/get-funded/study-scholarships	[-0.062561035,-0.011047363,0.02859497,-0.007167816,-0.053741455,-0.024246216,-0.02279663,0.034240723,-0.004047394,0.008575439,-0.016204834,-0.03756714,-0.03488159,0.004310608,-0.0012845993,0.024902344,0.028366089,0.01939392,-0.026565552,0.011032104