343	Vlir Uos Scholarship Master Of Statistics And Data Science 2 Years Hasselt University	Eropa	Luar Negeri (Belgia)	S2	Beasiswa - VLIR-UOS Scholarship - Master of Statistics and Data Science (2 years) - Hasselt University untuk jenjang S2 dengan tipe Fully Funded di Belgium	1 Februari 2026	Fully Funded	Matematika, Statistic and Data Science, Bioinformatics, Ilmu Biologi, Kesehatan Masyarakat	• VLIR-UOS scholarships cover tuition fees, travel, insurance and living expenses (board and lodging).	AGE Max Age: 35 GPA Min. GPA: 3 out of 4.00 ENGLISH TEST IELTS: min. 7 TOEFL iBT: min. 89 NATIONALITY Indonesian OTHER LANGUAGE Not required STANDARDIZED TEST Standardized Test (Recommended)\nGRE General Test DOCUMENTS 3 specializations The ICP scholarship students follow a specific track within our Master of Statistics and Data Science with a focus on statistics in developing countries. This is achieved by three specific ICP courses organized and taught together with our partners in the South. In total there are three possible International Course Programmes (ICP) specializations within our Master of Statistics and Data Science: 1. Biostatistics: focuses on (generalized) linear models, multivariate methods, longitudinal data, Bayesian methodology, incomplete data, clinical trials and time-to-event analysis, as well as on specific methods and issues related to clinical trials. 2. Bioinformatics: focuses on (generalized) linear models, high dimensional data analysis methods, analysis of 	Schoters	https://www.schoters.com/id/beasiswa/vlir-uos-scholarship-master-of-statistics-and-data-science-2-years-hasselt-university-376	https://www.uhasselt.be/en/study/programmes/master-of-statistics-and-data-science	[-0.066223145,-0.0049705505,0.06304932,-0.00083351135,-0.05041504,-0.009780884,-0.01914978,0.02911377,0.0047035217,0.0013580322,0.0015106201,-0.048980713,-0.022323608,0.0034446716,0.0007805824,0.04385376,0.02078247,0.03778076,-0.026992798,0.025878906,0.018081665,-0.012145996,-0.00