352	Erasmus Bio Pharmaceutical Materials Science Biopham	Eropa	Luar Negeri (Perancis, Italia, Spanyol, Polandia)	S2	Beasiswa - Erasmus BIO&PHArmaceutical Materials science (BIOPHAM) untuk jenjang S2 dengan tipe Fully Funded di Spain, France, Italy, Poland	1 Februari 2026	Fully Funded	Ilmu Biomedis, Farmasi	• An EMJM scholarship is a financial contribution to cover the costs incurred by selected students. It includes support for: Travel and visa expenses, Installation costs and Subsistence costs. The scholarship is calculated as a monthly unit cost of €1,400, covering the entire study period required to complete the joint Master’s programme. The total is thus 1400€/month x 24 months = € 33 600. This includes study, research, placements, thesis preparation, and the final defense.  The first scholarship payment is made at the end of the first month of studies (September).	AGE No age requirement GPA No GPA requirement ENGLISH TEST IELTS: min. 7 TOEFL iBT: min. 90 TOEFL PBT TOEIC Duolingo NATIONALITY Indonesian OTHER LANGUAGE Not required STANDARDIZED TEST Not required DOCUMENTS Degree(s) certificate(s) and translation Copy of transcript of records and translation A letter of your university attesting your ranking in the class English proficiency Curriculum Vitae Passport Proof of residence Recommendation letters using the provided template ( https://www.master-biopham.eu/fileadmin/userupload/master-biopham/logos/RECOMMENDATIONLETTERFORANAPPLICANTTOBIOPHAMMASTER.docx ) Declaration of honor ( https://www.master-biopham.eu/fileadmin/userupload/master-biopham/visuels/DeclarationofhonorBIOPHAM.pdf ) Other documents OTHERS No other specific requirements mentioned.	Schoters	https://www.schoters.com/id/beasiswa/erasmus-bio-pharmaceutical-materials-science-biopham-385	https://www.master-biopham.eu/	[-0.058532715,0.031951904,-0.0002539158,0.009025574,-0.066223145,-0.032836914,-0.013954163,0.018066406,0.021148682,-0.030731201,0.00466156,-0.020996094,-0.02748108,0.0002939701,0.0061