365	Erasmus Advanced Structural Analysis And Design Using Composite Materials Frp	Eropa	Luar Negeri (Perancis, Italia, Spanyol, Portugal)	S2	Beasiswa - Erasmus Advanced Structural Analysis and Design using Composite Materials (FRP++) untuk jenjang S2 dengan tipe Fully Funded di Spain, France, Italy, Portugal	31 Januari 2026	Fully Funded	Teknik Elektro, Teknik Mesin, Teknik Robotika, Teknik Komputer, Teknik Sipil, Teknik Kimia, Teknik Dirgantara, Teknik Pertambangan dan Perminyakan, Teknik Industri, Teknik Umum, Ilmu Material dan Teknik, Teknik Lingkungan, Teknik Biomedis, Biorekayasa, Water engineering, Teknik Informatika, Kecerdasan Buatan, Nuclear, Marine Engineering, Nanotechnology, Acoustical Engineering, Pilot Studies, Communication Design, Engineering Systems and Management, "Health, Safety and Environmental Engineering", Arsitektur, Perencanaan Kota, Desain Interior, Sustainable Critical Infrastructure	• ERASMUS MUNDUS SCHOLARSHIPS\n• (supporting costs up to 25 800 EUR each):\n• 1. Contribution to the participation costs\n• Fully covered by the scholarship (9 000 EUR).\n• The Erasmus Mundus scholarship holder shall not be charged with any type of tuition fee.\n• 2. Contribution to travel, visa, installation and subsistence costs\n• 1 400 EUR per month for the entire duration of the Master programme.\n• CONSORTIUM SCHOLARSHIPS\n• Consortium scholarships are planned for students from any geographical origin applying mainly within the First Call, financed by the FRP++ Consortium itself.\n• Consortium scholarships are organized as follows:\n• Up to two scholarships per academic year of 9 000 EUR (fully covering tuition fees)\n• Up to three scholarships per academic year of 6 500 EUR (partially covering the tuition fees)\n• Up to six scholarships per academic year of 4 500 EUR (partially covering the tuition fees)	AGE No age requirement GPA No GPA requirement ENGLISH TEST IELTS: min. 7 TOEFL iBT: min. 72 TOEFL PBT NATIONALITY Indonesian OTHER LANGUAGE Not required