374	Erasmus University Rsm Non Eea Scholarship Of Excellence Iba	Eropa	Luar Negeri (Belanda)	S1	Beasiswa - Erasmus University - RSM non-EEA Scholarship of Excellence (IBA) untuk jenjang S1 dengan tipe Partially Funded di Netherlands	31 Januari 2026	Partially Funded	Administrasi Bisnis	• The scholarship is granted in the form of a tuition fee waiver and covers the difference between the non-EEA tuition fee (€12,700 in 2025-2026) and the EEA tuition fee (€2,601 in 2025-2026);\n• No actual transmission of money takes place. The scholarship part will be subtracted from the full non-EEA tuition fee before the start of the academic year, enabling you to immediately pay the reduced tuition fee; either at once or in installments.	AGE No age requirement GPA Min. Rapor: 80 out of 100 ENGLISH TEST IELTS: min. 7 TOEFL iBT: min. 80 NATIONALITY Indonesian OTHER LANGUAGE Not required STANDARDIZED TEST Not required DOCUMENTS Scholarship requirement: essay (two questions) A budget plan using this template, explaining how you are going to finance year 1, 2 and 3 of the IBA programme University admission requirement: Proof of english proficiency Transcript Graduation Certificate Math Exam Essay questions OTHERS No other specific requirements mentioned.	Schoters	https://www.schoters.com/id/beasiswa/erasmus-university-rsm-non-eea-scholarship-of-excellence-iba-414	https://www.rsm.nl/education/bachelor/iba/admission-finance/scholarships/	[-0.04711914,0.022247314,0.047668457,0.023223877,-0.030181885,-0.029373169,-0.022491455,0.058746338,0.006603241,-0.0074768066,-0.008071899,-0.031677246,-0.024368286,-0.02015686,0.010910034,0.03164673,-0.007659912,0.01222229,-0.05142212,0.035491943,0.052093506,-0.0074043274,-0.0051116943,0.00037884712,0.0546875,-0.032287598,0.03250122,0.0016260147,0.0004413128,-0.011192322,0.047454834,-0.016204834,0.007701874,-0.007713318,-0.013931274,0.025756836,-0.012138367,-0.013511658,0.009208679,-0.019592285,-0.029922485,-0.031158447,0.0043525696,-0.022201538,0.009841