376	Nanyang Technology University Ntu Ntu Research Scholarship	Asia	Luar Negeri (Singapura)	S2, S3	Beasiswa - Nanyang Technology University (NTU) - NTU Research Scholarship untuk jenjang S2, S3 dengan tipe Fully Funded di Singapore	31 Januari 2026	Fully Funded	Ilmu Kebumian, Ilmu Lingkungan, Arts, Media, Pendidikan, Psikologi, Sosiologi, Humanities, Studi Komunikasi, Teknik Kimia, Teknik Biomedis, Civil and Environmental Engineering, Electrical and Electronic Engineering, Ilmu Material dan Teknik, Mechanical and Aerospace Engineering, Ilmu Biologi, Kimia, Mathematical Sciences, Fisika, Sains, Computer Science and Engineering, Ekonomi, Mathematical Science, Medicine, Kebijakan Publik, Global Affairs	• 1. Monthly stipend:\n• International students:\n• master: S$2,900\n• PhD: S$3,000\n• 2. In addition to the monthly stipend, the award also covers the annual tuition fee.\n• For scholars who pass the Ph.D. Qualifying Examination/Confirmation, he/she may be eligible for an additional stipend of up to $500 per month. The increased in stipend is subjected to good performance in research and the attainment of required standards for courses taken. The University reserves the right to vary the amount of the stipend at any time by written notice.\n• The award is tenable for one (1) year in the first instance and is renewable subject to good progress. The maximum period of the Scholarship is two (2) years for Master's candidates and four (4) years for PhD candidates, as determined by school as well as availability of research funding in each case.	AGE No age requirement GPA No GPA requirement ENGLISH TEST IELTS: min. 7 TOEFL iBT: min. 100 TOEFL PBT NATIONALITY Indonesian OTHER LANGUAGE Not required STANDARDIZED TEST Standardized Test (Optional)\nGMAT/GRE DOCUMENTS Identification documents: Singapore Citizens: Scanned copy of NRIC Permanent Residents: Scanned copy of NRIC & Re-Entry Permit International Applicants: Scanned copy of Passport Test Scores (where applicable): TOEFL/ IELTS (Validity of 2 years at point of application) GRE/ GMAT/ GATE (Validity of 5 years at point of application) Education Qualifications: (in both original language and English translation) Degree Certificate Official Transcript (with grading system and honours classification details included) Official translation in English (if original is not in English) Two Referees' Reports Other Supporting documents (where applicable) Research proposal Resume Research publications OTHERS No other specific requirements mentioned.	Schoters	https://www.schoters.com/id/beasiswa/nanyang-technology-university-ntu-ntu-research-scholarship-416	https://www.ntu.edu.sg/admissions/graduate/financialmatters/scholarships	[-0.05053711,0.026107788,-0.0014181137,0.02758789,0.008911133,-0.028366089,-0.02154541,0.055847168,-0.033813477,-0.006629944,-0.010757446,0.009399414,-0.044708252,0.011940002,0.024002075,0.0031356812,-0.008987427,-0.026611328,-0.010299683,0.049072266,0.044555664,0.0121154785,0.012428284,-0.016601562,0.024215698,-0.049102783,0.030792236,0.009269714,-0.00088500977,0.010032654,0.030319214,-0.029800415,0.00041937828,0.026779175,-0.026473999,0.07965088,0.011581421,-0.00881958,-0.015197754,-0.07110596,-0.009185791,-0.023208618,-0.009788513,0.0061912537,0.014022827,0.017913818,-0.011268616,-0.013595581,-0.022262573,0.023864746,-0.00995636,-0.011703491,0.035949707,0.029937744,0.0034275055,0.051361084,0.004524231,0.014457703,0.00066518784,-0.017471313,0.054473877,0.008560181,0.034973145,0.018615723,0.003578186,-0.017974854,-0.021026611,0.017913818,-0.0023097992,6.0617924e-05,0.022354126,0.042297363,0.029678345,-0.051361084,0.0045280457,0.019760132,-0.0026931763,0.070251465,0.017868042,-0.046203613,-0.015731812,-0.034179688,-0.011116028,-0.0058670044,-0.022155762,-0.023284912,-0.05581665,-0.076049805,-0.055633545,-0.020370483,-0.029754639,-0.023223877,-0.093444824,0.055480957,0.035369873,0.013122559,-0.022079468,-0.0345459,0.011657715,0.03387451,-0.018249512,-0.037384033,0.026428223,