378	Erasmus Mundus Joint Master Degree In Aquaculture Environment And Society Star Aces Star	Eropa	Luar Negeri (Inggris, Perancis, Yunani)	S2	Beasiswa - Erasmus Mundus Joint Master Degree in Aquaculture, Environment and Society - Star (ACES-STAR) untuk jenjang S2 dengan tipe Fully Funded, Partially Funded di France, United Kingdom, Greece	30 Januari 2026	Fully Funded	Akuakultur, Studi Lingkungan Umum	• Erasmus Mundus Fully Funded Scholarships:\n• ACES-STAR scholarships are funded by the EACEA of the European Union and meet the cost of tuition fees, insurance and provide 1,400 Euros per month to successful applicants, which will contribute towards travel, relocation and daily living expenses. Please note: Erasmus Mundus scholarships are subject to availability\n• Erasmus Mundus Fee Waiver (Partial) Scholarships\n• We offer additional places on the course with tuition fees waived and full insurance cover for the duration of the programme, thanks to Erasmus Mundus funding.\n• Students who are awarded a fee-waiver (partial) scholarship will have the option to defer their place for 12 months, in order to make their financial arrangements.	AGE No age requirement GPA No GPA requirement ENGLISH TEST IELTS: min. 7 NATIONALITY Indonesian OTHER LANGUAGE Not required STANDARDIZED TEST Not required DOCUMENTS Completed EMJMD ACES+ application form (in Microsoft Word) in English, which must include a 350-word motivation (or personal) statement and 350-word statement giving information or examples of your previous experience in the field of aquaculture Completed UHI International application form Curriculum vitae (CV) in freestyle format A professional reference (of 500-800 words) Copy of your passport Copy of your degree certificate (plus certified translation into English if applicable); Copy of your transcript of marks (plus certified translation into English if applicable) Copy of your Secure English Language Test (i.e. IELTS) certificate OTHERS No other specific requirements m