393	Aalto University Excellence Scholarships Aalto University	Eropa	Luar Negeri (Finlandia)	S1	Beasiswa - Aalto University Excellence Scholarships - Aalto University untuk jenjang S1 dengan tipe Partially Funded di Finland	22 Januari 2026	Partially Funded	Desain Visual, Desain Produk, Seni Rupa, Seni Visual, Ekonomi, International Business, Teknik Kimia, Computational Science, Ilmu Data, Quantum System Engineering	• Aalto University scholarships are awarded as tuition fee waivers, covering either 50% or 100%.\n• Aalto University scholarships do not cover living costs. Students need to cover all living expenses (app. 800 euros per month) and other study related costs from their own financial resources.	AGE No age requirement GPA No GPA requirement ENGLISH TEST IELTS: min. 7 TOEFL iBT: min. 92 PTE Academic NATIONALITY Indonesian OTHER LANGUAGE Not required STANDARDIZED TEST Not required DOCUMENTS Required documents 1. Educational documents E.g. transcript of records and degree certificate copy of the most recent transcript of records or a certificate of ongoing studies (including information on the qualification to be completed and the estimated graduation date) as well as official translations if applicable 1. English Proficiency test result 2. Copy of a passport/KTP 3. Documents required by study option E.g. CV, motivation letter, portfolio OTHERS The difference between this study and others at Aalto University is in the tests required for admission. The Schools of Art, Design, and Architecture require English proficiency, but other studies only require SAT/ACT tests to prove language proficiency.	Schoters	https://www.schoters.com/id/beasiswa/aalto-university-excellence-scholarships-aalto-university-437	https://www.aalto.fi/en/study-options/scholarships-and-tuition-fees	[-0.030700684,-0.03491211,0.055877686,0.021865845,-0.0003311634,-0.035003662,-0.04345703,0.018112183,-0.01713562,-0.0025939941,-0.03024292,-0.05834961,-0.019424438,-0.029296875,-0.0025596619,0.031555