384	Erasmus Master In Law Data And Artificial Intelligence Emildai	Eropa	Luar Negeri (Perancis, Italia, Spanyol, Irlandia)	S2	Beasiswa - Erasmus Master in law, Data and Artificial Intelligence (EMILDAI) untuk jenjang S2 dengan tipe Partially Funded di Spain, France, Ireland, Italy	25 Januari 2026	Partially Funded	Hukum dan Studi Hukum, Ilmu Data, Kecerdasan Buatan, Computing	• A Partial Fee Waiver covers the costs of the Tuition Fees of your second year of study. In this case, you will be required to pay a deposit of €1000 to secure your place, and subsequently pay the normal tuition fees for year 1 of the programme. However, you will be exempted from paying Tuition Fees in the second year of the programme.	AGE No age requirement GPA No GPA requirement ENGLISH TEST IELTS: min. 7 NATIONALITY Indonesian OTHER LANGUAGE Not required STANDARDIZED TEST Not required DOCUMENTS An electronic copy of all diplomas and academic transcripts (if the degree is not in English, a certified English translation will be required). Evidence of language competences Preference as regards which Stream (Law or Computing) and which Study Track (Data Governance or Cybersecurity) A 500 – 750 word personal statement including: * an explanation of why you wish to undertake the EMILDAI programme; an analysis of what makes you suitable for the EMILDAI programme; an illustration of the impact which you expect EMILDAI to have on your future careers CV and details of relevant experience Two reference letters (issued on official headed paper by an academic referee or a former employer, and including the referee’s email address and signature). OTHERS No other specific requirements mentioned.	Schoters	https://www.schoters.com/id/beasiswa/erasmus-master-in-law-data-and-artificial-intelligence-emildai-425	https://emildai.eu/	[-0.032470703,0.014480591,0.02406311,-0.017654419,-0.016830444,-0.02041626,-0.026290894,0.048309326,0.003900528,0.0023117065,0.00034165382,-0.041229248,-0.053375244,-0.021972656,0.025