394	Mext University Recommendation Yokohama National University Special Program International Priority Graduate Programs Pgp	Asia	Luar Negeri (Jepang)	S3	Beasiswa - MEXT University Recommendation - Yokohama National University - Special Program: International Priority Graduate Programs (PGP) untuk jenjang S3 dengan tipe Fully Funded di Japan	21 Januari 2026	Fully Funded	International Economics, Comparative Economics, International Political Economy, Ekonomi	• MEXT shall allocate scholarships and international travel funding to Japan. In addition, the PGP scholarship recipients will receive a tuition waiver from YNU. The PGP scholarship provides a monthly stipend of 148,000 yen (subject to change) for three IPhD students for up to three years of study (contingent upon excellent academic performance).	AGE Max Age: 34 GPA Min. GPA: 3.3 out of 4.00 ENGLISH TEST IELTS: min. 6 TOEFL iBT: min. 79 NATIONALITY Indonesian OTHER LANGUAGE Not required STANDARDIZED TEST Not required DOCUMENTS 1. Application for Japanese Government Scholarship (duplex, i.e., double-sided, printing) pdf 2. Field of Study and Research Plan (duplex, i.e., double-sided, printing) word pdf 3. Photograph (4.5×3.5 cm, taken within the past six months, upper body, full-faced, no hats. Write your name and nationality on the reverse side and paste it onto the application form. Digital photographs also acceptable). 4. Abstract of thesis or research paper 5. Recommendation from a high-ranking person such as the dean of a department, the program director, or a person in an equivalent position at the last university attended addressed to Dr. UMEHARA Izuru, President, Yokohama National University. OTHERS No other specific requirements mentioned.	Schoters	https://www.schoters.com/id/beasiswa/mext-university-recommendation-yokohama-national-university-special-program-international-priority-graduate-programs-pgp-438	https://www.urban.ynu.ac.jp/english/all-english-program/special-graduate-program/application-guidel