399	University Of Vaasa International Excellence Scholarship	Eropa	Luar Negeri (Finlandia)	S2	Beasiswa - University of Vaasa - International Excellence Scholarship untuk jenjang S2 dengan tipe Partially Funded di Finland	21 Januari 2026	Partially Funded	Keuangan, International Business and Trade, Business Development, Industrial Management, Sustainable Manufacturing, Project Management	• Each Master’s Programme offers International Excellence Scholarships to applicants who have a CGPA of at least 4/5 (Finnish system) or equivalent in their respective international grading. The International Excellence Scholarship is granted as a first year tuition fee waiver as follows:\n• EUR 4 000 (in all programmes)\n• Therefore, if you qualify for this scholarship, you are required to pay 10 000 euros for your first year.	AGE No age requirement GPA No GPA requirement ENGLISH TEST IELTS: min. 7 TOEFL iBT: min. 92 PTE Academic NATIONALITY Indonesian OTHER LANGUAGE Not required STANDARDIZED TEST Not required DOCUMENTS Officially certified copy of Degree certificate(s), if graduated Officially certified copy of Transcript(s) of records (an explanation of the grading system used is mandatory if it is not clearly stated in the Transcript) Proof of language proficiency Copy of passport's information page / official ID card Curriculum Vitae (CV / resume, you can use for example the Europass CV form) Document to prove your exemption from tuition fees (e.g. copy of your residence permit card to Finland), if applicable Motivation letter If you have completed or are completing your degree in Indonesia, an official transcript of records must be submitted to the University of Vaasa by the awarding institution. The envelope must be sealed by the awarding institution’s official stamp across the back flap. OTHERS No oth	Schoters	https://www.schoters.com/id/beasiswa/university-of-vaasa-international-excellence-scholarship-443	https://www.uwasa.fi/en/admission/how-to-apply	[-0.06439209,-0.00267219