s students for two academic years (= 4 semesters)\n• Tuition waiver) is granted to Bachelor's students for three academic years (= 6 semesters).\n• Award Criteria: In most cases, the tuition waiver is awarded to a limited number of accepted students based on their application scores. There is no waiting list. The scholarship is tied to the tuition fee obligation.	AGE No age requirement GPA No GPA requirement ENGLISH TEST IELTS: min. 7 TOEFL iBT: min. 92 PTE Academic NATIONALITY Indonesian OTHER LANGUAGE Not required STANDARDIZED TEST Not required DOCUMENTS the scanned copy of the original degree certificate (in the original language) and an English, Finnish or Swedish translation of the degree certificate the scanned copy of the original transcript of records (in the original language) and an English, Finnish or Swedish translation of the transcript of records. application form (online) Proof of English language proficience Curriculum vitae (CV) of the applicant A copy of passport's information page or a copy of an official ID card Two recommendation letters, use the template provided note: document detail differ for each majors OTHERS No other specific requirements mentioned.	Schoters	https://www.schoters.com/id/beasiswa/university-of-eastern-finland-uef-scholarship-440	https://www.uef.fi/en/degree-programmes/scholarships	[-0.050354004,-0.008514404,0.057373047,0.032104492,-0.020217896,0.007827759,-0.050476074,0.031173706,-0.0013208389,0.018249512,0.006210327,-0.027160645,-0.018829346,-0.029327393,0.02178955,0.046844482,0.014411926,-0.024795532,-0.026138306,0.033416748,0.038330078,-0.028274536,0.02330017,-0.0016975403,0.018753052,-0.055786133,0.029800415,0.018600464,-0.034179688,0.0066337585,0.0791626,0.0020160675,-0.026412964,-0.0015516281,-0.034851074,0.019744873,0.006603241,-0.005947113,-0.02229309,-0.055145264,-0.028015137,-0.027389526,-0.024978638,-0.032348633,-0.001865387,0.050720215,0.014923096,0.001326561,0.014137268,0.029312134,0.015045166,-0.008018494,0.03