404	Nanyang Technological University Ntu Ntu President Award	Asia	Luar Negeri (Singapura)	S1	Beasiswa - Nanyang Technological University (NTU) - NTU President Award untuk jenjang S1 dengan tipe Partially Funded di Singapore	20 Januari 2026	Partially Funded	Matematika, Fisika, Ilmu Biologi, Ilmu Biomedis, Teknik Elektro, Teknik Mesin, Teknik Robotika, Teknik Komputer, Teknik Sipil, Teknik Kimia, Teknik Dirgantara, Ilmu Material dan Teknik, Teknik Lingkungan, Teknik Biomedis, Psikologi, Bahasa dan Sastra, Antropologi, Studi Komunikasi, Filsafat, Desain Produk, Seni Rupa, Seni Visual, Ekonomi, Akuntansi, Ilmu Komputer, Administrasi Bisnis, Studi Lingkungan Umum, Pendidikan Bahasa, Pendidikan Umum, Hubungan Internasional, Kebijakan Publik, Ilmu Olahraga	• The NTU President Award covers up to the normal programme duration on condition that the award holder maintain a record of good academic performance and exemplary conduct.\n• Study Allowance worth $10,000 (one-off)\n• Fully subsidised, 4 year guarantee for NTU Hostel,\n• Mentoring opportunities with NTU Senior Management and Notable Alumni\n• Various developmental opportunities (URECA, talent development opportunities, Priority Exchange, etc)\n• No bond is attached to the NTU President Award apart from the bond applicable under the MOE Tuition Grant Scheme.\n• Additional support in the form of an overseas travel allowance ($10,000, one-off), tuition fee coverage via bursaries and an annual study allowance of $10,000 (upgraded from a one-off study allowance only) may be given to applicants who require further financial aid, subject to meeting further terms and conditions.	AGE No age requirement GPA No GPA requirement ENGLISH TEST IELTS: min. 6 TOEFL iBT: min. 90 NATIONALITY Indonesian OTHER LANGUAGE Not required STANDARDIZED TEST Standardized Test (Optional)\nSAT, ACT SAT: 1250\nACT: 30 DOCUMENTS personal essay 250 words upload a recent passport-size photo (digital image). submit a referee's appraisal online. The apprai