407	Nanyang Technological University Ntu Ntu Science And Technology Undergraduate Scholarship	Asia	Luar Negeri (Singapura)	S1	Beasiswa - Nanyang Technological University (NTU) - NTU Science and Technology Undergraduate Scholarship untuk jenjang S1 dengan tipe Fully Funded di Singapore	20 Januari 2026	Fully Funded	Matematika, Fisika, Ilmu Biologi, Ilmu Biomedis, Teknik Elektro, Teknik Mesin, Teknik Robotika, Teknik Komputer, Teknik Sipil, Teknik Kimia, Teknik Dirgantara, Ilmu Material dan Teknik, Teknik Lingkungan, Teknik Biomedis, Psikologi, Desain Produk, Ilmu Komputer	• The NTU Science and Technology Undergraduate Scholarship covers up to the normal programme duration on condition that the scholarship holder maintain a record of good academic performance and exemplary conduct.\n• Full coverage of subsidised tuition fees (after Tuition Grant​) and all compulsory miscellaneous fees.\n• Living allowance of S$6,000 per academic year.\n• Annual accommodation allowance pegged at the lowest double room rate for on-campus accommodation.\n• Settling-in allowance of S$200 (one-off).\n• One off computer allowance of S$1,750\n• Travel allowance to defray transport cost for incoming passage from home country to Singapore at the start of course, and return passage between Singapore and home country after the completion of course (subject to proof of employment).	AGE No age requirement GPA No GPA requirement ENGLISH TEST IELTS: min. 6 TOEFL iBT: min. 90 NATIONALITY Indonesian OTHER LANGUAGE Not required STANDARDIZED TEST Standardized Test (Optional)\nSAT, ACT SAT: 1250\nACT: 30 DOCUMENTS As part of completing the form, a Personal Essay of not more than 250 words is required. The scholarship application form includes 1 compulsory topic for the essay. upload a recent passport-size photo (digital image). submit a referee's appraisal online. The appraisal is to be completed by your school teacher, who must not be your family or relative. OTHERS Additional Qualification (from Academic Year 2024-25 whereby application will be considered more favorably if submitted)\nAt least 3 GCE Advanced Level (UK) subjects taken within 12 months in not more than 2 sittings, either from the same or different examination boards (Cambridge, Edexcel, OCR, AQA). However, applicants must be able to submit actual A level or A2 results before June of the year of application.	Schoters	https://www.schoters.com/id/beasiswa/nanyang-technological-university-ntu-ntu-science-and-technology-undergraduate-scholarship-453	https://www.ntu.edu.sg/admissions/undergraduate/scholarships	[-0.06555176,0.0067825317,0.0071907043,0.03366089,0.018157959,-0.028640747,-0.006828308,0.05444336,-0.011604309,0.0020179749,0.0025539398,0.0088272095,-0.04257202,0.014961243,0.021270752,-0.004421234,-0.013046265,-0.018417358,-0.015075684,0.04248047,0.04626465,0.0073509216,0.013900757,-0.018722534,0.031341553,-0.059783936,0.042144775,-0.005958557,-0.020736694,0.01777649,0.024795532,-0.029388428,0.010673523,0.023391724,-0.013885498,0.078552246,0.033477783,0.0126571655,-0.017547607,-0.060546875,-0.0068969727,-0.016159058,-0.009994507,-0.005947113,-0.0031318665,0.031463623,-0.016052246,-0.03326416,-0.05029297,0.029556274,0.00016462803,-0.012214661,0.04107666,0.01914978,-0.010902405,0.06402588,-0.0053749084,0.013153076,-0.00041103363,-0.027893066,0.03604126,0.016326904,0.016036987,0.00944519,0.011878967,-0.019226074,0.0056152344,0.027893066,-0.008659363,-0.0006246567,0.0048446655,0.0519104,0.037597656,-0.051818848,0.025024414,0.03591919,0.011451721,0.06695557,0.022766113,-0.05142212,-0.0095825195,-0.041870117,-0.00466156,0.00093746185,-0.023147583,-0.025817871,-0.064453125,-0.069885254,-0.058013916,-0.016677856,-0.020721436,-0.022583008,-0.09637451,0.047973633,0.03643799,0.010749817,-0.013641357,-0.03387451,0.0075798035,0.02104187,-0.021560669,-0.036315918,0.018356323,-0.004714966,0.05215454,0.043823242,-0.025100708,-0.03475952,0.029083252,0.011230469,-0.09631348,-0.0023918152,0.0009407997,0.0036449432,