408	Nanyang Technological University Ntu Nbs Nanyang Business School Global Leaders Programme Scholarship	Asia	Luar Negeri (Singapura)	S1	Beasiswa - Nanyang Technological University (NTU) - NBS (Nanyang Business School) Global Leaders Programme Scholarship untuk jenjang S1 dengan tipe Fully Funded di Singapore	20 Januari 2026	Fully Funded	Bisnis, Akuntansi	• The scholarship covers up to the normal programme duration on the condition that the scholarship holder remains in the NBS Global Leaders Programme and maintains a record of good academic performance and exemplary conduct.\n• Full coverage of subsidised tuition fees (after Tuition Grant).\n• Living allowance of S$6,500 per academic year.\n• Accommodation allowance of up to S$2,000 per academic year.\n• (Applicable to scholarship holders who reside in NTU hostels only.)\n• Computer allowance of S$2,000 (one-off).\n• Travel Grant of up to S$8,000 for an overseas study/attachment programme subject to terms and conditions in the Travel Grant Form.\n• No bond is attached to the Scholarship apart from the three-year bond applicable to all Singapore PRs and international students under the MOE Tuition Grant Scheme.\n• The NBS Global Leaders Programme provides:\n• Global Exposure: Exchange Programme at UC Berkeley and Overseas Internship Opportunities\n• Mentorship from C-Suite Leaders\n• Curated Industry Workshops\n• Networking and Industry Connections\n• Innovation and Community Impact Project opportunities	AGE No age requirement GPA No GPA requirement ENGLISH TEST IELTS: min. 6 TOEFL iBT: min. 90 NATIONALITY Indonesian OTHER LANGUAGE Not required STANDARDIZED TEST Standardized Test (Optional)\nSAT, ACT SAT: 1250\nACT: 30 DOCUMENTS application form personal essay 250 words upload a recent passport-size photo (digital image). submit a referee's appraisal online. The appraisal is to be completed by your school teacher, who must not be your family or relative. OTHERS Additional Qualification (from Academic Year 2024-25 whereby application will be considered more favorably if submitted)\nAt least 3 GCE Advanced Level (UK) subjects taken within 12 months in not more than 2 sittings, either from the same or different examination boards (Cambridge, Edexcel, OCR, AQA). However, applicants must be able to submit actual A level or A2 results before June of the year of application. The A Level subjects taken must meet the minimum subject requirements of the programmes applying for.  A-Level Mathematics	Schoters	https://www.schoters.com/id/beasiswa/nanyang-technological-university-ntu-nbs-nanyang-business-school-global-leaders-programme-scholarship-454	https://www.ntu.edu.sg/admissions/undergraduate/scholarships	[-0.051483154,0.018447876,0.024856567,0.014587402,0.013160706,-0.020477295,-0.0054740906,0.059020996,-0.0029735565,-0.0057868958,0.0099105835,0.008728027,-0.04776001,-0.005874634,0.008331299,0.014831543,-0.030731201,-0.019424438,-0.017913818,0.047302246,0.06109619,0.04196167,0.0032634735,0.005214691,0.030410767,-0.04638672,0.03591919,0.0042304993,-0.0017433167,-0.005947113,0.056671143,-0.0076789856,0.013183594,0.037719727,-0.022506714,0.045043945,0.031799316,0.017990112,0.0032749176,-0.04510498,-0.007091522,-0.01637268,-0.016555786,-0.0064811707,0.0152282715,0.042816162,-0.015945435,-0.031280518,-0.02355957,0.044158936,0.0033035278,0.0003221035,0.047576904,0.019729614,-0.0056533813,0.052368164,-0.0047035217,0.017990112,-0.00491333,-0.017211914,0.035461426,0.016143799,0.0033073425,0.027572632,-0.0017681122,-0.039764404,-0.013343811,0.027496338,-0.010635376,-0.007347107,-0.005077362,0.056640625,0.033599854,-0.051574707,0.014434814,0.02961731,0.008766174,0.07110596,0.03805542,-0.03062439,-0.01576233,-0.032409668,-0.0051956177,0.015975952,-0.02204895,-0.029876709,-0.047973633,-0.05267334,-0.048828125,-0.012237549,0.0040130615,-0.025131226,-0.07946777,0.058776855,0.047546387,0.015823364,-0.01586914,-0.014411926,0.021072388,0.023071289,-0.016296387,-0.03668213,0.017318726,-0.02305603,0.05