409	Nanyang Technological University Ntu Nanyang Merit Scholarship	Asia	Luar Negeri (Singapura)	S1	Beasiswa - Nanyang Technological University (NTU) - Nanyang Merit Scholarship untuk jenjang S1 dengan tipe Fully Funded di Singapore	20 Januari 2026	Fully Funded	Matematika, Fisika, Ilmu Biologi, Ilmu Biomedis, Teknik Elektro, Teknik Mesin, Teknik Robotika, Teknik Komputer, Teknik Sipil, Teknik Kimia, Teknik Dirgantara, Ilmu Material dan Teknik, Teknik Lingkungan, Teknik Biomedis, Psikologi, Bahasa dan Sastra, Antropologi, Studi Komunikasi, Filsafat, Desain Produk, Seni Rupa, Seni Visual, Ekonomi, Akuntansi, Ilmu Komputer, Administrasi Bisnis, Studi Lingkungan Umum, Pendidikan Bahasa, Pendidikan Umum, Hubungan Internasional, Kebijakan Publik, Ilmu Olahraga	• The scholarship covers up to the normal programme duration on condition that the scholarship holder maintain a record of good academic performance and exemplary conduct.\n• Full coverage of subsidised tuition fees (after Tuition Grant)​​.\n• Living allowance of S$5,000 per academic year.\n• $4000 Travel Grant (one-off)\n• No bond is attached to the Nanyang Merit Scholarship apart from the three-year bond applicable to all Singapore PRs and international students under the MOE Tuition Grant Scheme.	AGE No age requirement GPA No GPA requirement ENGLISH TEST IELTS: min. 6 TOEFL iBT: min. 90 NATIONALITY Indonesian OTHER LANGUAGE Not required STANDARDIZED TEST Standardized Test (Optional)\nSAT, ACT SAT: 1250\nACT: 30 DOCUMENTS Application form personal essay 250 words upload a recent passport-size photo (digital image). submit a referee's appraisal online. The appraisal is to be completed by your school teacher, who must not be your family or relative. OTHERS Additional Qualification (from Academic Year 2024-25 whereby application will be considered more favorably if submitted)\nAt least 3 GCE Advanced Level (UK) subjects taken within 12 months in not more than 2 sittings, either from the same or different examination b