410	Nanyang Technological University Ntu Nanyang Business School Scholarship	Asia	Luar Negeri (Singapura)	S1	Beasiswa - Nanyang Technological University (NTU) - Nanyang Business School Scholarship untuk jenjang S1 dengan tipe Partially Funded di Singapore	20 Januari 2026	Partially Funded	Bisnis, Akuntansi	• The Scholarship covers up to the normal programme duration on condition that the scholarship holder maintain a record of good academic performance and exemplary conduct.\n• Full coverage of subsidised tuition fees (after Tuition Grant)​​.\n• No bond is attached to the Scholarship apart from the three-year bond applicable to all Singapore PRs and international students under the MOE Tuition Grant Scheme.	AGE No age requirement GPA No GPA requirement ENGLISH TEST IELTS: min. 6 TOEFL iBT: min. 90 NATIONALITY Indonesian OTHER LANGUAGE Not required STANDARDIZED TEST Standardized Test (Optional)\nSAT, ACT SAT: 1250\nACT: 30 DOCUMENTS Application form personal essay 250 words upload a recent passport-size photo (digital image). submit a referee's appraisal online. The appraisal is to be completed by your school teacher, who must not be your family or relative. OTHERS Additional Qualification (from Academic Year 2024-25 whereby application will be considered more favorably if submitted)\nAt least 3 GCE Advanced Level (UK) subjects taken within 12 months in not more than 2 sittings, either from the same or different examination boards (Cambridge, Edexcel, OCR, AQA). However, applicants must be able to submit actual A level or A2 results before June of the year of application. The A Level subjects taken must meet the minimum subject requirements of the programmes applying for.  A-Level Mathematics	Schoters	https://www.schoters.com/id/beasiswa/nanyang-technological-university-ntu-nanyang-business-school-scholarship-456	https://www.ntu.edu.sg/admissions/undergraduate/scholarships	[-0.06512451,0.01171875,0.008781433,0.022750854,0.01953125,-0.02104187,-0.010627747,0.068481445,