415	Ontario Graduate Scholarship Ogs Program University Of Toronto	Amerika	Luar Negeri (Kanada)	S2, S3	Beasiswa - Ontario Graduate Scholarship (OGS) Program - University of Toronto untuk jenjang S2, S3 dengan tipe Partially Funded di Canada	16 Januari 2026	Partially Funded	Teknik Dirgantara, Antropologi, Psikologi, Arsitektur, Biochemistry, Teknik Biomedis, European Studies, Teknik Kimia, Kimia, Applied Chemistry, Cinema Studies, Teknik Sipil, Classics, Literature, Kriminologi, Anatomy and Cell Biology, Ilmu Komputer, Curriculum and Instruction, Drama and the Theatre, East Asian Studies, Electrical and Computer Engineering, Ekonomi, Ecology, Bahasa Inggris, Ilmu Lingkungan, Ilmu Kebumian, Kinesiologi, Art History, Forestry, French Language and Literature, Manajemen, German Language and Literature, Geography, Public Policy and Global Affairs, Sejarah, Kesehatan Masyarakat, Manajemen Kesehatan, Pendidikan, Filsafat, Immunology, Human Resources, Italian Studies, Hukum, Linguistik, Laboratory, Matematika, Biophysics, Molecular Biology and Genetics, Teknik Industri, Teknik Mesin, Ilmu Material dan Teknik, Ilmu Kedokteran, Medieval Studies, Musik, Ilmu Gizi, Terapi Okupasi, Pharmacology, Physical Science, Pharmaceutical Science, Fisioterapi, Fisika, Ilmu Politik, Physiological Sciences, Ilmu Psikologi, Psikologi Klinis, Theology and Religion, Speech Pathology, Sosiologi, Spanish, Statistical Science, Pekerjaan Sosial, Studi Gender	• The value of the OGS is $5,000 per session. Thus, awardees may receive $10,000 for two consecutive sessions or $15,000 for three consecutive sessions. In all instances, the awarding graduate unit will contribute to one-third the cost of the total award received by the students.\n• Each scholarship is tenable for one year (i.e., two consecutive or three academic sessions). The value and duration of each OGS award will be determined by the awarding graduate unit and detailed in the offer letter.\n• Master’s students may receive a maximum of two 