437	Erasmus Religious Diversity In A Globalised World Red Global Erasmus Mundus Joint Master Emjm Scholarship	Eropa	Luar Negeri (Belanda, Swiss, Spanyol, Portugal, Brasil, Meksiko)	S2	Beasiswa - Erasmus Religious Diversity in a Globalised World (ReD Global) - Erasmus Mundus Joint Master (EMJM) Scholarship untuk jenjang S2 dengan tipe Fully Funded di Brazil, Switzerland, Chile, Spain, Mexico, Netherlands, Portugal	15 Januari 2026	Fully Funded	Antropologi, Studi Budaya dan Agama, Filsafat, Sejarah, Sosiologi	• Scholarships are distributed across the four cohorts enrolling between 2023 and 2026.\n• A monthly allowance of EUR 1.400 to cover travel, visa, installation and subsistence costs. (Installation costs are meant to cover additional costs such as the visa application procedure, issuing of residence permit, temporary accommodation costs etc.)\n• A full (participation) fee waiver\n• Insurance in line with EACEA requirements	AGE No age requirement GPA Min. Rapor: 75 out of 100 ENGLISH TEST IELTS: min. 7 TOEFL iBT: min. 100 NATIONALITY Indonesian OTHER LANGUAGE Not required STANDARDIZED TEST Not required DOCUMENTS Application form ( https://www.formdesk.com/rug/red-global-application-form ) Passport A Bachelor degree certificate or diploma Academic transcripts Explanation of the grading system in place at the degree-awarding institution. Curriculum Vitae (CV) English language profiency Motivation letter Two reference letters Optional official proof of (socio-)economic vulnerability OTHERS No other specific requirements mentioned.	Schoters	https://www.schoters.com/id/beasiswa/erasmus-religious-diversity-in-a-globalised-world-red-global-erasmus-mundus-joint-master-emjm-scholarship-484	https://www.uva.nl/en/education/master-s/scholarships-and-funding/amsterdam-merit-scholarship/amsterdam-merit-scholarship.html	[-0.034851074,0.027313232,0.057678223,0.031829834,-0.03451538,-0.0037326813,-0.001996994,0.06738281,0.00057697296,-0.024902344,-0.036712646,-0.035949707,-0.0484924