441	City University Of Hong Kong Cityu Entrance Scholarship Scheme	Asia	Luar Negeri (Hong Kong)	S1	Beasiswa - City University of Hong Kong (CityU) - Entrance Scholarship Scheme untuk jenjang S1 dengan tipe Fully Funded, Partially Funded di Hong Kong	15 Januari 2026	Fully Funded	Fisika, Kimia, Ilmu Alam Terapan, Ilmu Biologi, Bioteknologi, Ilmu Biomedis, Teknik Elektro, Teknik Mesin, Teknik Robotika, Teknik Sipil, Ilmu Material dan Teknik, Teknik Lingkungan, Psikologi, Hukum dan Studi Hukum, Bahasa dan Sastra, Studi Komunikasi, Studi Budaya dan Agama, Keuangan, Ekonomi, Akuntansi, Ilmu Komputer, Ilmu Data, Sistem Informasi, Manajemen Bisnis, Manajemen Energi, Studi Lingkungan Umum, Arsitektur	• The Scheme offers three kinds of scholarships\n• Top Scholarships of HKD200,000 (approximately USD25,600), covering annual tuition fees, on-campus accommodation and living expenses\n• Full Tuition Scholarships, covering annual tuition fees (approximately USD20,500)\n• Half Tuition Scholarships, covering half of the annual tuition fees (approximately USD10,250).	AGE No age requirement GPA No GPA requirement ENGLISH TEST IELTS: min. 7 TOEFL iBT: min. 79 NATIONALITY Indonesian OTHER LANGUAGE Not required STANDARDIZED TEST Not required DOCUMENTS latest official high school transcript (include results of all Grade 10 and 11 subjects) with English translation an explanation of the transcript grading system TOEFL/IELTS results or other acceptable English results, if available Ijazah SMA CITYU Undergraduate Admission Document: HIGH SCHOOL CERTIFICATE DIPLOMA STATEMENT OF PURPOSE PROOF OF ENGLISH PROFICIENCY (TOEFL/IELTS)* HIGH SCHOOL TRANSCRIPT (PORTFOLIO ONLY FOR SCHOOL OF CREATIVE MEDIA) PUBLIC EXAMINATION APPLICANTS (E.G. IB, SAT I, GCSE, GCEASL) RESULTS, IF AVAILABLE latest official high school transcript (include results of all Grade 10 and 11 subjects) with English translation an explanation of the transcript grading system Please note: 1. Scanned copies of the required document