442	University Of Amsterdam Amsterdam Merit Scholarship Ams	Eropa	Luar Negeri (Belanda)	S1	Beasiswa - University of Amsterdam - Amsterdam Merit Scholarship (AMS) untuk jenjang S1 dengan tipe Partially Funded di Netherlands	15 Januari 2026	Partially Funded	Administrasi Bisnis	• The value of the scholarship is €6,000 per year (a total of €18,000). A small number of scholarships are available each year. Last academic year we could award 1 scholarship per programme.\n• Please note that the scholarship works on a reimbursement basis and is not a tuition fee waiver. You will therefore have to arrange the payment of your tuition fee yourself. The scholarship will be paid out in 12 equal instalments.	AGE No age requirement GPA Min. Rapor: 90 out of 100 ENGLISH TEST IELTS: min. 7 TOEFL iBT: min. 100 CAE NATIONALITY Indonesian OTHER LANGUAGE Not required STANDARDIZED TEST Not required DOCUMENTS 1. An excellent Matching result (for BSc Actuarial Science, Economics and Business Economics, Business Analytics, Econometrics). Applicants must register and participate in the early selection/matching rounds, see application form. 2. An excellent selection result ( BSc Business Administration). 3. Motivation letter (not more than 300 words) to tell us why you deserve this scholarship including eventual financial needs. Upload the following additional documents in the scholarship application in Embark Recommendation letter by a dean, teacher, or academic supervisor. Motivation letter explaining why you deserve this scholarship (300 words): 1. Why would you need a Scholarship? 2. Why would you deserve a Scholarship? Include a description of academic excellence and if applicable other merits. OT	Schoters	https://www.schoters.com/id/beasiswa/university-of-amsterdam-amsterdam-merit-scholarship-ams-489	https://www.uva.nl/en/education/master-s/scholarships-and-funding/amsterdam-merit-scholarship/amsterdam-merit-scholarship.html	[-0.05206299,-0.007068634,0.060333252,0.039367676,-0.021865845,-