444	Roskilde University Tuition Fee Waivers And Scholarships	Eropa	Luar Negeri (Denmark)	S2	Beasiswa - Roskilde University - Tuition fee waivers and scholarships untuk jenjang S2 dengan tipe Partially Funded di Denmark	15 Januari 2026	Partially Funded	All Majors	• The tuition fee waivers and scholarships are only distributed once a year for the September entry. The tuition fee waiver and scholarship has a maximum length of 22 months for programmes that start in September. The scholarship amounts to DKK 7,800 per month, and is meant to cover living expenses in Denmark.	AGE No age requirement GPA No GPA requirement ENGLISH TEST IELTS: min. 7 TOEFL iBT: min. 83 NATIONALITY Indonesian OTHER LANGUAGE Not required STANDARDIZED TEST Not required DOCUMENTS 1) Official documentation of completed academic degrees or in-progress academic degrees 2) Official English or Danish translation of all uploaded educational documents 3) Proof of English language qualifications 4) Proof of Danish language qualifications 5) Copy of the identification page of your passport 60 Motivational letter: one A4-page outlining your qualifications for the master's programme you are applying for 7) CV OTHERS No other specific requirements mentioned.	Schoters	https://www.schoters.com/id/beasiswa/roskilde-university-tuition-fee-waivers-and-scholarships-491	https://ruc.dk/en/study-at-ruc/tuition-fees-and-scholarships	[-0.046539307,0.018997192,0.039123535,0.030731201,-0.033233643,0.016174316,-0.052612305,0.024902344,0.0027923584,0.023239136,0.0017213821,-0.040863037,-0.021713257,0.017486572,0.038482666,0.02557373,-0.012001038,0.025939941,-0.025970459,0.057861328,0.04458618,0.007396698,-0.007774353,-0.01373291,0.0715332,-0.056030273,0.036346436,-0.011711121,0.012023926,-0.0051612854,0.011100769,-0.02822876,-0.0072517395,0.004753113,-0.052459717,0.018371582,0.03253174,-0.009468079,-0.02760315,-0.041870117,-0.050048828,-0.01966858,-0.005832672,-0.03262329,0.016113281,0.04748535,0.0068511963,-0.0101623535,0.