,000 / cca EUR 195 per year/person)\n• Note : Please bear in mind that these provisions are only a contribution to the living expenses of the Scholarship Holders. It means that it does not fully cover all the costs of living and the students need to add their own financial resources in order to cover all living expenses in Hungary	AGE Min Age: 18 GPA No GPA requirement ENGLISH TEST IELTS: min. 6 TOEFL iBT: min. 95 NATIONALITY Indonesian OTHER LANGUAGE Not required STANDARDIZED TEST Not required DOCUMENTS I. Submission to scholarship portal: Online application form Motivation letter School certificates and their translations Bachelor : secondary school graduation certificate Master : bachelor degree Doctoral : master degree Non-Degree : secondary school graduation certificate Transcript of records and its translations Acceptance of statement for application in the online system Medical certificate (depend on major and university) Proof of language proficiency and their translations (depend on major and university) Copy of identification document (depend on major and university) Research Plan (for Doctoral) Letter of recommendation (for Doctoral) Correspondence with Proposed Supervisor (for Doctoral) Portfolio and Audio Portfolio (only for major in Arts & Music (BA, MA, PhD, Non-Degree)) >> Checklist : http://stud	Schoters	https://www.schoters.com/id/beasiswa/stipendium-hungaricum-scholarship-program-phillipines-502	https://stipendiumhungaricum.hu/	[-0.09106445,0.014015198,-0.02532959,0.026824951,-0.031219482,-0.01828003,-0.006855011,0.0501709,-0.01473999,-0.026351929,-0.0052604675,-0.024459839,-0.035705566,-0.0060043335,0.026260376,0.062561035,0.019683838,0.033325195,-0.008201599,0.028533936,0.02279663,-0.0015258789,-0.0059890747,-0.016052246,0.035217285,-0.050811768,0.014404297,0.027526855,0.0076179504,-0.026535034,0.029067993,-0.031585693,0.0020256042,-0.0033340454,-0.029022217,0.057373047,-0.024658203,0.0005097389,-0.016555786,-0.040740967,-0.026916504,-0.01873779