456	Stipendium Hungaricum Scholarship Program Pakistan	Eropa	Luar Negeri (Hungaria)	S1, S2, S3	Beasiswa - Stipendium Hungaricum Scholarship Program - Pakistan untuk jenjang S1, S2, S3 dengan tipe Fully Funded di Hungary	15 Januari 2026	Fully Funded	Matematika, Fisika, Ilmu Kebumian, Kimia, Biologi, Ilmu Biologi, Bioteknologi, Studi Pertanian, Kesehatan Masyarakat, Kedokteran Hewan, Dentistry, Keperawatan, Optometrist, Teknik Elektro, Teknik Mesin, Teknik Robotika, Teknik Komputer, Teknik Sipil, Teknik Kimia, Teknik Industri, Ilmu Material dan Teknik, Teknik Lingkungan, Teknik Biomedis, Agricultural Engineering, Agricultural Water Management Engineering, Manajemen Teknik, Food Engineering, Horticultural Engineering, Logistics Engineering, Physicist Engineering, Rural Development Engineering, Timber Industry Engineering, Vehicle Engineering, Water Operation Engineering, Psikologi, Studi Komunikasi, Ilmu Humaniora, Sejarah, Sosiologi, Pekerjaan Sosial, English Language and Linguistics, French Literature, German Literature, Portuguese Literature, Spanish Literature, Hungarian Studies, Italianistica, Romanian Studies, Slavonic Studies, Desain Produk, Musik, Seni Pertunjukan, Seni Visual, Film and Television, Media Design, Keuangan, Ekonomi, Akuntansi, Ilmu Komputer, Administrasi Bisnis, Manajemen Bisnis, Pemasaran, Manajemen Rantai Pasok dan Logistik, Business Informatics, Studi Lingkungan Umum, Geography, Wildlife Management Engineering, Perencanaan Kota, Pendidikan Umum, Kindergarten Education, Pedagogy, Pre-School Teacher, Pariwisata, Kuliner, Viticulture and Oenology, Hubungan Internasional, Olahraga, Physical Training	• Fully Funded: Tuition free education\n• Monthly Stipend (HUF 43,700 / cca EUR 130) (Bachelor’s, master’s, one-tier master’s and non-degree programmes)\n• Monthly Stipend (HUF 140,000 (cca EUR 331) 4 semester, HUF 180,000 (cca EUR 425) 4 semester (Doctoral)\n• Accommodation contribution (HUF 40,000/month)\n• Medical insurance (HUF 65,000 / cca EUR 195 per year/person)\n• After successful departure to Hungary, the scholars will be eligible for the ticket reimbursement. HEC will reimburse the ticket amount for both departure and arrival (after completion of studies). According to the approved MoU by the Government of Pakistan the maximum provision amount for one side of ticket reimbursement is Rs.200,000/-\n• Note : Please bear in mind that these provisions are only a contribution to the living expenses of the Scholarship Holders. It means that it does not fully cover all the costs of living and the students need to add their own financial resources in order to cover all living expenses in Hungary	AGE Min Age: 18 GPA No GPA requirement ENGLISH TEST IELTS: min. 6 TOEFL iBT: min. 95 NATIONALITY Indonesian OTHER LANGUAGE Not required STANDARDIZED TEST Not required DOCUMENTS Online application form Motivation letter School certificates and their translations Bachelor : secondary school graduation certificate Master : bachelor degree Doctoral : master degree Non-Degree : secondary school graduation certificate Transcript of records and its translations Acceptance of statement for application in the online system Medical certificate (depend on major and university) ( http://studyinhungary.hu/static/upload/stipendium-hungaricum/medical-certificate-example.docx ( http://studyinhungary.hu/static/upload/stipendium-hungaricum/medical-certificate-example.docx ) ) Proof of language proficiency and their translations (depend on major and university) Copy of identification document (depend on major and university) Research Plan (for Doctoral) Letter of recommendation (for Doctoral) Corresponde	Schoters	https://www.schoters.com/id/beasiswa/stipendium-hungaricum-scholarship-program-pakistan-504	https://stipendiumhungaricum.hu/	[-0.09423828,-0.01159668,-0.011390686,0.030853271,-0.04156494,-0.013496399,-0.0067710876,0.07067871,0.0030784607,-0.017959595,0.0043182373,-0.028213501,-0.028640747,-0.012672424,0.028030396,0.06726074,0.0153