457	Middle East Doha Institute For Graduate Studies Tamim Scholarship And Sanad Scholarship	Asia	Luar Negeri (Qatar)	S2	Beasiswa - [Middle East] - Doha institute for Graduate Studies - Tamim Scholarship and Sanad Scholarship untuk jenjang S2 dengan tipe Fully Funded di Qatar	15 Januari 2026	Fully Funded	Comparative Literatures and Cultures, Politics, Hubungan Internasional, Filsafat, Kebijakan Publik, media studies, Jurnalistik, Linguistik, Arabic Studies, Sejarah, Human Rights, Sosiologi, Antropologi, Pekerjaan Sosial, Administrasi Publik, Conflict Management and Humanitarian Action, Psikologi, Development Economics	• ​1) Tamim Scholarship\n• ​These scholarships based on merit and academic excellence. It is dedicated to the most distinguished Qatari, Residents and international students in the Arab world. Scholarship include full tuition fees coverage, International students from outside Qatar will benefit from having fraccommodation in institute dormitories, a monthly stipend, and health insurance.\n• ​2) Sanad Scholarship​\n• ​These scholarship based on financial needs of students. It is dedicated to Qatari, Residents in Qatar and international students. Scholarship include covering a program's fees (10 to 100 %). International students from outside Qatar will benefit from having their full tuition fees covered, in addition to free accommodation in institute dormitories, a monthly stipend, and health insurance.​​​	AGE No age requirement GPA No GPA requirement ENGLISH TEST IELTS: min. 6 TOEFL iBT: min. 59 NATIONALITY Indonesian OTHER LANGUAGE Optional STANDARDIZED TEST Not required DOCUMENTS Scholarship application form 1. Fill in the application from in full, with all the required and supporting documents (We regret for not being able to review the missing files). 2. Copy of official identification (Passport for International students - Qatari ID for citizens and residents of Qatar). 3. A bachelor's degree certified by official authorities. 4. Undergraduate transcripts certified by official authorities including all transferred courses if any. Senior year students submit their latest transcripts. 5. A minimum of TWO references from academics familiar with the applicant's work requested via the online application form. An additional letter of recommendation may be submitted by a supervisor from previous employment. 6. Submit a valid minimum IELTS academic score 5.5 or TOEFL iBt score 59 or DELF B	Schoters	https://www.schoters.com/id/beasiswa/middle-east-doha-institute-for-graduate-studies-tamim-scholarship-and-sanad-scholarship-505	https://admissions.dohainstitute.edu.qa/psp/ps/?cmd=login&languageCd=ENG&	[0.0060806274,0.00843811,0.037384033,0.040802002,-0.017028809,0.013725281,-0.03857422,0.013648987,-0.03289795,-0.04083252,-0.012962341,-0.018859863,-0.024963379,-0.0010356903,0.01499176,0.029052734,-0.01436615,-0.0014743805,0.023391724,0.07244873,0.05239868,0.0069770813,-0.014640808,-0.004611969,0.06085205,-0.025177002,-0.003370285,0.023101807,-0.0076675415,0.0030345917,0.059509277,-0.02142334,0.0042304993,0.0020256042,-0.030593872,0.05303955,-0.013793945,0.01864624,-0.019348145,-0.074645996,-0.06677246,-0.021102905,-0.02355957,-0.023773193,0.015960693,0.049316406,0.015853882,0.013725281,0.006465912,0.019241333,0.0064353943,0.0038795471,0.026565552,0.029708862,0.011367798,0.017196655,0.010673523,-0.008895874,-0.005039215,-0.06359863,0.031204224,0.045440674,-0.0033664703,0.037200928,0.0024909973,-0.021865845,-0.0287323,0.01802063,-0.02822876,0.006286621,0.03302002,0.05343628,0.06652832,-0.034454346,-0.024841309,-0.0010681152,-0.0036010742,0.029342651,0.00415802,-0.04663086,-0.028030396,0.0012083054,-1.1444092e-05,0.016571045,-0.047546387,-0.014755249,-0.07922363,0.006084442,-0.061676025,0.0031356812,-0.0077438354,0.0051612854,-0.0546875,0.034606934,0.06970215,-0.024536133,0.013847351,-0.02619934,-0.010475159,0.026901245,-0.0077705383,-0.078308105,-0.0054969788,-0.04296875,0.095825195,0.010536194,0.003900528,-0.018035889,0.020