462	Technical University Of Denmark Dtu Tuition Fee Waivers For International Non Eu Eea Msc Students	Eropa	Luar Negeri (Denmark)	S2	Beasiswa - Technical University of Denmark (DTU) - Tuition fee waivers for International non-EU/EEA MSc students untuk jenjang S2 dengan tipe Partially Funded di Denmark	15 Januari 2026	Partially Funded	Applied Chemistry, Architectural Engineering, Bioinformatics, Teknik Biomedis, Bioteknologi, Business Analytics, Teknik Kimia, Biochemical Engineering, Teknik Sipil, Information and Communication Technology, Computer Science and Engineering, Teknik Elektro, Design and Engineering, Ilmu Kebumian, Physics and Astronomy, Acoustical Engineering, Teknik, Teknik Lingkungan, Food Science and Engineering, Kecerdasan Buatan, Industrial Engineering and Management, Teknik Material, ⁠Intelligent Manufacturing Engineering, Sustainable Energy Solutions and Innovation, Fishery Resources, Akuakultur, Entrepreneurship, Energy Engineering	• DTU has a very limited number of tuition fee waivers to award International new non-EU/EEA MSc students applying for the Autumn intake. The tuition fee waivers are allocated to students with excellent academic performance. A tuition fee waiver will cover the tuition fee for two years.	AGE No age requirement GPA No GPA requirement ENGLISH TEST IELTS: min. 7 TOEFL iBT: min. 88 NATIONALITY Indonesian OTHER LANGUAGE Not required STANDARDIZED TEST Not required DOCUMENTS Personal Statement Admission application documents: Final Diploma in both original language and a certified English translation Transcript of Records in both original language and a certified English translation Mandatory application template for your application (this includes GPA calculator with pre-mapping, Statement of Purpose, English proficiency). Two Letters of Recommendation - can be from university or work, but must be signed, stamped or issued with the official letter head. You should only upload two. CV Documentation of your local grading system 