464	Ku Leuven Ku Leuven Asean Scholarship	Eropa	Luar Negeri (Belgia)	S2	Beasiswa - KU Leuven - KU Leuven ASEAN Scholarship untuk jenjang S2 dengan tipe Fully Funded di Belgium	15 Januari 2026	Fully Funded	Matematika, Statistika, Fisika, Ilmu Kebumian, Kimia, Ilmu Alam Terapan, Hydrology, Nanoscience, Ilmu Biologi, Bioteknologi, Studi Pertanian, Ilmu Pangan, Biodiversity, Ilmu Biomedis, Teknik Elektro, Teknik Mesin, Teknik Komputer, Teknik Sipil, Teknik Kimia, Ilmu Material dan Teknik, Teknik Biomedis, Biorekayasa, Water engineering, Nuclear, Nanotechnology, Psikologi, Hukum dan Studi Hukum, Bahasa dan Sastra, Antropologi, Studi Komunikasi, Studi Budaya dan Agama, Sejarah, Sosiologi, Jurnalistik, People Studies, Society and Culture, Keuangan, Ekonomi, Ilmu Komputer, Kecerdasan Buatan, Sistem Informasi, Administrasi Bisnis, Manajemen Bisnis, Arsitektur, Pendidikan Umum, Hubungan Internasional, Ilmu Politik, Studi Regional	• Those who receive a KU Leuven ASEAN Scholarship are granted a full waiver of their tuition fees and pay only an annual administration fee of €136.50.\n• Incoming students will receive a one-off allowance of €4,000 for the entire duration of their programme at KU Leuven.\n• Duration\n• The tuition fee waiver is granted for the full duration of the programme (one academic year for a 60 ECTS master's programme and two academic years for a 120 ECTS master's programme).\n• The €4,000 allowance is a one-time lump sum, granted at the start of the programme at KU Leuven.	AGE No age requirement GPA No GPA requirement ENGLISH TEST IELTS: min. 7 TOEFL iBT: min. 94 NATIONALITY Indonesian OTHER LANGUAGE Not required STANDARDIZED TEST Not required DOCUMENTS Passport photo International passport or national ID A Curriculum Vitae (including your American GPA out of 4.0 and if applicable your publications, academic awards, previous scholarships, etc.) Transcript of records; if written in a language other than Dutch, French, German or English, a certified translation must be enclosed. English language test results or letter of exemption provided by the host university Letter of motivation written in English Two signed letters of recommendation from professors of your (previous) home university, university of applied sciences (and arts) or recent employer written in English. Copy of acquired diploma(s); if written in a language other than Dutch, French, German or English, a certified translation must be enclosed. OTHERS No other specific requirements mentioned.	Schoters	https://www.schoters.com/id/beasiswa/ku-leuven-ku-leuven-asean-scholarship-514	https://www.kuleuven.be/scholarships/	[-0.0692749,-0.016342163,0.020858765,0.030975342,-0.015945435,-0.012077332,-0.03250122,0.043182373,-0.0004930496,-0.00019407272,-0.016418457,-0.0569458,-0.046142578,-0.018600464,0.016021729,0.03668213,0.012031555,-0.00056934357,-0.03024292,0.017059326,0.028533936,0.0015687943,0.007865906,0.021453857,0.053985596,-0.07873535,0.03050232,-0.023208618,-0.023757935,-0.009010315,0.060821533,-0.017868042,-0.033447266,0.0059509277,-0.060668945,0.056427002,-0.008758545,-0.009521484,-0.011154175,-0.04055786,-0.0064048767,-0.014701843,-0.0022468567,-0.014198303,0.0055007935,0.05911255,-0.015945435,0.0154418945,-0.031402588,0.01600647,0.0070877075,0.0037631989,0.06549072,0.0152282715,-0.0021591187,0.03286743,0.03491211,-0.014335632,0.02897644,-0.016052246,0.058685303,0.013336182,-0.016281128,0.021591187,-0.027893066,-0.018630981,-0.011962891,0.012435913,-0.010124207,-0.011428833,0.016540527,0.032714844,0.041412354,-0.02897644,-0.041931152,0.026351929,0.003955841,0.06530762,-7.253885e-05,-0.007282257,-0.050872803,-0.048553467,0.0131073,-0.01737976,-0.017501831,-0.048095703,-0.07122803,-0.01727295,-0.02796936,-0.0054626465,-0.03729248,-0.039367676,-0.05722046,0.013473511,0.07598877,0.054473877,0.008071899,-0.044067383,0.006576538,0.045959473,0.009429932,-0.049316406,0.010116577,-0.04244995,0.05355835,0.027572632,0.011268616,-0.0033416748,0.028625488,0.021316528,