465	Ku Leuven Inspiring The Outstanding Scholarship	Eropa	Luar Negeri (Belgia)	S2	Beasiswa - KU Leuven - Inspiring the Outstanding Scholarship untuk jenjang S2 dengan tipe Fully Funded di Belgium	15 Januari 2026	Fully Funded	Matematika, Statistika, Fisika, Ilmu Kebumian, Kimia, Ilmu Alam Terapan, Hydrology, Nanoscience, Ilmu Biologi, Bioteknologi, Studi Pertanian, Ilmu Pangan, Biodiversity, Ilmu Biomedis, Teknik Elektro, Teknik Mesin, Teknik Komputer, Teknik Sipil, Teknik Kimia, Ilmu Material dan Teknik, Teknik Biomedis, Biorekayasa, Water engineering, Nuclear, Nanotechnology, Psikologi, Hukum dan Studi Hukum, Bahasa dan Sastra, Antropologi, Studi Komunikasi, Studi Budaya dan Agama, Sejarah, Sosiologi, Jurnalistik, People Studies, Society and Culture, Keuangan, Ekonomi, Ilmu Komputer, Kecerdasan Buatan, Sistem Informasi, Administrasi Bisnis, Manajemen Bisnis, Arsitektur, Pendidikan Umum, Hubungan Internasional, Ilmu Politik, Studi Regional	• The Inspiring the Outstanding Scholarship holders receive a full tuition fee waiver and pay only an annual administration fee of €136.50.\n• Incoming students will receive a scholarship of € 12,000 per academic year, for a maximum of two academic years.\n• The duration of the scholarship is one academic year for a 60 ECTS master's programme and two academic years for a 120 ECTS master's programme.	AGE No age requirement GPA No GPA requirement ENGLISH TEST IELTS: min. 7 TOEFL iBT: min. 94 NATIONALITY Indonesian OTHER LANGUAGE Not required STANDARDIZED TEST Not required DOCUMENTS Passport photo International passport or national ID A Curriculum Vitae (including your American GPA out of 4.0 and if applicable your publications, academic awards, previous scholarships, etc.) Transcript of records; if written in a language other than Dutch, French, German or English, a certified translation must be enclosed. English language test results or letter of exemption provided by the host university Letter of motivation written in English Two 