475	Erasmus Joint Master In Health And Wellbeing Across The Lifespan	Eropa	Luar Negeri (Spanyol)	S2	Beasiswa - Erasmus Joint Master in Health and Wellbeing across the Lifespan untuk jenjang S2 dengan tipe Fully Funded di Lisbon, Serbia, Spain	14 Januari 2026	Fully Funded	Ilmu Kesehatan, Nutrition	• Candidates are eligible for an Erasmus Mundus scholarship (1400€/month + tuition fee waiver), which is awarded based on the applicant's ranking, determined through the selection process (see application process).\n• Erasmus Mundus Scholarship will cover the total tuition fee and will guarantee a monthly allowance of 1.400€ for the duration of the academic activities and/or maximum of 24 months, to cover installation, travel and subsistence costs.\n• Sixteen scholarships will be attributed per intake.	AGE No age requirement GPA No GPA requirement ENGLISH TEST IELTS: min. 6 NATIONALITY Indonesian OTHER LANGUAGE Not required STANDARDIZED TEST Not required DOCUMENTS Curriculum vitae - must provide professional qualification(s), experience, professional skills.-  maximum 5 pages (PDF). Two or three Letters of Recommendation. These do not have to follow a template. The only requirements is that the contact details of the person providing the reference must be clearly typed, must be signed and if possible should contain a business email address and a telephone number. (PDF) Letter of motivation that expresses interest in studying  at HYGIEIA - maximum 750 words, including three sections: a) why you are applying; b) what are your expectations concerning the master, c) how do you see your future after master conclusion (PDF) Academic certificate -It should also contain the University stamp. If in other language than in English, additional officially certified translation into English is obl	Schoters	https://www.schoters.com/id/beasiswa/erasmus-joint-master-in-health-and-wellbeing-across-the-lifespan-531	https://erasmus-plus.ec.europa.eu/	[-0.062683105,0.01802063,0.0309906,0.000664