481	Erasmus Mundus Joint Master S Degree Programme In Communications Engineering And Data Science Codas	Eropa	Luar Negeri (Jerman, Perancis, Finlandia, Spanyol, Portugal)	S2	Beasiswa - Erasmus Mundus Joint Master’s Degree Programme in Communications Engineering and Data Science (CoDaS) untuk jenjang S2 dengan tipe Fully Funded di Finland, Germany, France, Spain, Portugal	12 Januari 2026	Fully Funded	Communication Engineering, Ilmu Data, Ilmu Komputer	• Erasmus Mundus scholarship\n• Erasmus Mundus scholarship covers the Programme fee (8000 EUR/academic year) for the normative duration of studies (two academic years). In addition, the Erasmus Mundus scholarship holder receives 1400€/month for the subsistence costs for the duration of the programme, max. 24 months.\n• CoDaS scholarship\n• CoDaS scholarship is a programme fee waiver, i.e., the scholarship covers the Programme fee (8000 EUR/academic year) for the normative duration of studies (two academic years).\n• The programme may also grant CoDaS Premium scholarships, which include a programme fee waiver for the normative duration of studies and monthly support for subsistence costs for the duration of the programme, max. 24 months. The amount of monthly support is determined for each student intake based on the available funds. The monthly support for students granted the CoDaS Premium scholarship in the 2025 intake was 208,33€.	AGE No age requirement GPA No GPA requirement ENGLISH TEST IELTS: min. 7 TOEFL iBT: min. 92 PTE Academic NATIONALITY Indonesian OTHER LANGUAGE Not required STANDARDIZED TEST Not required DOCUMENTS Obligatory documents to be uploaded to the application form (in PDF format) Scanned colour copy of the original Bachelor’s degree certificate Scanned colour copy of the original official transcript of study records. Copy of a valid passport or an official government-issued identification card with photo and information on citizenship. Proof of English language proficiency. Link to motivation video