485	University College London Research Excellence Scholarship	Eropa	Luar Negeri (Inggris)	S3	Beasiswa - University College London - Research Excellence Scholarship untuk jenjang S3 dengan tipe Fully Funded di United Kingdom	9 Januari 2026	Fully Funded	Statistika, Kimia, Biologi, Geometry, Fisika & Astronomi, Ilmu Biologi, Neuroscience, Psikologi Klinis, Ilmu Kedokteran, Kesehatan Masyarakat, Farmasi, Dentistry, Medical Physics, Pharmaceutical Science, Dental Hygiene and Therapy, Clinical and Psychosocial Epidemiology, Global Health, Teknik Elektro, Teknik Mesin, Teknik Sipil, Teknik Lingkungan, Biochemical Engineering, Medical Science & Engineering, Psikologi, Hukum dan Studi Hukum, Antropologi, Studi Komunikasi, Filsafat, Studi Gender, Sejarah, Studi Regional, Arkeologi, Digital Humanities and Computational Social Sciences, English Language and Linguistics, Studi Global, Americas Studies, Comparative Literatures and Cultures, French Literature, German Literature, Italian Literature, Portuguese Literature, Spanish Literature, Critical Security Studies, media studies, Inequalities and Social Science, Dutch Studies, European Studies, "Greek, Latin, Ancient Middle East", Hebrew and Jewish Studies, Scandinavian Studies, Film production, Ilmu Komputer, Kecerdasan Buatan, Keamanan Siber, Manajemen Energi, Studi Lingkungan Umum, Geography, Sustainability Science, "Soil, Water, Atmosphere", Manajemen Risiko dan Bencana, Arsitektur, Perencanaan Kota, Environmental Design, Landscape Planning, Pendidikan Bahasa, Pendidikan Umum, Pedagogy, Educational Research, Information Technology and Learning, Education and Child Psychology, Hubungan Internasional, Kebijakan Publik, Ilmu Politik	• The UCL-RES scholarship consists of full tuition fees (either Home or Overseas) plus a maintenance stipend during the research portion of the programme which increases each year with inflation.\n• For 2025/26, the stipend rate is £22,780 for full-time study (rates are calculated 'pro rata' for part-time students). For 2026/27, the stipend rate is to be confirmed.\n• The scholarship also includes additional research costs of up to £1,200 per year for the standard duration of the research portion of the programme.\n• Awards are made for the standard length of the research portion of the programme of study. This is normally 3 years for a full-time MPhil/PhD/EngD degree programme (or 5 years for part-time study), subject to sufficient academic progress. Please note the funding does not cover CRS/writing up year(s).	AGE No age requirement GPA Min. GPA: 3.3 out of 4.00 \nMin. Rapor: 65 out of 100 ENGLISH TEST IELTS: min. 7 TOEFL iBT: min. 96 CAE CPE NATIONALITY Indonesian OTHER LANGUAGE Not required STANDARDIZED TEST Standardized Test (Not Required)\nGRE DOCUMENTS 1. Research Scholarship cover sheet 2. CV 3. Research Proposal 4. Academic Transcript & Graduate Certificate 5. Academic Reference Letters OTHERS You must submit a complete application for admission onto an eligible degree programme by the specified deadline. You do not need to have secured an offer of a place at UCL in order to apply for the scholarship, but you must have submitted your admission application.\n\nBeasiswa ini bisa diapply utk holder master/doctorate juga (depends on each department requirement). Ada beasiswa cross-discipline juga kalau mau extend https://www.ucl.ac.uk/scholarships/research-excellence-scholarships-cross-disciplinary-training-one-year	Schoters	https://www.schoters.com/id/beasiswa/university-college-london-research-excellence-scholarship-548	https://www.ucl.ac.uk/scholarships/research-excellence-scholarship	[-0.038330078,0.026626587,0.03982544,0.03265381,-0.03012085,0.0032806396,-0.01663208,0.010353088,-0.037902832,0.0231781,-0.026062012,-0.054534912,0.009307861,0.04058838,0.04083252,0.0362854,0.011940002,-0.017578125,-0.034362793,0.051818848,0.030471802,-0.025283813,0.022842407,-0.0026988983,-0.0047721863,-0.06976318,0.037902832,-0.007663727,-0.030090332,0.025939941,0.0731