514	Wesleyan University Freeman Asian Scholarship Program	Amerika	Luar Negeri (Amerika Serikat)	S1	Beasiswa - Wesleyan University - Freeman Asian Scholarship Program untuk jenjang S1 dengan tipe Fully Funded di United States	1 Januari 2026	Fully Funded	Matematika, Fisika, Ilmu Kebumian, Kimia, Astronomi, Ilmu Biologi, Psikologi, Hukum dan Studi Hukum, Bahasa dan Sastra, Antropologi, Studi Budaya dan Agama, Filsafat, Seni Rupa, Seni Pertunjukan, Seni Visual, Ekonomi, Ilmu Komputer, Studi Lingkungan Umum, Pemerintahan	• Each Freeman Scholar will receive a scholarship to cover the full cost of attendance, including tuition, fees, room and board, supplies, and travel, totaling over $80,000 in funding.	AGE No age requirement GPA No GPA requirement ENGLISH TEST IELTS: min. 8 TOEFL iBT: min. 100 Duolingo NATIONALITY Indonesian OTHER LANGUAGE Not required STANDARDIZED TEST Standardized Test (Recommended)\nSAT, ACT DOCUMENTS Interested students must submit the Common ( https://www.commonapp.org/ ) or Scoir ( https://www.scoir.com/ ) Application, that includes: background information essay, a secondary (high) school/junior college transcript recommendations from two teachers and one counselor results (or predictions if available) of any standardized national examinations administered during the secondary school/junior college years. If you have graduated from or will graduate from a high school outside of the United States and English is not your first language, you will be required to answer an additional essay question. OTHERS should NOT apply in Early Decision as applicants for the scholarship will only be considered in the Regular Decision round.	Schoters	https://www.schoters.com/id/beasiswa/wesleyan-university-freeman-Asian-scholarship-program-583	https://www.wesleyan.edu/admission/undergraduate-admission/international/freeman-scholars.html	[-0.05340576,0.0013217926,0.04537964,0.06097412,0.01247406,-0.013549805,-0.013282776,0.04650879,0.0007762909,0.013084412,-0.00527572