521	Beasiswa Politeknik Astra	Asia	Dalam Negeri (Indonesia)	D3, D4,S1	Program beasiswa dari Astra International yang memberikan bantuan pendidikan dan pembinaan bagi mahasiswa berprestasi.	29 Februari 2026	Fully Funded	D3 Pembuatan Peralatan dan Perkakas Produksi\nD3 Teknik Produksi dan Proses Manufaktur\nD3 Teknologi Konstruksi Bangunan Gedung\nD3 Mesin Otomotif\nD3 Mekatronika\nD3 Manajemen Informatika\nD4 Teknologi Rekayasa Pemeliharaan Alat Berat\nD4 Teknologi Rekayasa Logistik\nD4 Teknologi Rekayasa Perangkat Lunak	• Bebas biaya sumbangan pendidikan dan biaya kuliah (gartis 100%)\n• mendapatkan uang saku tiap bulan\n• mendapatkan slot asrama untuk 1 tahun\n	1. Lulusan sma/smk sederajat dari semua jurusan\n2. sehat jasmani dan rohani serta tidak buta warna \n3. tinggi badan minimal 165cm (khusus untuk prodi teknologi rekayasa pemeliharaan alat berat)\n4. mengisi formulir pendaftaran lengkap di https://pmb.polytechnic.astra.ac.id/\n5. lulusan sma/smk/sederajat tahun 2025 dan 2026 (semua jurusan)\n6. mempunyai presetasi akademik/non akademik (nilai plus)\n7. mempunyai kemampuan interpersonal yang baik	indbeasiswa	https://indbeasiswa.com/beasiswa-astra/	https://indbeasiswa.com/beasiswa-astra/	[-0.04284668,0.02394104,0.019485474,-0.0076408386,-0.0049209595,-0.027648926,-0.03515625,0.02709961,0.022476196,-0.012313843,-0.006580353,-0.03314209,-0.011688232,-0.012489319,0.02418518,0.03540039,0.008079529,-0.02822876,-0.028121948,0.00415802,-0.014038086,0.019165039,-0.004749298,-0.029510498,0.051940918,-0.038116455,0.006008148,-0.013328552,-0.03250122,-0.020339966,-0.0023441315,-0.029434204,-0.012588501,-0.03463745,0.0024280548,0.028213501,0.023040771,0.009223938,0.024612427,-0.022109985,-0.050079346,-0.052642822,-0.030822754,0.011726379,0.008041382,0.04244995,0.0063705444,-0.0023040771,0.024658203,0.031707764,-0.003479004,-0.017684937,0.10180664,0.064086914,0.014389038,0.03338623,0.00217247,-0.026779175,0.011924744,-0.0088272095,0.056274414,0.018569946,0.03564453,0.01515