525	Beasiswa Sinar Mas Agribusiness & Food	Asia	Dalam Negeri (Indonesia)	S1	Program beasiswa dari Sinar Mas yang memberikan bantuan biaya kuliah dan pembinaan bagi mahasiswa.	31 Maret 2026	Fully Funded	Teknologi Pengolahan Kelapa Sawit 	• Menanggung biaya pendidikan penuh untuk program Diploma (D3) di Institut Teknologi dan Sains Bandung (ITSB).\n• Bantuan biaya hidup untuk 10 mahasiswa dengan IPK terbaik setiap semester.\n• Kesempatan magang di lokasi perkebunan/operasional Sinar Mas Agribusiness and Food.\n• Kesempatan bekerja di Sinar Mas Agribusiness and Food (PT SMART Tbk) setelah lulus kuliah.\n• Program ini gratis pendaftaran dan tidak ada biaya seleksi apapun.	1. Untuk pelamar Beasiswa SMART Mills:\n2. Lulusan SMA/MAN IPA atau SMK Mekanikal/Elektrikal.\n3. Untuk pelamar Beasiswa SMART Agro:\n4. Lulusan SMA/MAN IPA atau SMK Pertanian/SPP/SPMA.\n5. Berusia maksimal 20 tahun (lulusan SMA/SMK/MA tahun sebelumnya masih bisa mendaftar).\n6. Tinggi badan minimal 165 cm.\n7. Tidak buta warna, baik total maupun parsial.\n8. Lulus seluruh proses seleksi yang diadakan oleh Sinar Mas Agribusiness and Food dan ITSB.\n9. Lulus tes kesehatan	indbeasiswa	https://indbeasiswa.com/beasiswa-sinar-mas/	https://indbeasiswa.com/beasiswa-sinar-mas/	[-0.06640625,0.039520264,0.0259552,-0.0017309189,-0.009674072,-0.01953125,-0.029220581,0.0413208,0.019439697,-0.024795532,0.0003478527,-0.049865723,-0.040100098,0.014778137,0.01828003,0.008300781,-0.020706177,-0.009246826,-0.0027427673,-0.007411957,0.027999878,0.03933716,-0.017364502,0.007423401,0.01991272,-0.059692383,0.0008201599,-0.00013267994,0.018615723,0.014274597,0.012458801,-0.017852783,-0.024642944,-0.0056152344,-0.010604858,0.0071411133,0.009590149,-0.0077667236,-0.0009126663,-0.035736084,-0.0435791,-0.040496826,-0.028411865,-0.03161621,0.062286377,0.021057129,-0.035491943,0.0052833557,0.02520752,0.031829834,-0.0066184998,-0.00944519,0.050964355,0.012573242,-0.008201599,0.055145264,-0.014022827,0.0032081604,0.027954102,-0.00953