529	Beasiswa IDCloudHost 2026 Kuliah Gratis Sampai Lulus di Telkom University	Asia	Dalam Negeri (Indonesia)	S1	Beasiswa IDCloudHost adalah program kerja sama antara IDCloudHost dan Telkom University yang memberikan bantuan biaya pendidikan bagi calon mahasiswa berprestasi, khususnya di bidang teknologi, untuk mendukung pengembangan talenta digital.	31 Mei 2026	Fully Funded	Fakultas Teknik Elektro (FTE)\nFakultas Rekayasa Industri (FRI)\nFakultas Informatika (FIF)\nFakultas Ekonomi dan Bisnis (FEB)\nFakultas Komunikasi dan Ilmu Sosial (FKS)\nFakultas Industri Kreatif (FIK)\nFakultas Ilmu Terapan (FIT)	• Gratis biaya pendaftaran \n• Gratis seluruh biasa kuliah selama 4 tahun di Telkom University hingga lulus\n• Kesempatan magang hingga peluang bekerja di IDCloudHost untuk mengembangkan keterampilan dan pengalaman profesional di Industri Teknologi\n• Kesempatan membangun jaringan profesional di industri teknologi melalui workshop, seminar dan komunitas IDCloudHost	1. Program besiswa ini dibuka bagi Siswa/I lulusan SMA/SMK/MA Sederajat kelas 12 (yang akan lulus tahun 2026)\n2. Beasiswa ini juga dapat diikutin lulusan SMA/SMK/MA Sederajat (gap year) tahun 2022,2023,2024, dan 2025	indbeasiswa	https://indbeasiswa.com/beasiswa-idcloudhost/	https://indbeasiswa.com/beasiswa-idcloudhost/	[-0.06286621,-0.018432617,0.01361084,0.0155181885,0.0026855469,-0.022277832,-0.04437256,0.04724121,-0.026748657,-0.049438477,0.029754639,-0.020111084,-0.019836426,-0.03616333,0.04071045,-0.0052757263,-0.026641846,0.004070282,-0.020751953,0.023330688,0.0067253113,0.0029449463,-0.019073486,-0.0077056885,0.013008118,-0.04446411,-0.044311523,0.006477356,0.008895874,-0.0030555725,0.0016536713,-0.030212402,-0.003932953,-0.02645874,0.029327393,0.03866577,0.011856079,0.005596161,0.015426636,0.0010671616,-0.028121948,-0.037139893,0.019210815,-0.01625061,0.009017944,0.036346436,0.0038833618,-0.039642334,0.01977539,0.06298828,0.031707764,-0.02734375,0.044158936,0.017990112,-0.03286743,0.053833008,0.00762