536	Beasiswa BSI Sholarship Unggulan	Asia	Dalam Negeri (Indonesia)	S1	BSI Scholarship Unggulan adalah program beasiswa S1 dari BSI Maslahat dan Bank Syariah Indonesia yang memberikan pembiayaan penuh kuliah dan pembinaan kepemimpinan bagi mahasiswa berprestasi di PTN terbaik hingga lulus.	2026-04-12 00:00:00	Fully Funded	Semua Jurusan	full cover biaya pendidikan dari semester 1 hingga lulus (8 semester)\nuang saku sampai dengan Rp 1.500.000 per bulan selama masa studi\nfasilitas laptop untunk menunjang kebutuhan akademik\nprogram pembinaan kepemimpinan & pengembangan karakter berkelanjutan\nkesempatan magang di industri perbankan & ekonomi syariah	1. mahasiswa baru top 10 perguruan tinggi negeri jalur SNBP atau undangan sejenis\n2. memiliki prestasi akademik unggul\n3. berasal dari keluarga kurang mampu (dibuktikan dengan SKTM/DTKS)\n4. tidak sedang menerima beasiswa sejenis dari lembaga lain\n5. memiliki komitmen untuk mengikuti program pembinaan hingga lulus	beasiswaindo	https://beasiswaindo.com/scholarships/bsi-scholarship-unggulan/	https://linktr.ee/BSI_Scholarship	[-0.03225708,-0.0024356842,0.08135986,0.033050537,-0.0057678223,-0.03817749,-0.031143188,0.049926758,-0.023040771,-0.029632568,0.01725769,-0.040405273,-0.029327393,-0.019699097,0.018936157,0.0368042,0.0035991669,0.018585205,-0.01184082,0.020446777,0.040252686,0.008659363,0.0030708313,0.03262329,0.049926758,-0.053985596,0.010253906,-0.023162842,0.013320923,0.0011396408,0.036010742,-0.0038280487,-0.023147583,0.011917114,-0.0068473816,0.05407715,-0.004627228,-0.007003784,0.01940918,-0.034606934,-0.02659607,-0.041046143,-0.025817871,-0.018127441,0.014320374,0.030548096,0.032592773,-0.03527832,0.0050201416,0.04840088,-0.0066833496,0.025939941,0.066345215,0.026733398,-0.009765625,0.010467529,0.024414062,0.001739502,-0.021011353,-0.040222168,0.028793335,0.025054932,-0.011009216,0.039489746,0.029937744,-0.031982422,-0.01939392,0.032592773,-0.0345459,-0.016845703,0.010932922,0.012634277,0.052215576,-0.02560424