537	Beasiswa Garuda - KEMDIKTISAINTEK	Asia	Dalam Negeri (Indonesia)	S1	Program beasiswa pemerintah untuk pendanaan pendidikan tinggi dalam negeri maupun luar negeri bagi mahasiswa berprestasi.	Gelombang I : 15 Maret 2026\n	Fully Funded	Kesehatan\nKetahanan pangan\nPertahanan\nDigitalisasi\nHilirisasi industri\nMaterial dan manufaktur maju\nMaritim\nEnergi\nBisnis dan ekonomi\nHukum dan kebijakan publik.	Dana Pendidikan :\n    • Biaya Kuliah (tuition fee)\n    • Biaya pendaftaran\n    • Tunjangan Buku\nDana Pendukung :\n    • Biaya Transportasi \n • biaya pengurusan visa \n • asuransii kesehatan\n • biaya kedatangan\n • biaya hidup bulanan \n • dana darurat jika terjadi keadaan tertentu	1. warga negara indonesia yang dibuktikan dengan identitas resmi seperti KK,KTP, atau PASPOR\n2. sedang menempuh kelas 12 SMA/SMK/MA pada tahun ajaran 2025/2026\n3. memiliki eligibilitas mengikuti seleksi naosinal berdasarkan prestasi (SNBP) yang dibuktikan dengan surat \n   keterangan dari kepala sekolah\n4. memilki sertifikat kemampuan bahasa asing yang masih berlaku ( IELTS minimal 6,5 ; TOELF iBT minimal 80; \n   PTE Academic minimal 58)\n5. melampirkan hasil IQ dengan skor minimal 110	beasiswaindo	https://beasiswaindo.com/scholarships/beasiswa-garuda-kemdiktisaintek/	https://beasiswagaruda.kemdiktisaintek.go.id/	[-0.03878784,0.01739502,0.044281006,0.026626587,-0.03111267,-0.016738892,-0.046142578,0.06542969,0.037597656,-0.015617371,0.015274048,-0.031204224,-0.0149383545,-0.05029297,0.012245178,0.033050537,-0.010116577,-0.016189575,-0.007255554,0.048065186,0.0012369156,0.019180298,-0.0368042,0.0064201355,0.04458618,-0.040496826,0.00356102,-0.020477295,0.014656067,-0.024353027,0.055847168,-0.014167786,-0.00869751,-0.020736694,-0.017807007,0.044555664,-0.019317627,-0.0043563843,-0.011581421,-0.046783447,-0.040527344,-0.07019043,-0.07366943,-0.018875122,0.007949829,0.041625977,-0.010902405,-0.020690918,0.04660034,0.032714844,-0.045440674,0.02142334,0.06298828,0.059814453,0.016403198,