555	beasiswa kartu indonesia pintar kuliah (KIP Kuliah)	Asia	Dalam Negeri (Indonesia)	D3, D4,S1	Program Beasiswa	31 oktober 2026	Fully Funded, \nPartially Funded	Semua Jurusan	Biaya Pendidikan Full Sampai Lulus\nBiaya Hidup Bulanan\nBiaya Pendaftaran Seleksi Masuk Perguruan Tinggi	Siswa Sekolah Menengah Atas (SMA), Sekolah Menengah Kejuruan (SMK), Madrasah Aliyah (MA) atau sederajat yang akan lulus pada tahun penyelenggaraan program atau telah lulus maksimal 2 tahun yang lalu.\nMemiliki potensi akademik yang baik dan keterbatasan ekonomi dibuktikan dengan pendapatan kotor gabungan orang tua atau wali paling banyak Rp4.000.000 setiap bulan atau pendapatan kotor gabungan orang tua atau wali dibagi jumlah anggota keluarga paling banyak Rp750.000.\nTelah lulus seleksi penerimaan mahasiswa baru di Perguruan Tinggi Negeri (PTN) atau Perguruan Tinggi Swasta (PTS) di program studi yang telah terakreditasi A atau B. Mahasiswa baru yang diterima di program studi terakreditasi C diperbolehkan untuk mendaftar dengan pertimbangan tertentu.	luarkampus.id	https://luarkampus.id/beasiswa/781	https://kip-kuliah.kemdiktisaintek.go.id/siswa/auth/login	[-0.070251465,-0.013153076,0.03137207,0.015838623,0.005722046,-0.01939392,-0.017471313,0.06137085,0.017410278,-0.02734375,0.023849487,-0.027435303,-0.05606079,-0.00045371056,0.026489258,-0.0057792664,0.0022354126,-0.003168106,-0.009460449,0.03857422,0.005268097,0.017959595,-0.022079468,-0.0045928955,0.042510986,-0.06036377,-0.002363205,-0.038208008,0.00869751,-0.010147095,0.026489258,-0.01084137,-0.023635864,-0.02079773,-0.028900146,0.038391113,-0.00818634,-0.005054474,0.0024929047,-0.06237793,-0.033325195,-0.021392822,-0.034484863,-0.033996582,0.022872925,0.04547119,-0.029052734,-0.002702713,0.022750854,0.040618896,-0.021392822,0.0023727417,0.07672119,0.03967285,-0.01763916,0.072021484,0.017181396,-0.025665283,0.015411377,-0.020065308,0.05834961,0.049072266,0.020126343,0.0074653625,-0.009597778,0.0011501312,-0.049621582,0.016815186,0.001