569	Beasiswa AFS Effect + for the classroom Pembelajaran Online Untuk Guru SMA Sederajat	Asia	Dalam Negeri (Indonesia)	S1	Program pertukaran pelajar internasional dari AFS Intercultural Programs yang menyediakan beasiswa dan pengembangan kepemimpinan global.	14 Januari 2026	Fully Funded	Semua Jurusan	Mendapatkan sertifikat internasional\nAkses sumber daya pengajaran tentang SDGs dan pendidikan kewarganegaraan global (modul interaktif, video, kuis, slide)\nSesi live online dengan rekan global\nForum diskusi dengan guru dari berbagai negara\nPengalaman metode pengajaran yang berbeda\nDibimbing fasilitator AFS\nKesempatan mendapat pengakuan internasional atas proyek sosial siswa terkait SDGs	Guru SMA/sederajat (usia siswa 14–18 tahun), semua bidang studi\nBelum pernah ikut Global STEM Educators atau Global Up Educator\nMampu mengikuti program dalam bahasa Inggris\nTertarik pada pendidikan global & pembangunan berkelanjutan\nMemiliki minat berinteraksi lintas budaya\nBersedia mengikuti program ±2–3 jam/minggu selama 6 minggu\nMemiliki perangkat (HP/laptop) untuk akses program\nMemiliki webcam & mikrofon\nKoneksi internet stabil	indbeasiswa	https://indbeasiswa.com/beasiswa-afs-effect/	https://indbeasiswa.com/beasiswa-afs-effect/	[-0.054779053,0.007987976,0.033996582,0.047424316,-0.03451538,-0.025009155,-0.022003174,0.021636963,0.0158844,-0.0014076233,0.03286743,-0.0579834,-0.026733398,-0.04876709,-0.013618469,0.009490967,-0.028549194,-0.008460999,-0.02078247,-0.0072364807,0.00749588,0.0029525757,-0.038330078,0.063964844,0.038269043,-0.062072754,0.0010719299,0.008857727,-0.018569946,-0.0077209473,0.036193848,-0.009902954,-0.014518738,-0.01133728,-0.0060539246,0.011360168,-0.0044937134,0.011383057,0.020568848,-0.05908203,-0.015640259,-0.04425049,-0.010902405,0.014160156,0.014678955,0.04650879,-0.0024909973,-0.016693115,0.05606079,0.040893555,-0.010154724,0.0052261353,0.08013916,0.043029785,0.0066223145,0.03414917,-0.01689148,0.004589081,0.0029659271,0.025375366,0.01638794,