572	Beasiswa ILF 2026 Bantuan Biaya Kuliah untuk Calon Mahasiswa Kristen dan Katolik 	Asia	Dalam Negeri (Indonesia)	S1	Bagi kamu lulusan SMA/SMK/Sederajat yang beragama Kristen atau Katolik, ada tawaran Beasiswa ILF untuk melanjutkan kuliah S1 di berbagai universitas di Indonesia yang bisa kamu coba! Program ILF Scholarship 2026 ditawarkan oleh Indonesian Leadership Foundation (ILF) bagi lulusan...	2026-04-15 00:00:00	Fully Funded	Semua Jurusan	Bantuan biaya kuliah (SPP/UKT) per semester sampai maksimal 8 semester (S1).\nPenerima beasiswa harus mempertahankan IPS minimal 3,0 setiap semester agar bantuan tetap berjalan.	Warga Negara Indonesia.\nBeragama Kristen atau Katolik.\nLulusan SMA/SMK/sederajat 2025 atau maksimal 2 tahun sebelumnya (2023, 2024).\nTidak sedang atau pernah menjalani perkuliahan di perguruan tinggi sebelumnya.\nMempunyai keterbatasan finansial namun potensi akademik dan kepemimpinan yang baik.\nBersedia menjadi relawan paruh waktu ILF selama minimal 1 tahun setelah lulus kuliah.\nMengisi formulir pendaftaran lengkap dan menyertakan semua dokumen yang diminta.	indbeasiswa	https://indbeasiswa.com/beasiswa-kuliah-s1-ilf-lulusan-sma-smk/	https://indbeasiswa.com/beasiswa-kuliah-s1-ilf-lulusan-sma-smk/	[-0.06506348,0.0027160645,0.05758667,0.0022010803,-0.03552246,-0.05203247,-0.018325806,0.04421997,-0.0012407303,-0.018478394,0.016662598,-0.020233154,-0.045837402,-0.006198883,0.044921875,0.0015621185,0.028915405,-0.014511108,-0.032928467,0.045562744,0.031280518,-0.0033817291,-0.04638672,0.021743774,0.025009155,-0.08148193,-0.00592041,-0.004234314,-0.013214111,-0.011604309,0.033996582,-0.014694214,-0.034362793,0.0055274963,-0.032440186,0.04989624,0.0047950745,-0.016708374,-0.014259338,-0.039978027,-0.019226074,-0.039733887,-0.008613586,-0.01058197,0.021942139,0.024337769,0.02229309,0.023529053,0.01184845,0.022399902,-0.0077209473,0.00091409683,0.046051025,0.0647583,-0.034057617,0.068115234,0.045288086,0.010772705,-0.0024909973,-0.00497818,0.051330566,0.0