573	Beasiswa S2 Kominfo Dalam Negeri Tahun 2024 untuk Masyarakat Umum dan PNS/TNI/POLRI	Asia	Dalam Negeri (Indonesia)	S2	Beasiswa magister dari Kementerian Komunikasi dan Informatika untuk bidang teknologi informasi dan komunikasi.	26 Juli 2024	Fully Funded	Semua Jurusan	Dana Pendidikan meliputi:\na. Biaya Pendidikan / Tuition Fee (SPP)\nb. Tunjangan Buku\nDana Pendukung meliputi:\na. Biaya Operasional Bulanan (transportasi, biaya hidup, dll)\nb. Bantuan Seminar dan/atau Publikasi Jurnal\nc. Biaya Pendaftaran (jika ada)\nDana Keadaan Darurat (apabila terjadi keadaan darurat)	Warga Negara Indonesia (WNI)\nMasih aktif bekerja dan memiliki masa kerja minimal 2 tahun\nBukan dosen\nUsia maksimal:\n35 tahun (umum)\n37 tahun (PNS/TNI/POLRI)\nBelum memiliki gelar S2\nIPK minimal 3.00\nRencana tugas akhir (500–1000 kata)\nEssay personal statement & kontribusi (500–1000 kata)\nSurat rekomendasi\nSurat izin atasan\nDiutamakan punya LoA\nLulusan luar negeri wajib penyetaraan ijazah\nMemenuhi syarat kampus tujuan\n\nSurat izin pejabat berwenang\nPekerjaan relevan dengan bidang studi\nTidak sedang/habis terkena hukuman disiplin\nMemenuhi aturan tugas belajar ASN	indbeasiswa	https://indbeasiswa.com/beasiswa-s2-kominfo/	https://indbeasiswa.com/beasiswa-s2-kominfo/	[-0.024978638,-0.0016651154,0.0062026978,-0.026611328,-0.031204224,-0.053619385,-0.017227173,0.045013428,-0.01889038,-0.015396118,0.034423828,-0.0032310486,-0.036712646,-0.0025157928,0.023803711,-0.039916992,-0.019744873,-0.008728027,0.011657715,0.009300232,-0.0128479,0.0007004738,-0.033691406,-0.01322937,0.025726318,-0.06097412,-0.023880005,-0.0044784546,0.023803711,-0.022415161,0.030960083,-0.025421143,-0.023468018,-0.020217896,0.035064697,0.048065186,0.01474762,-0.0065956116,0.017562866,-0.027191162,-0.013198853,-0.03515625,-0.006385803,-0.008972168,0.02017212,0.0151901245,-0.018585205,0.031677246,0.012008667,0.042755127,0.010765076,0.008354187,0.048461914,0.038208008,-0.03152466,0.062286377,0.0040283203,-0.021087646,-