587	 Beasiswa Gerak Tumbuh 2026	Asia	Dalam Negeri (Indonesia)	S1,S2,S3	Selamat datang di pendaftaran resmi Beasiswa Gerak Tumbuh 2026, program beasiswa yang hadir untuk mendukung perjalanan pendidikan dan self-growth Gen Z Indonesia agar bisa tumbuh tanpa terhambat oleh kondisi finansial.	31 Mei 2026	Partially Funded	Semua Jurusan	Menyediakan dukungan finansial pendidikan hingga Rp20.000.000 per semester.	Terbuka untuk semua jenjang (SD hingga umum)\nTanpa syarat nilai/IPK\nWarga Negara Indonesia\nBoleh sedang menerima beasiswa lain\nMemiliki komitmen untuk berkembang	Tiktok	https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSfDTNIXBbg9uzCswLwiSGAhDKzv13spIThDjVwxwEYKE7FVqw/viewform	https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSfDTNIXBbg9uzCswLwiSGAhDKzv13spIThDjVwxwEYKE7FVqw/viewform	[-0.037231445,0.023620605,0.042266846,0.045837402,-0.05114746,-0.03765869,-0.017181396,0.066833496,0.0138168335,-0.028915405,0.00982666,-0.01159668,-0.027267456,-0.052001953,-0.014541626,0.008506775,-0.0040283203,-0.01979065,-0.04135132,0.007671356,0.011222839,0.021865845,-0.031234741,-0.02508545,0.054718018,-0.05996704,-0.025283813,0.007598877,-0.0057296753,-0.025741577,0.0063056946,-0.01637268,-0.032806396,-0.017913818,-0.023605347,0.03289795,-0.0056037903,0.016586304,0.026855469,-0.016937256,-0.056152344,-0.04309082,-0.0149383545,0.042266846,0.016937256,0.076416016,-0.020401001,0.009506226,0.0058670044,0.041870117,-0.0028362274,-0.025894165,0.032226562,0.052612305,-0.021697998,0.050994873,0.026260376,-0.019485474,-0.029129028,-0.022354126,0.040039062,0.0206604,0.0059127808,0.002828598,0.02973938,-0.00919342,-0.046539307,0.0051956177,-0.029159546,-0.004753113,-0.013534546,0.012298584,-0.01473999,-0.011314392,-0.01675415,0.02130127,0.007774353,-0.009361267,0.018630981,-0.007843018,-0.019836426,-0.027282715,-0.035583496,0.00012648106,0.02267456,0.012702942,-0.034301758,-0.07476807,-0.051330566,-0.0065994263,-0.009994507,-0.02684021,-0.09222412,0.050994873,0.038482666,-0.026397705,0.011619568,-0.0070