589	Beasiswa FPU 2026	Asia	Dalam Negeri (Indonesia)	S1,S2	Beasiswa FPU (Festival Pelajar Unggulan) menawarkan sebuah program dukungan pendidikan yang dirancang untuk membantu dan mengembangkan potensi generasi muda Indonesia. Inisiatif ini merupakan kesempatan emas bagi siapa saja yang ingin melanjutkan pendidikan tanpa terbebani oleh biaya.	01 Agustus 2026	Fully Funded	Semua Jurusan	Bantuan dana pendidikan untuk pembayaran SPP atau UKT\nUang saku per semester yang diberikan hingga masa studi berakhir\nFasilitas laptop sebagai penunjang kegiatan belajar\nKesempatan mengikuti program fully funded tingkat nasional maupun internasional yang diselenggarakan oleh Festival Pelajar Unggulan	WNI\nTerbuka SMP–mahasiswa\nKomitmen & motivasi\nAktivitas media sosial (follow, share, twibbon)\nIsi form & upload berkas	Tiktok	https://www.festivalpelajar.id/	https://www.festivalpelajar.id/	[-0.06088257,0.00019621849,0.031066895,0.0053215027,-0.016113281,-0.049102783,-0.038024902,0.07672119,0.016067505,-0.025436401,0.01234436,-0.03363037,-0.050628662,-0.040161133,0.016189575,0.013893127,-0.016311646,-0.010551453,-0.0140686035,0.010215759,-0.0045776367,-0.023223877,-0.05279541,0.0021648407,0.01576233,-0.05166626,-0.01966858,0.023086548,-0.032714844,0.016418457,0.023727417,-0.022094727,-0.016937256,0.0054969788,-0.01651001,0.028335571,0.005264282,0.017913818,-0.006126404,-0.024627686,-0.02053833,-0.061584473,-0.017547607,-0.014862061,0.044555664,0.045318604,-0.0059051514,0.01184082,0.007987976,0.038391113,0.005207062,0.008880615,0.048553467,0.03744507,0.0005288124,0.039276123,0.024139404,-0.030670166,-0.016555786,-0.040496826,0.03491211,0.061309814,-0.00233078,0.02293396,0.02885437,-0.01398468,-0.0072364807,0.019577026,-0.025497437,0.015625,-0.013153076,0.01272583,0.012817383,-0.07757568,-0.004989624,0.06677246,0.015640259,0.015823364,-0.0075645447,0.004676819,-0.029449463,-0.018493652,-0.038116455,-0.0008625984,0.0317688,-0.03378296,-0.074157715,-0.024627686,-0.05432129,-0.010810852,