597	Beasiswa S2 UGM Tahun 2026 Potongan Biaya UKT hingga 75% untuk Lulusan S1 PTN/PTS	Asia	Dalam Negeri (Indonesia)	S2	Beasiswa S2 UGM adalah program bantuan pendidikan dari Sekolah Pascasarjana UGM yang memberikan potongan biaya kuliah (UKT) hingga sekitar 25–75% bagi lulusan S1 untuk melanjutkan studi magister di berbagai bidang multidisiplin. 	30 Juni 2026	Partially Funded	Agama dan Lintas Budaya (termasuk minat Ekonomi Islam)\nBioteknologi\nIlmu Lingkungan (Geo Informasi, Pengelolaan Lingkungan, dll)\nKajian Budaya dan Media (termasuk Manajemen Informasi & Perpustakaan)\nKajian Pariwisata\nKependudukan\nStudi Kebijakan\nKetahanan Nasional\nManajemen Bencana\nPenyuluhan dan Komunikasi Pembangunan\nPengelolaan Infrastruktur & Pembangunan Masyarakat\nManajemen Pendidikan Tinggi	• Mahasiswa yang lolos seleksi akan mendapatkan bantuan beasiswa dalam bentuk Potongan Uang Kuliah Tunggal (UKT) sebesar 25% atau 50% atau 75%	1. Bukti pendaftaran pada salah satu program studi S2 di SPs (Sekolah Pascasarjana) UGM Periode Gasal 2026/2027\n2. Ijazah S1 Tahun 2024, 2025, dan 2026 dari 	indbeasiswa	https://indbeasiswa.com/beasiswa-s2-ugm/	https://indbeasiswa.com/beasiswa-s2-ugm/	[-0.050720215,0.0178833,0.06530762,-0.011642456,-0.054534912,-0.017425537,-0.021972656,0.055389404,0.009925842,-0.010902405,0.0009417534,-0.014762878,-0.036254883,-0.007133484,0.0013275146,-0.008575439,0.017242432,-0.02684021,-0.033996582,0.01259613,0.011116028,0.019180298,-0.012939453,0.039886475,-0.004840851,-0.055023193,0.016189575,0.012519836,-0.018707275,0.0043754578,0.0390625,-0.030715942,0.0075912476,-0.024414062,-0.034576416,0.058624268,-0.0068130493,0.02104187,0.009841919,-0.026611328,-0.042144775,-0.03945923,-0.023880005,-0.028625488,0.04324341,0.028778076,-0.014228821,-0.024749756,0.012893677,0.024002075,0.021865845,-0.017547607,0.047790527,0.06124878,0.010025024,0.028457642,0.00071048737,-0.012237549,0.025039673,-0.07006836,0.027267456,0.044525146,0.040100098,0.03878784,0.029190063,-0.022262