599	Beasiswa Pendidikan LUMINA 2026	Asia	Dalam Negeri (Indonesia)	SMA, S1	Beasiswa Pendidikan Lumina 2026 adalah program dari Yayasan Lumina yang memberikan dukungan pendidikan dan pembinaan bagi mahasiswi berprestasi yang memiliki motivasi tinggi serta berkomitmen menjadi volunteer teacher untuk berkontribusi dalam pendidikan masyarakat.	2026-04-06 00:00:00	Partially Funded	Pendidikan/Guru	Uang saku\nTempat tinggal (asrama)\nProgram pengembangan diri (karakter, bahasa Inggris, seminar, workshop, karier)	Siswi kelas 12 atau lulusan SMA/SMK/MA (2024–2026)\nSudah diterima di universitas mitra\nMemiliki motivasi belajar tinggi\nBersedia menjadi volunteer teacher\nNilai tambah: kemampuan bahasa Inggris\nMelampirkan rapor/KHS, sertifikat, dan bukti SNBP/SNBT atau KTM	Tiktok	https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSfr0LFU70M44bIrpck5OKGRsa8AflnXYMqTVRDufQNnicddYw/viewform?pli=1	https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSfr0LFU70M44bIrpck5OKGRsa8AflnXYMqTVRDufQNnicddYw/viewform?pli=1	[-0.024169922,-0.007835388,0.03451538,0.01991272,0.00049972534,-0.018814087,-0.032440186,0.022628784,-0.010635376,-0.02960205,-0.008155823,-0.014884949,-0.024230957,-0.04550171,0.022064209,0.051239014,-0.019729614,-0.007873535,-0.016708374,0.04232788,0.007858276,-0.010658264,0.01626587,0.019195557,0.018325806,-0.05355835,-0.015586853,0.0053482056,-0.010421753,0.004207611,0.018981934,-0.017227173,0.00573349,-0.022277832,-0.014144897,0.040893555,0.0143966675,-0.0027770996,0.010925293,-0.047210693,-0.06488037,-0.059539795,-0.011909485,0.01537323,0.02810669,0.0619812,-0.026763916,-0.023849487,0.0418396,0.08538818,-0.0044670105,-0.0005106926,0.0619812,0.07092285,-0.039154053,0.018569946,0.007507324,-0.012046814,-0.015686035,-0.00831604,0.044311523,0.040496826,0.0012140274,0.018676758,-0.010017395,-0.017181396,-0.0068473816,-0.0033073425,-0.01600647,0.013160706,0.017669678,-0.004547119,0.06817627,-0.00088739395,0.0029678345,0.02960205,0.02986145,0.030212402,-0.002872467,0.024749756,-0.017089844,-0.0