600	Beasiswa AFRINA 2026	Asia	Dalam Negeri (Indonesia)	S1	Afrina Scholarship adalah program beasiswa dari Afrina Academy yang memberikan bantuan biaya pendidikan bagi calon mahasiswa dan mahasiswa aktif jenjang S1 di PTN Indonesia, dengan fokus pada dukungan bagi mahasiswa berprestasi yang memiliki keterbatasan finansial serta kontribusi sosial.	2026-04-30 00:00:00	Partially Funded	Semua Jurusan	Bantuan biaya UKT/SPP selama masa studi\nProgram pengembangan diri dan akademik\nAkses jaringan dan komunitas	Siswa kelas 12 atau mahasiswa aktif D3/D4/S1\nMemiliki keterbatasan ekonomi/akses pendidikan\nSemester 1–8 (tidak pernah cuti)\nMemiliki/merencanakan kontribusi sosial\nFollow IG @afrinaacademy & ajak 5 teman\nMelampirkan dokumen (rapor/KHS, dll)	Tiktok	https://santrihub.id/beasiswa/afrina-scholarship/	https://santrihub.id/beasiswa/afrina-scholarship/	[-0.04373169,0.006755829,0.058624268,0.02558899,0.013946533,-0.031982422,0.014602661,0.065979004,-0.025253296,-0.011802673,-0.012893677,-0.02168274,-0.017532349,-0.02746582,0.003414154,0.0345459,-0.014343262,0.00046348572,-0.003786087,0.051696777,0.038970947,0.0072250366,-0.009902954,-0.012123108,0.032989502,-0.057556152,0.0039901733,-0.020828247,-0.041534424,-0.0029392242,0.04257202,-0.013748169,-0.03591919,0.010917664,0.001405716,0.022857666,0.009170532,-0.027420044,0.007587433,-0.04473877,-0.037963867,-0.043792725,-0.034484863,-0.005065918,0.040252686,0.055236816,-0.014228821,-0.0022277832,0.021087646,0.051727295,0.011138916,-0.0049591064,0.031585693,0.04977417,0.0064468384,0.07080078,0.03274536,-0.027786255,-0.013679504,-0.030807495,0.028259277,0.022537231,-0.0075302124,0.057250977,0.0043907166,-0.008979797,-0.0137786865,0.029327393,-0.010917664,0.0023956299,-0.020736694,0.0013504028,0.0362854,-0.028778076,-0.019592285,0.029907227,0.0029792786,0.010139465,-0.0030708313,0.0052337646,-0.008354187,0.012573242,-0.032562256,0.0259552,0.02949524,-0.019592285,-0.07305908,0.0054473877,-0.050872803,-0.021652222,-0.0042381287