601	Beasiswa LPDP Akselerasi Magister	Asia	Dalam Negeri (Indonesia)	S1,S2	Beasiswa Akselerasi Magister dari LPDP adalah program beasiswa bagi mahasiswa S1 aktif untuk mengikuti program internasionalisasi selama sarjana dan melanjutkan studi magister (S2) di luar negeri secara terintegrasi.	23 Februari 2026	Fully Funded	Semua Jurusan	Biaya pendidikan (tuition, pendaftaran, buku)\nBiaya hidup bulanan\nTransportasi & visa\nAsuransi kesehatan\nDana penelitian, seminar, dan publikasi\nPendanaan tahap internasionalisasi + studi S2	WNI dan mahasiswa aktif S1 (belum lulus)\nMinimal sudah kuliah ±1,5 tahun\nIPK ≥ 3.25\nTop 10 terbaik di program studi\nMemiliki sertifikat bahasa Inggris\nMendapat rekomendasi kampus	Tiktok	https://lpdp.kemenkeu.go.id/beasiswa/beasiswa-akselerasi-magister/sarjana-akselerasi-magister	https://lpdp.kemenkeu.go.id/beasiswa/beasiswa-akselerasi-magister/sarjana-akselerasi-magister	[-0.029312134,0.017730713,0.03353882,-0.014373779,-0.045715332,-0.015464783,-0.017211914,0.0519104,0.03543091,-0.00680542,-0.0061569214,-0.02394104,-0.052856445,-0.025512695,-0.008758545,-0.0017089844,0.017730713,-0.022750854,-0.029296875,0.0024433136,-0.019012451,0.010269165,0.01928711,0.002817154,0.046051025,-0.054016113,0.037231445,0.004802704,-0.02255249,-0.0063552856,0.013542175,-0.02571106,-0.011558533,0.013389587,-0.036315918,0.035949707,0.020324707,-0.00774765,0.009017944,-0.043914795,-0.023254395,-0.035003662,-0.06604004,-0.0073127747,0.061523438,0.04421997,-0.0018472672,-0.0028972626,0.039367676,0.03692627,-0.03375244,0.02986145,0.074523926,0.09033203,-0.0059165955,0.04748535,0.049835205,-0.010848999,0.047973633,-0.042419434,0.05581665,0.039611816,-0.0048980713,0.010345459,0.019958496,-0.026306152,-0.048217773,0.015991211,-0.03845215,0.006591797,0.03753662,-0.0074768066,-0.017150879,-0.025512695,-0.039733887,0.031402588,0.0043182373,0.029296875,0.0022144318,0.01826477,-0.045562744,-0.0128479,-0.018875122,-0.019348145,0.003835678,-0.019424438,-0.03881836,-0.0048980