602	Beasiswa SHARE (Social, Humanities, Art for People, Religious Studies, Economics)	Asia	Dalam Negeri (Indonesia)	S2,S3	Beasiswa SHARE adalah program dari Lembaga Pengelola Dana Pendidikan yang mendanai studi magister dan doktor di dalam maupun luar negeri dengan fokus pada bidang sosial, humaniora, seni, keagamaan, ekonomi, dan pendidikan untuk mencetak SDM unggul Indonesia.	23 Februari 2026	Fully Funded	Sosial & humaniora\nSeni & budaya\nKeagamaan\nEkonomi & pendidikan	Biaya pendidikan (tuition/UKT, pendaftaran, buku)\nDana penelitian, seminar, dan publikasi\nBiaya hidup bulanan\nTransportasi & visa\nAsuransi kesehatan\nDana kedatangan & keadaan darurat	Warga Negara Indonesia (WNI)\nLulusan S1 (untuk S2) / S2 (untuk S3)\nIPK minimal (±3.0 S2, ±3.25 S3)\nSertifikat bahasa Inggris (untuk luar negeri)\nMemiliki LoA (wajib LN, opsional DN)\nMenyusun esai, rencana studi, dan kontribusi untuk Indonesia	Tiktok	https://lpdp.kemenkeu.go.id/beasiswa/beasiswa-share/beasiswa-share	https://lpdp.kemenkeu.go.id/beasiswa/beasiswa-share/beasiswa-share	[-0.030441284,-0.020187378,0.033355713,0.02015686,-0.03111267,-0.026397705,-0.031829834,0.078430176,-0.006965637,-0.03994751,0.013885498,-0.054595947,-0.025909424,-0.033050537,0.00434494,0.002117157,-0.006374359,-0.012527466,0.015625,0.028839111,-0.0010175705,0.014450073,0.022903442,0.021270752,0.044403076,-0.043395996,0.021713257,-0.013214111,-0.020629883,0.0064086914,0.053771973,-0.027389526,0.016143799,0.0050849915,-0.048095703,0.030349731,-0.024398804,-0.010299683,0.033691406,-0.06439209,-0.026535034,-0.03567505,-0.013793945,-0.0044822693,0.047821045,0.052459717,-0.020690918,-0.04159546,0.016616821,0.019805908,-0.014953613,0.011405945,0.04397583,0.048950195,-0.008712769,0.051879883,0.027542114,-0.02519226,-0.0048599243,-0.06726074,0.058502197,0.043914795,-0.00047039986,0.033813477,0.032562256,-0.0062332153,-0.05117798,0.021438599,-0.041625977,-0.03451538,0.013038635,0.027770996,-0.005065918,-0.058746338,-0.022979736,0.024215698