603	Beasiswa LPDP Akselerasi pada Universitas Unggulan	Asia	Dalam Negeri (Indonesia)	S2,S3	Beasiswa Akselerasi Universitas Unggulan adalah program dari LPDP yang mendanai studi magister (S2) dan doktor (S3) di universitas unggulan dunia bagi WNI untuk mempercepat pengembangan talenta unggul Indonesia.	27 Maret 2026	Fully Funded	Teknologi & engineering\nDigital & sains\nEkonomi & bisnis\nKebijakan publik\nSosial, seni, dan lainnya	Biaya pendidikan (tuition, pendaftaran, buku)\nDana penelitian, seminar, dan publikasi\nBiaya hidup bulanan\nTransportasi & visa\nAsuransi kesehatan\nDana kedatangan & keadaan darurat\nTunjangan keluarga (khusus doktor)	Warga Negara Indonesia\nLulusan S1 (untuk S2) / S2 (untuk S3)\nMemiliki atau mendaftar ke universitas tujuan (LoA opsional/mandatory tergantung jenjang)\nMemenuhi batas usia (±35 S2, ±40 S3)\nSertifikat bahasa Inggris (jika belum LoA)\nMenyusun esai, rencana studi, dan kontribusi untuk Indonesia	Tiktok	https://lpdp.kemenkeu.go.id/beasiswa/beasiswa-akselerasi-pada-universitas-unggulan/beasiswa-akselerasi-universitas-unggulan	https://lpdp.kemenkeu.go.id/beasiswa/beasiswa-akselerasi-pada-universitas-unggulan/beasiswa-akselerasi-universitas-unggulan	[-0.036376953,-0.0008010864,0.042175293,-0.01121521,-0.011962891,-0.015640259,-0.03262329,0.05279541,0.020126343,-0.024124146,-0.00831604,-0.028366089,-0.055908203,-0.030227661,0.00039958954,-0.014213562,0.016082764,-0.029342651,-0.03366089,0.016693115,-0.02909851,0.002483368,0.025558472,0.008995056,0.028717041,-0.06768799,0.04244995,0.013618469,-0.03186035,-0.0012168884,0.026641846,-0.026916504,0.0034008026,0.004184723,-0.03717041,0.045684814,0.007255554,0.0049552917,0.0042648315,-0.050445557,-0.017211914,-0.05267334,-0.059417725,-0.016540527,0.053619385,0.034332275,-0.0006017685,-0.01020813,0.019195557,0.047546387,-0.0040245056,0.039367676,0.0715332,0.062072754,-0.013404846,0.060333252,0.05529785,-0.015090942,0.02746582,-0.06008911,0.05380249,0.02861023,0.017150879,0.029586792,0.01