604	Beasiswa STEM Industri Strategis	Asia	Dalam Negeri (Indonesia)	S2,S3	Beasiswa STEM Industri Strategis adalah program dari LPDP yang mendanai studi magister dan doktor untuk mengembangkan SDM unggul di sektor industri strategis seperti kesehatan, energi, digitalisasi, pertahanan, dan manufaktur.	23 Februari 2026	Fully Funded	Kesehatan\nKetahanan pangan\nEnergi & maritim\nDigital & teknologi\nPertahanan & manufaktur	Biaya pendidikan (tuition, pendaftaran, dll)\nBiaya hidup bulanan\nDana penelitian dan publikasi\nTransportasi & visa\nAsuransi kesehatan\nDana pendukung lainnya (opsional tergantung skema)	Warga Negara Indonesia\nLulusan D4/S1 (untuk S2) atau S2 (untuk S3)\nMemenuhi IPK minimal (±2.5 S2, ±3.0 S3)\nSertifikat bahasa Inggris (terutama untuk luar negeri)\nLoA (opsional/mandatory tergantung jalur)\nDokumen akademik dan rencana studi	Tiktok	https://lpdp.kemenkeu.go.id/beasiswa/beasiswa-stem-industri-strategis/industri-strategis	https://lpdp.kemenkeu.go.id/beasiswa/beasiswa-stem-industri-strategis/industri-strategis	[-0.041625977,0.028381348,0.028686523,-0.026748657,-0.024398804,-0.0066490173,-0.051757812,0.03527832,0.0026760101,-0.010749817,0.033416748,-0.035980225,-0.016326904,-0.044555664,-0.0050354004,-0.008857727,0.0027065277,-0.02848816,-0.020645142,0.020141602,-0.008270264,0.029052734,-0.00032687187,-0.011436462,0.036712646,-0.027252197,0.023880005,-0.022094727,-0.030654907,-0.0035572052,0.049713135,-0.026245117,-0.022827148,-0.01751709,-0.0036201477,0.03527832,0.027679443,0.013580322,0.027008057,-0.01890564,-0.030181885,-0.040985107,-0.042663574,-0.010696411,0.04937744,0.017227173,-0.0047950745,-0.013137817,0.053497314,0.020324707,-0.023986816,0.0259552,0.078186035,0.04144287,-0.0017251968,0.04373169,0.026153564,-0.010650635,0.018966675,-0.023101807,0.067993164,0.017745972,0.03353882,0.01828003,0.0032043457,-0.0012903214,-0.03540039,0.02670288,-0.020950317,-0.033843994,0.011512756,0.002418518,-0.0046844482,-0.028289795,-0.0073242188,0.023086548,0.01