633	Beasiswa ADik (Afirmasi Pendidikan Tinggi)	Asia	Dalam Negeri (Indonesia)	SMA	Panduan Beasiswa Indonesia Bangkit (BIB) S1 Panduan Mendaftar Beasiswa Malaysia International Scholarship	22 Mei 2026	Fully Funded	Semua Jurusan	• Fully Funded\n• Bebas seluruh biaya perkuliahan hingga selesai masa kuliah\n• Bantuan biaya hidup\n• Dukungan studi penuh hingga lulus\n• Pendampingan khusus di kampus	Lainnya Persyaratan Umum: Warga Negara Indonesia (WNI). Termasuk dalam salah satu kategori afirmasi: Wilayah Papua Daerah Khusus/3T (Terdepan, Terluar, Tertinggal) Alumni Program ADEM Anak Pekerja Migran Indonesia (Repatriasi) Lulusan SMA/SMK/MA tahun 2026 atau 2025. Terdaftar melalui: Dinas Pendidikan Prov/Kab/Kota, atau Koordinator ADEM, atau Atase Pendidikan (untuk repatriasi). Memiliki NISN, NPSN, dan NIK yang valid dan terdaftar di Dapodik. Bersedia mengikuti seleksi melalui: Jalur SNBP, atau Jalur UTBK-SNBT, atau Jalur Seleksi Afirmasi ADik. Bersedia ditempatkan di Perguruan Tinggi dan Program Studi sesuai hasil seleksi. Tidak sedang menerima beasiswa pemerintah lain dengan komponen pembiayaan yang sama. Booklet Informasi Selengkapnya	Luarkampus	https://adik.kemdiktisaintek.go.id/	https://adik.kemdiktisaintek.go.id/	[-0.027679443,-0.0003015995,0.06518555,0.046051025,-0.01449585,-0.0040626526,-0.024658203,0.038208008,-0.0065689087,0.0021190643,0.0073509216,-0.05319214,-0.008056641,0.0023078918,-0.0054969788,0.02520752,-0.0011606216,-0.0010404587,-0.0124053955,0.032226562,0.028717041,0.019866943,-0.025344849,0.011047363,0.06512451,-0.047973633,-0.045776367,-0.029403687,-0.0014190674,-0.010375977,0.025558472,-0.019317627,-0.00919342,0.037841797,-0.003124237,0.03765869,0.012756348,-0.020507812,-0.008239746,-0.061645508,-0.053375244,-0.024337769,-0.02986145,0.01184082,0.0046844482,0.057861328,-0.02319336,-0.012077332,0.032287598,0.03152466,-0.018615723,0.015022278,0.0635376,0.08154297,-0.017181396,0.048919678,0.041168213,-0.035125732,-0.009208679,-0.014457703,0.029174805,0.035