645	Beasiswa BESTRO S1-D4 2026	Asia	Dalam Negeri (Indonesia)	S1, D4	Beasiswa BESTRO adalah beasiswa S1/D4 untuk lulusan Gresik yang lolos SNBP/SNBT, ditujukan bagi mahasiswa berprestasi dari keluarga kurang mampu dengan dukungan biaya kuliah, uang saku, dan pengembangan karier.	15 Mei 2026 (SNBP)/15 Juni 2026	Fully Funded	Semua Jurusan	Pembayaran UKT penuh sampai lulus (±8 semester, dokter bisa lebih)\nUang saku bulanan\nPelatihan soft skill\nKesempatan magang (prakerin) di perusahaan	Warga Gresik; lulusan SMA/SMK/MA 2026; diterima PTN jalur SNBP/SNBT; ekonomi kurang mampu; memiliki prestasi; bukan penerima KIP Kuliah/beasiswa lain	Tiktok	https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1tZGmiPVZ9A5soAze9UR4aIyaR6LbkMrR	https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1tZGmiPVZ9A5soAze9UR4aIyaR6LbkMrR	[-0.0491333,0.026153564,0.0524292,0.015716553,-0.057525635,-0.026535034,-0.037872314,0.041381836,-0.015235901,-0.044281006,-0.010597229,-0.014862061,-0.027862549,-0.0005068779,0.0044136047,0.016983032,-0.0069389343,0.021133423,-0.040924072,0.026062012,0.031921387,0.013328552,0.008430481,-0.014480591,0.06732178,-0.039886475,-0.0025100708,-0.021026611,-0.008018494,-0.025009155,0.017608643,-0.02420044,0.013374329,-0.017669678,-0.010604858,0.0134887695,0.0098724365,0.01612854,0.031707764,-0.033843994,-0.033111572,-0.026443481,-0.029556274,0.022109985,0.020080566,0.050842285,-0.011161804,-0.00541687,0.03616333,0.042541504,-0.012786865,-0.00097227097,0.04446411,0.08001709,-0.017105103,0.038360596,0.034179688,-0.0063552856,0.007183075,0.0014219284,0.04574585,0.030838013,0.0135650635,0.010192871,0.013717651,-0.022201538,-0.047821045,0.03314209,-0.04071045,0.0021858215,0.006526947,0.018157959,0.02470398,-0.06524658,-0.016143799,0.037322998,0.047943115,0.039794922,0.02420044,0.018249512,-0.020751953,-0.011268616,-0.01184082,0.00541687,-0.0036640167,-0.04675293,-0.09173584,-0.03945923,-0.024780273,-0.055786133,0.00042653084,-0.06915283,-0.07952881,0.057525635,0.05050659,-0.014198303,-0.0046081543,-0